<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LEV" style="id">- Ndendeule Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Akalabhe</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitabo Cha Akalabhe</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kitabo Cha Akalabhe</para>
  <para style="toc3">Akal</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kitabo Cha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Akalabhe</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabo cha Akalabhe ndi ngonganikila ya malaghalikilo ghibhapilwa bhando bhuku Ichilahele na Bhambo Chapanga kupete Mucha. Malaghalikilo ghanga ghilonge panane jha kupiya matambiko namuna jha kunnyinamii Bhambo Chapanga mu Lihema lya Chapanga. Lilobhe Akalabhe ngita chilijhandikwe kwa kilonge chukutumbula cha Akaichilahele chikigheghite mana ghake, “Ghighapala Akalabhe,” bhando bha likabila lilihaghulilwe na Bhambo Chapanga, lilibhii na mahengo ghukuhenga mahengo gha upiya matambiko na lihengo lya kulonda Nyumba jha Bhambo Chapanga. Kupete mapokelo, bhando bhibhachomite kupete malobhe gha Chapanga, yane Bibuliya, bhihobholela kubhehe kitabo cha Akalabhe na itabo henge ya malaghalikilo na kitabo Chukutumbula na kitabo chu Kubhoka na kitabo cha Kibhalango na kitabo cha Kombokela malaghalikilo ikajhandikwe na nnondole jwa Chapanga Mucha. Uchakaka ghongo ubhonikina mu kitabo chenie, ku nhwalo kitabo cha Akalabhe kitumbuu kukulonge kubhehe, “Bhambo Chapanga akankemite Mucha nu kulonge nako mu Lihema lya Chapanga, Akalabhe 1:1.” Bhange bhihobhole kubhehe pange kitabo chenje kikajhandikwe ngita ngonganikila ya majhandiko gha Makacho, mu kaline jha 5 ade 6, kabula jhukubhelukwa Kilichitu, kipinde chenie Akaichilahele pibhakibha ku ughene, kwenio ku Babele.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pukutumbuu kitabo cha Akalabhe, tuchoma namuna jha litambiko na matambiko ghalaghila Bhambo Chapanga ghighapihwa na akapiya matambiko. Matambiko ghange ngighapiitwa ngita matambiko, ku nhwalo gwa kupepulila uhakaho gwa bhando, na matambiko ghange ghakapiitwa ku upalo gwa bhibhapiita kwa Bhambo Chapanga gwabhe. Mu gheniya ghoha, ukibha nhwalo gwambone hake, kwa litambiko lyapiya mundo lipalwa changalemala. Uchakaka kubhehe nhwilo ghongo ulangii Bhambo Chapanga chabhile jwanyahinyahi. Kwa kujhomolela kwake mu kitabo chenje, kilangii bhando bhuku Ichilahele pamonga na akapiya matambiko chibhahotwii kujheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, pala pibhalemwita. Kilebhe kikolongwa cha kitabo chenje, Bhambo Chapanga ndi jwa nyahinyahi na kuikamu mihilo jhibhii mu kitabo chenje, bhando bhuku Ichilahele ngabhahotola kutama mulonda gwa Bhambo Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ghughabhii mukitabo</para>
  <para style="io">Malaghalikilo ghighapalwa kupiya kila namuna jha matambiko, muchula jha 1 ade 7.</para>
  <para style="io">Kuhaghulilwa kwa Alune namwana mundo kubhehe akapiya matambiko, mu chula jha 8 ade 10.</para>
  <para style="io">Mihilo jhikujheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga na yakulya yangajheketelwa palonge jhake Chapanga pamonga na malwalo, mu chula jha 11 ade 16.</para>
  <para style="io">Malaghalikilo ghange jha kulyegha na minyagho na ichima na yaka ya machigho ghukupehekeya, mu chula jha 17 ade 27.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LEV 1" />
  <para style="s">Matambiko gha kukomelekelwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 1:1" />Bhambo Chapanga ngankemita Mucha, nu kulonge nako kuhumii mu lihema lya kukonganikila na Chapanga, ngannobholila, <verse eid="LEV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 1:2" />“Malobholela Akaichilahele kubhehe, anda mundo apala kumpiikiya Chapanga litambiko lya kinyama, kinyama chenie atola kuhumii mu nchambe gwake gwa ng'ombi amu limbelele amu mbuhe. <verse eid="LEV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 1:3" />Anda mundo jwenio napiya litohe lya ng'ombi lya litambiko lya kukomelekelwa, nahaghula kinyama chankambako changalemala kuhumii mu nchambe gwake, nampiikiya palonge litangala lya kujhingilila ku Lihema lya kukonganikila kupala ajheketelwa na Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 1:4" />Mundo jwenio napalwa kubheka lubhoko lwake pa muto jha kinyama chenie cha litambiko lya kukomelekelwa, yenie naijheketelwa kubhehe ngita litambiko lya kulekekelwa uhakaho gwino ku nhwalo gwake. <verse eid="LEV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 1:5" />Peniya, nanchinja ng'ombi jwenio jwankambako palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, na akapiya matambiko, yana inalome ya Alune, nabhatola myahe na kumichii pande yoha ya chehemo jhu kupiikiya litambiko mu lihema lya kukonganikila. <verse eid="LEV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 1:6" />Mundo jwenio nahanjana kinyama chenio cha litambiko lya kukomelekelwa nu kuheketa ipande. <verse eid="LEV 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 1:7" />Peniya, akapiya matambiko bheniya yana inalome ya Alune, nabhabheka hanjo chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko, nu kukungana mwotu. <verse eid="LEV 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 1:8" />Akapiya matambiko bheniya, nabhatola ipande ya nyama na muto na mahuta, nu kuibheka panane jha hanjo chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko. <verse eid="LEV 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 1:9" />Mundo jwenio jwapihita kinyama nagholola matumbo na magholo gha unyuma gha kinyama chenio, peniya, nampela mpiya litambiko, natiniya chehemo jha kutinikiya litambiko lyenie. Lende ndi litambiko lya kukomelekelwa. Litambiko lya kukomelekelwa, lilibhii na luhumba lwambone lwa kunhalalicha Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 1:10" />“Anda mundo apiya litambiko lyake lya kukomelekelwa kuhumii mu nchambe gwa limbelele amu mbuhe, bhahe, abhoha likambako lyangalemala. <verse eid="LEV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 1:11" />Anchinjila upandi gwa kachikachine chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko, palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, na akapiya matambiko yana inalome ya Alune nabhamichila myahe chehemo jhoha jha kupiikiya litambiko. <verse eid="LEV 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 1:12" />Peniya, mundo jwenio aheketa ipande, nambo muto pamonga na mahuta ghake nabheka puupele, na mpiya litambiko jwenio aibheka pamwotu chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko. <verse eid="LEV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 1:13" />Matumbo na magholo ghake agholola kwa mache. Mpiya matambiko nakomelekeya yoha chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko. Lende ndi litambiko lya kukomelekelwa. Litambiko lya kukomelekelwa, lilibhii na luhumba lwambone lwa kunhalalicha Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 1:14" />“Anda mundo jwenio ampikiya Bhambo Chapanga litambiko lya kukomelekeya lya kijhune, bhahe, naleta litambiko lyake lya ngunda amu lipupo lya ngunda. <verse eid="LEV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 1:15" />Mpiya litambiko naleta kijhune chenio chehemo itengenechwe jha kupiikiya litambiko, nu kuntwenyu ntandala nu kunkomelekeya panane jha mwotu. Myahe jhake naimichilwa mu imbetule ya chehemo jhi kupiikiya litambiko. <verse eid="LEV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 1:16" />Peniya, nabhoha liholilo na uchapo ghonge, na kutaghii upandi ghulihumii lyobha mwa chehemo itengenechwe jha kupiikiya litambiko, pibhataghii maliho. <verse eid="LEV 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 1:17" />Ankamula mapapanilo nu kuhanjana, nambo akoto kuheketa ipande ibhele. Peniya, mpiya litambiko nankomelekeya chehemo itengenechwe jha kupiikiya litambiko, panane jha hanjo. Lende ndi litambiko lya kukomelekelwa, lilibhii na luhumba lwambone lwa kunhalalicha Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LEV 2" />
  <para style="s">Matambiko gha uhembe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 2:1" />“Mundo jhojhoha anda aletite litambiko lya uhembe kwa Bhambo Chapanga, litambiko lyene libha lya uhembe ghutemite. Nahangalana na mahuta na ubane. <verse eid="LEV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 2:2" />Peniya, nabhaletela akampiya matambiko bheniya yana ya Alune. Mpiya litambiko jhumo pakate jhabhe natola lukohe lumo jha uhembe gwenio ghunakutema ghubhii na mahuta na ubane nukukomelekeya kwa mwotu chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko, libhaha litambiko lya ukombokelo gwa Bhambo Chapanga. Lende ndi litambiko lya kukomelekelwa. Litambiko lya lilibhii na luhumba lwambone lwa kunhalalicha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 2:3" />Chehemo uhembe ghuighilike gwa litambiko lyenio ndi jha akapiya matambiko. Jhenie ndi chehemo jha nyahinyahi hake jha litambiko jhipiitwe kwa Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 2:4" />“Anda mundo impikii litambiko lya mabumunda ghu kujhocha, ibhaha jhangalekelwa ngedule jhihangalinwe na mahuta gha micheitune amu mabumunda makombaho ghangabhehe na ngedule na kupakaya mahuta.<verse eid="LEV 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 2:5" />“Anda litambiko lyampihite ndi lya mabumunda ghighajhochitwe pa kikalango, lyenie libhaa lya uhembe ghukutema ghuhangalinwe na mahuta gha micheitune nambo changa ngedule. <verse eid="LEV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 2:6" />Mabumunda gheniya ngaghaghabhanichwa ipande ipande nu kujhitii mahuta, lyene ndi litambiko lya uhembe.<verse eid="LEV 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 2:7" />“Anda litambiko lyamupiya ndi lya mabumunda ghighatelikwe mu chupuliya, lyenie nalibha lya uhembe ghunakutema na kujhitii mahuta. <verse eid="LEV 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 2:8" />Nanneta litambiko lyenio lya uhembe ghutenganichwe kwa ilebhe yene palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, na mpiya matambiko naipelika chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko. <verse eid="LEV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 2:9" />Mpiya litambiko natola chehemo jha kipandi cha litambiko, jhibhii ndi litambiko lya ukombokelo na kukomelekeya chehemo jha kukomelekeya. Lende ndi litambiko lya kukomelekelwa. Litambiko lya kukomelekelwa, lilibhi na luhumba lwa mbone lwa kunhalalicha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 2:10" />Chehemo jhihighilike jha litambiko lya uhembe, ndi lya akapiya matambiko. Jhenie ndi jhihighilike jha nyahinyahi hake jha litambiko jhipiitwe kwa Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 2:11" />“Litambiko lyolyoha lya uhembe lya mumpiikiya Bhambo Chapanga ipalwa lyangahangalanwa jhe na ngedule, ipalwa ng'o kuhangalana ngedule amu bhuche mu litambiko lyapiikilwa Bhambo Chapanga kwa mwotu. <verse eid="LEV 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 2:12" />Mihoto kunnete Bhambo Chapanga malobhoko ghino ngita litambiko. Nambo ghena naghapiwa jhe mu chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko ngita hela ibhii nu luhumba lukunhalalicha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 2:13" />Nnekela mwinyo mu matambiko ghino gha uhembe, nhwalo mwinyo ndi ulangii nginyililo jha Lilaghano pakate jhino na Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 2:14" />Anda mipala kumpiikiya Bhambo Chapanga litambiko lya malobhoko ghake, nampiya mbonje ijhochitwe mu manjwanjwane ghake, amu nampiya mu mabumunda ghighabanikwe ghighatengenichwe kwa ngano jhitemite. <verse eid="LEV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 2:15" />Namiijhitila mahuta nu kuhangalana na ubane, na lyene nalibhaha ndi litambiko lya mbonje. <verse eid="LEV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 2:16" />Mpiya litambiko najhocha chehemo jha litambiko lya mbonje iponditwe na kuhangalana mahuta pamonga na ubane gwake gwoha, ibha litambiko lya ukombokelo, lyenie ndi litambiko lyapiikilwa Bhambo Chapanga kwa mwotu.”<verse eid="LEV 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LEV 3" />
  <para style="s">Litambiko lyu uteeke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 3:1" />“Anda mundo ipiya litambiko liliteta uteeke, na litambiko lyake ndi lya ng'ombi nkambaku amu jwankolo, bhahe, kinyama chenie kikoto kulemala palonge jhango. <verse eid="LEV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 3:2" />Mundo jwenio nabheka lubhoko lwake pa muto gwa kinyama chenie nu kunchinja pannyango gwa Lihema lyukukonganikila. Akapiya matambiko bhana bha Alune nabhamichila myahe chehemo yoha ya kupiikiya litambiko. <verse eid="LEV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 3:3" />Mahuta ghoha ghighajhenile jha matumbo gha kinyama cha litambiko lyenio lya uteeke, naghakomelekelwa ngita litambiko lya kumpiikiya Bhambo Chapanga kwa mwotu. <verse eid="LEV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 3:4" />Kabhele nabhoha ndutumba yoha ibhele na mahuta ghake pamonga na chehemo jhambone jha kibhende. <verse eid="LEV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 3:5" />Akapiya matambiko bhana bha Alune nabhakomelekeya chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko pamonga na litambiko lya kukomelekelwa lilibhi panane jha hanjo ijhaka. Lyenie ndi litambiko lya kukomelekelwa kwa mwotu lilibhi na luhumba lwa kunhalalicha Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 3:6" />“Anda mundo apihite limbelele amu mbuhe kuhumii mulilongo ngita litambiko lya uteeke kwa Bhambo Chapanga, nanhaghula jwankambako amu jwankolo jwangalemala. <verse eid="LEV 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 3:7" />Anda mundo apiite litohe lya limbelele kubhehe litambiko lyake, bhahe, nanneta palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, <verse eid="LEV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 3:8" />nabheka lubhoko lwake pa muto gwa kinyama chenie nu kunchinja pa litangala lya Lihema lyukukonganikila. Akapiya matambiko bhana bha Alune nabhamichila myahe chehemo yoha jha kupiikiya litambiko. <verse eid="LEV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 3:9" />Peniya, kuhumii mu litambiko lyene lya uteeke lyapiikilwa Bhambo Chapanga kwa mwotu, nampiikiya chehemo henge, mahuta ghake na nkela ghuna mahuta ghoha ghuhekitwe pahina na nng'ongo pamonga na mahuta ghoha ghighajhenile mu matumbo na mahuta ghoha ghighabhii mu matumbo, <verse eid="LEV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 3:10" />na ndutumba ibhele na mahuta ghake pamonga na chehemo jhambone jha kibhende. <verse eid="LEV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 3:11" />Mpiya litambiko naikomelekeya yenio yoha chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko ngita chakulya chapiikilwa Bhambo Chapanga kwa mwotu.<verse eid="LEV 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 3:12" />“Anda litambiko lyake ndi mbuhe, bhahe, napiya palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, <verse eid="LEV 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 3:13" />mundo jwenio nabheka lubhoko lwake pa muto gwa kinyama jwenio nu kunchinja palonge jha Lihema lya Bhambo Chapanga. Peniya yana ya Alune nabhamichila myahe jhake mu pande yoha jha kupiikiya litambiko. <verse eid="LEV 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 3:14" />Peniya, nabhoha mahuta ghoha ghighajhenile mu matumbo, <verse eid="LEV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 3:15" />na ndutumba yoha ibhele pamonga na mahuta ghake pamonga na chehemo jhambone jha kibhende, nampiikiya Bhambo Chapanga ngita litambiko lya kukomelekelwa kwa mwotu. <verse eid="LEV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 3:16" />Mpiya litambiko najhocha ilebhe yenio yoha chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko ngita litambiko lya uhembe, chikipiwa kwa Bhambo Chapanga kwa mwotu, kupala luhumba lwake luhalalicha Bhambo Chapanga. Ku nhwalo mahuta ghoha ndi gha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 3:17" />Ghongo ndi nhwilo gwa machiko ghoha kwa Akaichilahele na chehemo jhojhoha, kibheluko ade kibheluko pumpakutama mipalwa mukamula nhwilo gwenio. Mangalye jhe mahuta hilu myahe.”<verse eid="LEV 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LEV 4" />
  <para style="s">Litambiko kuhwalo gwa kupepulila uhakaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 4:1" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, <verse eid="LEV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 4:2" />Malobholele bhando bhu ku Ichilahele kubhehe, anda mundo atehi uhakaho changanamiye, kukuhenga kilebhe chikikanakilwe mu nhwilo gwa Bhambo Chapanga, mitenda naha,<verse eid="LEV 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 4:3" />Anda mpiya litambiko jwamiminilwe mahuta atehi uhakaho na kwatenda bhange bhabha na malemwa, jwenio nannetela Bhambo Chapanga, litohe lya ng'ombi nkambako jwangalemala abhaha litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho. <verse eid="LEV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 4:4" />Nanneta litohe lya nkambako lya ng'ombi jwenio mu Lihema lya Bhambo Chapanga, palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, jwenio nabheka lubhoko lwake pa muto gwa ng'ombi jwenio nu kunchinja palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 4:5" />Peniya, mpiya litambiko jwamiminilwe mahuta jwenio, natola myahe jhandina nu kujhingii nako nkate jha Lihema lya Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 4:6" />Nachwiya lukonji lwake mu myahe jhenie nu kumichi mala chaba palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, upandi gwa nnonge gwa lipanjiya lya nyahinyahi lilighabhanicha chehemo jha nyahinyahi na pa nyahinyahi hake. <verse eid="LEV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 4:7" />Mpiya litambiko natola myahe jhandina nu kukilima mu manyelo ghighatengenichwe pa chehemo jha kututukiya ubane ghubhii na luhumba lwambone, palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga mu Lihema lya Bhambo Chapanga. Myahe jhipakuhighilika najhitila pahe kutindii chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko lya kukomelekelwa lilibhii pahina na litangala lya Lihema lya Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 4:8" />Peniya, mpiya litambiko nabhoha mahuta ghoha gha ng'ombi jwenio na mahuta ghighajhenii mu matumbo, <verse eid="LEV 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 4:9" />Ndutumba ibhele na mahuta ghighabhii panane jhake na ghala ghighabhii mu kibhuno, na ghala ghighakamuline na ndutumba na kibhende, yene ndi chehemo jhelajhela jhighangitwe mu kinyama cha litambiko lya uteeke. <verse eid="LEV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 4:10" />Mpiya litambiko jwenio natola nu kukomelekeya pa chehemo jhitenganichwe jha kupiikiya litambiko lya kukomelekeya, ngita chatenda kwa mahuta ghala ghighapihwa kunhwalo gwa litambiko lya uteeke. <verse eid="LEV 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 4:11" />Nambo limbendela lya ng'ombi jwenio na nyama na muto na magholo na matumbo na mahe ghake, <verse eid="LEV 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 4:12" />yane chehemo jhoha jha nyama jhiihighilike naitola nukwipeleka panja jha kighono, chehemo ijheketelwa na Bhambo Chapanga, chehemo pukujhitii maliho, na kwenio nannyocha pa hanjo jhiijhaka mwotu.<verse eid="LEV 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 4:13" />Anda bhando bhoha bhuku Ichilahele bhatei uhakaho changanamiye kukuhenga kilebhe chikikanikilwe mu mihilo jha Bhambo Chapanga, <verse eid="LEV 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 4:14" />kipinde pibhamanya uhakaho gwenio, bhando bhoha nabhapiya litohe lya ng'ombi libhaha litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho. Nabhaleta litohe lyenio ku Lihema lya Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 4:15" />Ilongoche bha bhando bheniya nabhabheka mabhoko ghabhe pa muto gwa linkambako jwenio, nu kunchinja palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 4:16" />Mpiya litambiko jwahaghulilwe natola myahe jhandina jha ng'ombi lyankambako nkate jha Lihema lya Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 4:17" />Peniya, nachwiya lukonje lwake mu myahe jhenie, nu kumichii mala chaba nnonge jha lipanjiya lya nyahinyahi na panyahinyahi hake, palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 4:18" />Natola myahe jhandina nu kukilima mu manyelo gha chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko lilibhii mu Lihema lya Chapanga palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. Myahe jhipala kuhighala najhitila pahe kutindii chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko lyu kukomelekeya pahina na nnyango gwa Lihema lya Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 4:19" />Natola mahuta ghoha gha kinyama chenie nu kughakomelekeya chehemo ichengitwe jha kupiikiya litambiko. <verse eid="LEV 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 4:20" />Bhahe, nantenda litohe lya ng'ombi jwenie ngita chantendila litohe jwalongolila jhola jwa litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho. Yene, mpiya litambiko jwenio nabhatendela bhando ujhopo gwa ujhelenicho kunhwalo gwa uhakaho, nabheniya nabhalekekelwa. <verse eid="LEV 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 4:21" />Peniya, nantola linkambako jhola nu kumpeleka kukighono nu kunkomelekeya kwa mwotu ngita chantendila ng'ombi jhonge jhola. Lyenio ndi litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho gwa bhando bhamahele.<verse eid="LEV 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 4:22" />Anda kilongoche atehi uhakaho changanamiye ku kutenda kilebhe chikikanakilwe mu mihilo jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwake, nu kutenda malemo, kilongoche jwenie changanamiye, <verse eid="LEV 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 4:23" />kipinde papakulobholelwa uhakaho gwake, apiya litambiko lyake lya litohe lya mbuhe nkambako jwangalemala. <verse eid="LEV 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 4:24" />Nabheka lubhoko lwake pa muto gwa mbuhe, na kunchinja chehemo jhu kuchinjila litambiko lya kukomelekeya palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. Lyenie ndi litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho. <verse eid="LEV 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 4:25" />Mpiya litambiko nachwiya lukonje lwake mu myahe jha litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho na kumichili mu manyelo chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko lya kukomelekeya. Myahe jhiipala kuhighilika najhitila pahe kutindii chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko lya kukomelekelwa. <verse eid="LEV 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 4:26" />Peniya, mpiya litambiko natola mahuta ghoha gha mbuhe jwenio, naghakomelekeya chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko, ngita chatehila mahuta gha kinyama cha litambiko lya uteeke. Kukutenda yene, mpiya litambiko nantendela kilongoche jwenio ujhopo gwa ujhelanicho ku nhwalo gwa uhakaho gwake, na jwenie nalekekelwa uhakaho gwake.<verse eid="LEV 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 4:27" />Anda mundo jhojhoha atehi uhakaho changanamiye, ku kutenda kilebhe chikikanakiwe mu mihilo jha Bhambo Chapanga, nayene, kubhehe nu malemwa, <verse eid="LEV 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 4:28" />papakulobholelwa kubhehe atehi uhakaho, naleta litambiko lya mbuhe jwankolo jwangalemala ku nhwalo gwa kupepulila uhakaho gwatehile. <verse eid="LEV 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 4:29" />Mundo jwenie nabheka lubhoko lwake pa muto gwa mbuhe jwenio jwa litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho, nu kuchinjila pa chehemo pibhachinjila inyama ya litambiko lyu kukomelekelwa. <verse eid="LEV 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 4:30" />Mpiya litambiko nachwiya lukonje lwake mu myahe jha litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho na kukilima mu manyelo chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko lya kukomelekeya. Myahe jhiipala kuhighala naijhitila pahe kutindii chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko. <verse eid="LEV 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 4:31" />Peniya, mpiya litambiko nabhoha mahuta ghoha gha mbuhe ngita chighapihwa mahuta gha inyama henge ya litambiko lya uteeke, naghatiniya pa chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko kupala ibhaha luhumba lwambone lulunhalalicha Bhambo Chapanga. Kukutenda yene, mpiya litambiko nantendela ujhopo mundo jwenio gwa ujhelanicho ku nhwalo gwa uhakaho gwake, na jwenie nalekekelwa uhakaho gwake.<verse eid="LEV 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 4:32" />Anda mundo jwenio naleta litohe lya limbelele ku nhwalo gwa litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho, impala aleta litohe lya limbelele lya nkolo lyangalemala. <verse eid="LEV 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 4:33" />Na jwenie nabheka lubhoko lwake pamuto gwa litohe lya limbelele jwenio jwa litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho, nu kunchinjii pa chehemo pibhachinjii inyama ya matambiko gha kukomelekeya. <verse eid="LEV 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 4:34" />Mpiya litambiko nachwiya lukonje lwake mu myahe jha litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho na kukilima mu manyelo chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko lya kukomelekeya. Myahe jhiipala kuhighilika naijhitila pahe kutindii chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko. <verse eid="LEV 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 4:35" />Nabhoha mahuta ghoha, ngita chabhoita mahuta gha litohe lya limbelele ku nhwalo gwa litambiko lya uteeke, na mpiya litambiko naghatiniya pa chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko, pamonga na matambiko ghange ghighapihwa kwa Bhambo Chapanga kwa mwotu. Kukutenda yene, mpiya litambiko nantendela ujhopo gwa ujhelanicho gha uhakaho gwake gwateile, na jwenie nalekekelwa uhakaho gwake.<verse eid="LEV 4:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LEV 5" />
  <para style="s">Litambiko lenge lya kupepulila uhakaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 5:1" />Anda mundo akemitwe pa udamo kupala alongee chela chakihwene amu chakijhoine na jwenie akanite kulongee chochoha, jwenio nabhaha atei malemwa, na jwenie nahadabulwa. <verse eid="LEV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 5:2" />Amu ngita mundo jhojhoha pakate jhino nabhaha ijheketelwa jhe palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga kwa kukamuu kilebhe chochoha changajheketelwa palonge jha Chapanga, ubhaha ntuhe gwa kinyama chukukoleka amu chukumanyahe amu ikokolo, mundo jwenio nabhaha na uhakaho. <verse eid="LEV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 5:3" />Amu mundo apapii chochoha changajheketelwa palonge jha Chapanga chikihumii muyegha ya mundo, chikintenda mundo abhehe jwangajheketelwa kwa Chapanga, changamanya jwenie, pala papakumanya tu nabhaha na malemo. <verse eid="LEV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 5:4" />Anda mundo alapile kutenga kilebhe chochoha chela, chambone amu kibhoho, ngita chibhatenda bhando changahwachila, papakumanya tu nabhaha na malemo. <verse eid="LEV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 5:5" />Bhahe, mundo papakumanya tu kubhehe atehi uhakaho ngita yenio, impala kujheketela uhakaho gwake, <verse eid="LEV 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 5:6" />malepo ghake impala kunnete Bhambo Chapanga limbelele lyankolo amu mbuhe jhankolo kupala libhaha litambiko lyake lya kupepulila uhakaho gwake. Mpiya litambiko nalikomelekeya nu kunnyelanicha mundo jwenio na Bhambo Chapanga ku nhwalo gwa uhakaho gwake. <verse eid="LEV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 5:7" />Nambo anda akwetii jhe litohe lya limbelele jwa litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho gwateile, nannetela Bhambo Chapanga ngunda ibhele amu mapupo gha ngunda mabhele. Jhumo kunhwalo gwa litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho na jhonge ku nhwalo gwa litambiko lya kukomelekeya. <verse eid="LEV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 5:8" />Nannetela mpiya litambiko, na mpiya litambiko nampiya jhumo ku nhwalo gwa kupepulila uhakaho kupopotola ntandala changaheketa muto. <verse eid="LEV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 5:9" />Chehemo jha myahe jhake namichila muupele jha chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko na jhenge najhitila pahe mu kutindii pa kupiikiya litambiko. Jhenie ndi litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho. <verse eid="LEV 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 5:10" />Peniya, mpiya litambiko nampiya jhonge jhola kubhehe litambiko lya kukomelekelwa ngita malaghalikilo chighalonge. Mpiya litambiko nantendela mundo jwenie ujhelanicho ku nhwalo gwa uhakaho gwake, na jwenie nalekekelwa. <verse eid="LEV 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 5:11" />Anda mundo jwenio akwetii jhe ngunda ibhele amu mapupo mabhele gha ngunda ngita litambiko lyake lya kupepulila uhakaho gwatehile, bhahe, impala aleta uhembe ghunakutema kilo jhimo. Nambo angahangalana jhe na mahuta hilu ubane nhwalo ndi litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho. <verse eid="LEV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 5:12" />Nannetela uhembe gwenio mpiya litambiko, na jwenie natola uhembe gwenio lukohe lumo na kukomelekeya panane jha chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko anda chehemo jha ukombokelo, pamonga na litambiko yapiikilwa Bhambo Chapanga kwa mwotu. Lyenio ndi litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho. <verse eid="LEV 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 5:13" />Bhahe, mpiya litambiko nantendela mundo jwenio ujhelanicho ku nhwalo gwa uhakaho, na jwenie nalekekelwa. Uhembe ghuhighilike naubhaha gwa mpiya litambiko ngita chilibhii litambiko lya uhembe.<verse eid="LEV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Litambiko lya malepo kwa jwatei uhakaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 5:14" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila kabhele Mucha malaghalikilo ghanga, <verse eid="LEV 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 5:15" />“Anda mundo jhojhoha alemwite kukutenda uhakaho changamanya, kwa uhakaho gwangapiya ilebhe yambone yapiilwa Bhambo Chapanga, nannetela limbelele lyankambako lyangalemala kuhumi mulilongo lyake. Na mwenga nampema kulengana na kipemo chikimanyikana mu Lihema lya Chapanga. Lyenie ndi nalibhaha litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho. <verse eid="LEV 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 5:16" />Kupeta gheniya, mundo jwenio nalepa malepo ghoha gha malemo ghatehila kunhwalo gwa ilebhe yapiikilwa Bhambo Chapanga kwa kujhonjekeya lipungo limo pakate jha mapungo nhwano gha litambiko lilipalwa nukumpe mpiya litambiko. Bhahe, mpiya litambiko nantendela ujhelanicho ku nhwalo gwa uhakaho kwa limbelele lyankambako jwabhii litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho, na jwenie nalekekelwa.<verse eid="LEV 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 5:17" />“Mundo jhojhoha anda atehi uhakaho changamanya, ku kukana kutenda ngita nhwilo gwa Bhambo Chapanga chulongela, jwenie abhii na malemwa, impala alepa ku nhwalo gwa malemwa ghake. <verse eid="LEV 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 5:18" />Papakumanya tugha, nannetela mpiya litambiko limbelele lya nkambako lyangalemala kuhumi mu nchambe gwake, jwabhii tela na chamane jha uhakaho gwake. Na mpiya litambiko nantendela ujhelenicho gwa uhakaho gwatehile, na jwenie nalekekelwa. <verse eid="LEV 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 5:19" />Lyenio ndi litambiko lya malepo gha kupepulila uhakaho gwateile mundo jwenio, palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="LEV 5:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LEV 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 6:1" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha kubhehe, <verse eid="LEV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 6:2" />Mundo jhojhoha anda atei uhakaho, na kunnemuu Bhambo Chapanga na kunkolowa nnyake ku nhwalo gwa kilebhe champile kubheka amu ujhelanicho amu kupoka kwa makakala amu kummone nnyake, <verse eid="LEV 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 6:3" />amu alokwite chikihobhalile cha nnyake nu kulonge alokwite jhe amu kulapila kuhwange kwa chochoha chikitenda bhando bhabhehe na ulemwa, <verse eid="LEV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 6:4" />mundo jwenio patenga uhakaho abhii na malemwa, ipalwa abhujhicha chajhibhite amu chapatite kwa kukolowa, amu kilebhe chapilwe kubheka, amu alokwite kilebhe cha nnyake na kukana amu chela chapokite kwa makakala, <verse eid="LEV 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 6:5" />amu chochoha chalapi kuhwange. Nalepa kila kilebhe kwa uchakaka na kujhonjekeya chehemo jhimo jha nhwano jha bei ngolongwa. Papakumanya tu lilemo lyake nammujhichila jwenie. <verse eid="LEV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 6:6" />Peniya, channetela mpiya litambiko limbelele lyankambako amu mbuhe jwankambako jwangalemala, ampiikiye Bhambo Chapanga litambiko lya kupepula ulemwa, bei jha kinyama chenie naibhaa tela na jhela jhipangitwe jha kupepulila ulemwa. <verse eid="LEV 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 6:7" />Mpiya litambiko nantendela ujhelanicho palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, na jwenie nalekekelwa ulemwa gwateile.<verse eid="LEV 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Litambiko lya kukomelekeya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 6:8" />Bhambo Chapanga ngajhendilila kunnobholela Mucha kubhehe, <verse eid="LEV 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 6:9" />“Munnobholela Alune na yana mundo kilebhe chenje cha litambiko lya kukomelekelwa, litambiko lya kukomelekeya lipalwa kubhe panane jha chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko kilo ndaa ade lukela, na mwotu upalwa ujhaka panane jhake changahimika. <verse eid="LEV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 6:10" />Mpiya litambiko awala ngobho jhake jhitenganichwe kwa ngobho nhuu jhina kuhalala, na kabudula kahuu, atola maliho gha litambiko kuhumii pa chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko nu kubheka puupele na chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko. <verse eid="LEV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 6:11" />Kuhumii peniya, ajhangangana ngobho yake, natola maliho ghala nu kupeleka panja jha kighono chehemo jhijheketilwe na Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 6:12" />Mwotu gwa chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko naujhendelela kujhaka, ukoto kuhima machiko ghoha. Kila lukela mpiya litambiko nakokelekeya hanjo pamwoto gwenio na panane jhake abheka litambiko lya kukomelekeya, kabula nakutiniya jhe mahuta gha litambiko lya uteeke. <verse eid="LEV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 6:13" />Mwotu naujhendelela kujhaka machiko ghoha chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko changahimika.<verse eid="LEV 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Litambiko lya uhembe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 6:14" />“Ghanga ndi malaghalikilo ghange gha litambiko lya uhembe, yana ya Alune bhabhehe na uhotolo gwa kumpikiiya Bhambo Chapanga litambiko lyene chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko. <verse eid="LEV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 6:15" />Jhumo jwa mpiya litambiko natola lukohe lumo lwa uhembe gwa litambiko lya uhembe pamonga na mahuta na ubane ghoha na kuikomelekeya pa chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko ngita chehemo jhu ukombochelo, na luhumba lwake naunhalalicha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 6:16" />Uhembe gwenio ghuhighilike nabhatendekeya mabumunda ghangaleke ngedule, nalya Alune na yana yake. Nabhalya palwane pa Lihema lya Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 6:17" />Mangahangalana jhe ngedule. Napile bheniya chehemo jha litambiko libhambiikiya kwa mwotu. Ndi litambiko lya nyahinyahi hake ngita chiibhii litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho na lya kupepulila ulemwa. <verse eid="LEV 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 6:18" />Yana inalome ya Alune tugha ndi ipalwa kulye matambiko ghena, nhwalo yenie ibhekitwe ku nhwalo gwabhe kuhumii mu matambiko ghapiikilwa Bhambo Chapanga kwa mwotu. Chochoha chikipa kupapaya nakibhaha ku nhwalo gwa Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="LEV 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 6:19" />Bhambo Chapanga ngajhendilila kabhele kunnobholela Mucha, <verse eid="LEV 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 6:20" />“Mu lichiko lya kubhekwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga Alune na yana yake, bhipalwa kumpiikiya Bhambo Chapanga kilo jhimo jha uhembe ghuna kutema kwa lichiko, nucho jhimo jha uhembe gwenio nabhapiya lukela na nucho jhenge kimiye. <verse eid="LEV 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 6:21" />Uhembe gwenio nabhahangalana pamonga na mahuta nu kuteleka mu kikalango. Kubhoke peniya, naipiiya ipande nu kumpiikiya Bhambo Chapanga, na luhumba lwa litambiko lwake nalunhalalicha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 6:22" />Mpiya litambiko jwabhi mwana jwa Alune jwahaghulilwe kubhehe kilongoche. Ndi jwapala kumpiikiya Bhambo Chapanga litambiko lyenie, lyenie ndi lilaghalikilo lya machiko ghoha ghangapeta. Litambiko lyoha nalikomelekelwa njwe <verse eid="LEV 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 6:23" />Kila litambiko lyolyoha lya uhembe lilipihwa na mpiya litambiko naikomelekelwa lyoha, nalilegwa jhe.”<verse eid="LEV 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Litambiko ku nhwalo gwa kupepulila uhakaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 6:24" />Bhambo Chapanga ngajhendilila kabhele kunnobholela Mucha, <verse eid="LEV 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 6:25" />“Munnobholele Alune na yana mundo kubhehe, malaghalikilo ku nhwalo gwa kupepulila uhakaho ndi ghanga. Chehemo jha kuchinji kinyama cha litambiko lya kukomelekeya, pabhaha chehemo jha kuchinji kinyama cha litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. Lyenie ndi litambiko lya nyahinyahi hake. <verse eid="LEV 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 6:26" />Mpiya litambiko jwapiya litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho ndi jwapakulye, nalya pa chehemo jha nyahinyahi mu lwane lwa Lihema lya Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 6:27" />Kilebhe chochoha chikipa kupapaha nyama jhenie nakibhekwa kutale ku nhwalo gwa Chapanga, ngobho jhojhoha anda indonyikii myahe jha litambiko lyenie, bhahe, ngobho jhenie naipulwa pa chehemo jhihaghulilwe na Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 6:28" />Litambiko lyenie anda litelikwe mu kikalango, kubhoke peniya, kikalango chenie kipalwa kikajhulwa. Nambo anda chombo chenie cha chaba, nakighololwa na mache. <verse eid="LEV 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 6:29" />Bhibhapalwa kulye litambiko lyenie ndi akanalome bhulungolo lwa mpiya litambiko tu nhwalo lyene ndi litambiko lya nyahinyahi hake. <verse eid="LEV 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 6:30" />Nambo anda myahe jha litambiko lyolyoha lya kupepulila uhakaho iletitwe nkate jha Lihema lya nyahinyahi kupala kutenda ujhelanicho chehemo jha nyahinyahi, litambiko lyenie ikomelekelwa kwa mwotu.”<verse eid="LEV 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LEV 7" />
  <para style="s">Litambiko lya malepo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 7:1" />Jhenje ndi mihilo jha matambiko gha kulepechela, lyene ndi litambiko lya nyahinyahi hake. <verse eid="LEV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 7:2" />Kinyama cha litambiko lya kupepulila malemwa, nachinjilwa pibhachinjila inyama ya litambiko lya kukomelekeya, na myahe jhake ipalwa ikilimwa pande yoha ya chehemo jha kupiikiya matambiko. <verse eid="LEV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 7:3" />Mahuta ghake ghoha nabhabhoha nu kujhochwa mwotu, yane mahuta gha nkela na ghala ghighajhenii nkate, nabhabhoha nu kukomelekelwa, <verse eid="LEV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 7:4" />ndutumba ibhele pamonga na mahuta ghake na chehemo jhambone jha ibhende. <verse eid="LEV 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 7:5" />Mpiya litambiko nakomelekeya pa kupiikiya litambiko ngita litambiko lilipiwa kwa Bhambo Chapanga kwa mwotu. Lyenie ndi litambiko lya kupepulila malemwa. <verse eid="LEV 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 7:6" />Akanalome bha lungolo lwa bhapiya matambiko kanjika ndi bhibhapalwa kulye nyama jhenio, ku nhwalo ndi litambiko lya nyahinyahi hake. Na jhenio nilegwa chehemo jha nyahinyahi. <verse eid="LEV 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 7:7" />Nhwilo gwa litambiko lya kubhoha malemwa na litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho. Mpiya litambiko jwatenda ujhelanicho ndi jwapakutola litambiko lyenie. <verse eid="LEV 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 7:8" />Mpiya litambiko jwapiya litambiko lya kukomelekeya ku nhwalo gwa mundo jhojhoha, natola limbendela lya kinyama chenie. <verse eid="LEV 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 7:9" />Litambiko lyolyoha lya uhembe lilibanikwe pakihinja amu kuteleka muchupuliya amu mukikalango naibhaha jha mpiya litambiko jwapiya, <verse eid="LEV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 7:10" />nambo litambiko lya uhembe, lilihunyitwe na mahuta amu lyangahunywa, nalibhaha lya yana ya Alune, na bhoha bhipalwa bhaghabhanichilwa telatela.<verse eid="LEV 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Litambiko lya uteeke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 7:11" />Ghongo ndi nhwilo ku nhwalo gwa litambiko lya uteeke, mundo ahoto kumpiikiya Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 7:12" />Anda mundo apiya litambiko lya kunchenguu Bhambo Chapanga, napiya pamonga na mabumunda ghangaleke ngedule, na ghighabhii na mahuta na mabumunda makombaho ghighatyekitwe mahuta na mabumunda gha uhembe ghuna kutema ghuhunyitwe na mahuta. <verse eid="LEV 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 7:13" />Pamonga na litambiko lyake lya uteeke, lya kunchenguu Bhambo Chapanga, helahela napiya mabumunda ghighalekilwe ngedule. <verse eid="LEV 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 7:14" />Pakate jha kila libumunda napiya limo ngita litambiko, palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, jhenje ndi jha mpiya litambiko jwamichii myahe jha litambiko lya uteeke. <verse eid="LEV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 7:15" />Nyama jha litambiko lyenio lya uteeke lya kunnchenguu Chapanga, nailegwa lichiko lele, yangahighalika jhe ade lichiko lenge lukela.<verse eid="LEV 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 7:16" />Nambo anda litambiko lyenie lya uteeke ndi lya nachile amu lyakupala mundo jwenio, nailegwa lichiko lele pilipiwa chikipakuhighala mihoto kulye kilabho jhake. <verse eid="LEV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 7:17" />Nambo nyama jhojhoha jhipakuhighala ade lichiko lya utato, naikomelekelwa. <verse eid="LEV 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 7:18" />Kabhele nyama jhojhoha jha litambiko lya uteeke, anda ililwe lichiko lya utato, naijheketelwa jhe na mundo jhojhoha jwapihite nabhalangilwa kubhehe na malemwa. Nyama jhenie ndi uhakaho na mundo jwapakulye nahadabulwa kwa ulemwa gwake. <verse eid="LEV 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 7:19" />Nyama jhojhoha jhipapaha kilebhe changajheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, nkoto kulye. Nyama jhenie naikomelekelwa kwa mwotu. Nambo, bhando bhoha bhibhajheketilwe palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga bhihoto kulye nyama jhenie, <verse eid="LEV 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 7:20" />nyama jhipihitwe litambiko lya uteeke kwa Bhambo Chapanga. Nambo mundo jhojhoha jwangajheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, anda alii nyama jhene, nabhekwa kutale na bhando bhake. <verse eid="LEV 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 7:21" />Kabhele, anda mundo jhojhoha apapiye kilebhe changajheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, kibhaha uhako gwa mundo amu kinyama changajheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, amu kilebhe chochoha changajheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, na anda nalya nyama jha litambiko lya uteeke lyapiikilwe Bhambo Chapanga, mundo jwenio nabhammeka kutale na bhando bhake.<verse eid="LEV 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 7:22" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, <verse eid="LEV 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 7:23" />“Malobholela Akaichilahele kubhehe, bhakoto kulye mahuta gha ng'ombi amu gha limbelele amu gha mbuhe. <verse eid="LEV 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 7:24" />Mahuta gha kinyama chochoha jwakihwelile jwene amu gha kinyama jwakomitwe na kinyama jwakumanyahe nkoto kulye, nambo ghahoto kutumika kwa mahengo ghange. <verse eid="LEV 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 7:25" />Mundo jhojhoha anda alii mahuta gha kinyama jwapiitwe kwa Bhambo Chapanga kwa mwotu, nabhekwa kutale na bhando bhake. <verse eid="LEV 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 7:26" />Mangalye jhe myahe jhojhoha jhela, ibha jha kijhune amu jha kinyama, popoha pumitama. <verse eid="LEV 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 7:27" />Mundo jhojhoha anda alii myahe, bhammeka kutale na bhando bhake.”<verse eid="LEV 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 7:28" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, <verse eid="LEV 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 7:29" />“Malobholele bhando bha ku Ichilahele kubhehe, ‘Mundo jhojhoha anda apiya litambiko lyake lya uteeke, nampiikiya Bhambo Chapanga chehemo jha litambiko lyenie.’ <verse eid="LEV 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 7:30" />Naleta jwenie ngita litambiko lya kukomelekelwa kwa mwotu. Naleta mahuta ghake pamonga na kidale, chikipa kubhehe nginyililo jha kumpikiya Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 7:31" />Mpiya litambiko nakomelekeya mahuta ghoha chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko, nambo kidale nakibhaha cha Alune na yana mundo. <verse eid="LEV 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 7:32" />Libhondo lya unyuma lya ulelo lya kinyama cha litambiko lino lya uteeke, nampela mpiya litambiko. <verse eid="LEV 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 7:33" />Libhondo lyene nalibhaha lya mpiya litambiko jwabhi kibheluko cha Alune jwapiya myahe jha litambiko lya uteeke na mahuta ghake. <verse eid="LEV 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 7:34" />Bhambo Chapanga abhalaghalikiye bhando bha ku Ichilahele bhabheka pakanjika kidale chenie, na libhondo lyene lya kinyama jwa litambiko lyabhe lya uteeke, bhapekiwe mpiya litambiko Alone na yana yake, nhwalo chehemo jhenie bhabhekilwe bheniya bhapiya matambiko, machiko ghoha ghangapeta. <verse eid="LEV 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 7:35" />Jhenio ndi chehemo jhibhekitwe ku nhwalo gwa Alune na yana yake kubhoke mu litambiko lyapikilwa Bhambo Chapanga kwa mwotu, kuhumii mu lichiko lela libhabhekitwa kubhehe akapiya litambiko bha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 7:36" />Lichiko lyenie pibhamiminilwa mahuta gha upiya litambiko, Bhambo Chapanga ngabhalaghila Akaichilahele, bhapelwa chehemo jhene jha litambiko kunhwalo gwa ibheluko jhabhe.”<verse eid="LEV 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 7:37" />Bhahe, gwenio ndi nhwilo gwa litambiko lya kukomelekelwa na litambiko lya uhembe na litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho na litambiko lya kubhoha malemwa, kubhekwa hotu na litambiko lya uteeke. <verse eid="LEV 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 7:38" />Bhambo Chapanga ngampila Mucha mihilo jhenje ku kitombe chu ku Chinae, lichiko lyabhalaghila Akaichilahele bhannetele matambiko ghabhe, kwenio kunjenga jha ku Chinae.<verse eid="LEV 7:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LEV 8" />
  <para style="s">Alune na yanamundo bhimiminilwa mahuta kubhehe akapiya matambiko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 29:1-37">Kubhoka 29:1-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 8:1" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, <verse eid="LEV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 8:2" />“Nkema Alune pamonga na yana mundo, bhakonganika palonge jha litangala lya Lihema lya Chapanga, tola ngobho jhihaghulilwe ya upiya litambiko na mahuta gha kupakala, helahela tola ng'ombi nkambako lya litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho na mambelele mabhele gha nkambako, pamonga na kichukilo cha mabumunda ghangaleke ngedule. <verse eid="LEV 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 8:3" />Peniya, makonganicha Akaichilahele bhoha pa litangala lya Lihema lya Chapanga.”<verse eid="LEV 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 8:4" />Mucha ngateila ngita chalaghalikilwe na Bhambo Chapanga, ngabhakonganicha Akaichilahele bhoha palonge jha litangala lya Lihema lya Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 8:5" />Mucha ngabhalobholila Akaichilahele bhoha naha, “Ghongo ndi nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga alaghalikii tulitende.”<verse eid="LEV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 8:6" />Kabhele Mucha ngabhakemita Alune na yana mundo, ngabhajhoghecha kwa mache. <verse eid="LEV 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 8:7" />Peniya, Alune ngawalichwa likanjo na kunkonga luhunga, ngawalichwa lijoho na kichibao na kujhomolela ngankonga luhunga pa kibhuno chake, ghulembekilwe ku upunde. <verse eid="LEV 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 8:8" />Kuhumii peniya, ngabhekita kimpuko cha panganga pa Alune na nkate jha kimpuko chenie ngabhekita maghanga ghala kukonye ghapala Chapanga, ghighakemwa Ulimo na Sumimo. <verse eid="LEV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 8:9" />Peniya, nganhwalicha Alune kinyemba pamuto gwake, na palonge jha kinyemba chenie ngabheka kibate cha chaabo, ngita Bhambo Chapanga channaghila Mucha.<verse eid="LEV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 8:10" />Peniya, Mucha ngatoila mahuta gha micheitune ngapakita ilebhe yoha ikibha mwenio mu Lihema lya Chapanga, kukutenda yene ngaijhelebhula palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 8:11" />Peniya, ngamichila mala chaba mahuta ghandina panane jha chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko, nu kupakaya mahuta chehemo jhitengenichwe jhukupiikiya litambiko, na ilebhe yoha ya mwenio, pamonga na libilika na kitamilo chake, kupala kuijhelebhula palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 8:12" />Helahela Mucha nganyitila Alune mahuta pamuto gwake, kupala kummeka ku nhwalo gwa lihengo lya Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 8:13" />Pajhomolila gheniya, Mucha ngabhaleta yana ya Alune, ngabhawalicha likanjo na kwakonga luhunga mu ibhuno yabhe, na kwawalicha kinyemba, ngita Bhambo Chapanga chalaghila.<verse eid="LEV 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 8:14" />Peniya, Mucha nganneta ng'ombi jwa litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho, na jwenie Alune na yana mundo ngabhabheka mabhoko pa muto gwa ng'ombi jwenio. <verse eid="LEV 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 8:15" />Mucha nganchinja ng'ombi jwenio ngakenga myahe, na lukonje lwake ngapakiya manyelo ghoha gha chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko, ngajhelebhula chehemo jhenio. Peniya, ngajhitii myahe jhenie pahe kutindii chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko, ngaijhelebhula kupala kutenda ujhelanicho ku nhwalo gwa chehemo jhenio. <verse eid="LEV 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 8:16" />Na ngatola mahuta ghoha ghighajhenila mulutumbo lwa ng'ombi na chehemo jhambone jha kibhende pamonga na ndutumba yoha ibhele na mahuta ghake, ngaikomelikiya pa chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko. <verse eid="LEV 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 8:17" />Nambo nyama jha ng'ombi jwenio na limbendela lyake na mahe ghake, ngaikomelikiya kwa mwotu panja jha kighono ngita chalaghalikilwa na Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 8:18" />Peniya, Mucha ngaleta limbelele lya nkambako ku nhwalo gwa litambiko lya kukomelekelwa, Alune na yana mundo ngabhabhekita mabhoko ghabhe panane jha muto gwa limbelele lyenie. <verse eid="LEV 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 8:19" />Mucha nganchinjita limbelele lyenio ngatola myahe nu kumichila mu imbetule yoha ya chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko. <verse eid="LEV 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 8:20" />Ngaheketina ipande, ngaikomelikiya pamonga na muto na mahuta. <verse eid="LEV 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 8:21" />Peniya, ngabheliya matumbo na makongono kwa mache na kuhangalana pamonga na ipande henge, na kukomelekeya kubhehe litambiko lya kukomelekelwa. Lyenio ndi litambiko lyapiikilwa Bhambo Chapanga kwa mwotu, lilibhii na luhumba lwambone lulunhalalicha Bhambo Chapanga, Mucha ngateila ngita chalaghalikilwa na Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 8:22" />Peniya, ngatola likambako lenge lya limbelele, ku nhwalo gwa Alune na yanamundo, kwatenda bhabha akapiya matambiko nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, ghabhabhekita mabhoko ghabhe panane jha muto gwa limbelele lyenio. <verse eid="LEV 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 8:23" />Mucha ngachinja limbelele lyeno, na kutola myahe jhake, na kumpakaya Alone pa kilemeleme cha lichikilo lya ulelo, na lighumba lyake lya lubhoko lwa ulelo na lighumba lyake lya mulugholo lwa ulelo. <verse eid="LEV 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 8:24" />Helahela, yana ya Alune ngabhaika palonge, na Mucha ngabhapakiya myahe pakilemeleme cha machikilo ghabhe gha ulelo, na maghumba ghabhe gha mu mabhoko gha ulelo na maghumba gha makongono gha ulelo. Mucha ngamichila myahe jhihighilike pahe kutindii chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko. <verse eid="LEV 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 8:25" />Peniya, ngatola mahuta ghoha, nkela pamonga na mahuta ghake, na mahuta ghoha ghighabhii mu matumbo, na chehemo jhambone jha kibhende na ndutumba yoha ibhele na mahuta ghake na libhondo lya ulelo lya kinyama chenie. <verse eid="LEV 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 8:26" />Peniya, mu kichukilo cha mabumunda ghangaleke ngedule, chikibhii nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, ngatola libumunda limo, libumunda lilipiitwa na mahuta na liandache limo, ngabheka yoha panane jha ipande ya mahuta na libhondo lela lya ulelo. <verse eid="LEV 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 8:27" />Mucha ngabheka yoha mulubhoko lwa Alune na yanamundo, ngabhatondobheya kunane kulangii kubhehe, matambiko gheniya bhimpiikiya Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 8:28" />Mucha ngatoila ilebhe yenie yoha kuhumii mu mabhoko ghabhe, na kukomelekeya panane jha chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko, pamonga na litambiko lya kukomelekelwa. Lende ndi litambiko lya kwatenda bhabhaha akapiya matambiko, lilibhii na luhumba lwambone lulunhalalicha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 8:29" />Peniya, Mucha ngatola kidale ngatondobhiya kunane, kulangii nginyililo jha kumpikiiya Bhambo Chapanga. Kidale cha limbelele lya nkambako lyenie lya kwatenda bhabhaha akapiya matambiko, kitoilwa na Mucha ngita chalaghila Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 8:30" />Peniya, Mucha ngatola mahuta gha kujhelebhula, na myahe jhibhii panane jha chehemo jhu kupiikiya litambiko nu kummichii Alune na yana mundo na helahela mu ngobho yabhe. Kukutenda yenie Mucha ngabhajhelebhula kubhehe bhando bha Bhambo Chapanga, Alune na yanamundo pamonga na ngobho yabhe.<verse eid="LEV 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 8:31" />Mucha ngannobholila Alune na yanamundo, “Nteleka nyama jhenie palitangala lya Lihema lya Chapanga, nnyangana papa pannyango, pamonga na mabumunda kuhumii mu kichukilo cha matambiko gha kujhelebhula. Ntenda ngita chalaghila Bhambo Chapanga, chehemo jhenio nabhalya Alune na yana mundo. <verse eid="LEV 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 8:32" />Nyama jhipakuighala na mabumunda ghatiniya pa mwotu. <verse eid="LEV 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 8:33" />Mangapita jhe panja jha litangala lya lwane lwa Lihema lya Chapanga kwa machiko chaba, ade kipinde chino chukutendwa kubhehe akapiya matambiko bha Bhambo Chapanga, pukipakulenganila. <verse eid="LEV 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 8:34" />Bhambo Chapanga atulaghii tutende naha ngita chituteila deleno kupala nnekekelwa uhakaho gwino. <verse eid="LEV 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 8:35" />Mangota natamangana palitangala lya Lihema lya Chapanga kipinde cha machiko chaba kilo na muhe, kongo mikitenda ilebhe yalaghalikiye Bhambo Chapanga anda jhe nantendakuwe. Yenie ndi yalaghii Bhambo Chapanga.” <verse eid="LEV 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 8:36" />Yene, Alune na yana mundo ngabhateila gheniya ghoha ngita Bhambo Chapanga chalaghila kupete Mucha.<verse eid="LEV 8:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LEV 9" />
  <para style="s">Akapiya matambiko bhitumbuu lihengo lyabhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 9:1" />Mu lichiko lya nane, Mucha ngankemita Alune na yana yake pamonga na ilongoche ya Akachilahele. <verse eid="LEV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 9:2" />Mucha ngannobholila Alune, “Ntole litohe lya ng'ombi lya nkambako ku nhwalo gwa litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho na limbelele lyankambako ku nhwalo gwa litambiko lya kukomelekelwa, inyama yoha yangalemala jhe. Peniya, mpiye litambiko palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 9:3" />Malobholela Akaichilahele, bhatola mbuhe jhumo jwa nkambako, ku nhwalo gwa litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho, na limbelele lya chaka chimo bhangalemala, kunhwalo gwa litambiko lya kukomelekelwa. <verse eid="LEV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 9:4" />Hele, bhatola ng'ombi jhumo na limbelele lya nkambako limo ku nhwalo gwa litambiko lya uteeke, nabhampiikiya Bhambo Chapanga pamonga na litambiko lya uhembe lilihangalinwe na mahuta nhwalo deleno Bhambo Chapanga nabhapitila.”<verse eid="LEV 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 9:5" />Akaichilahele ngabhaleta yenie yoha palonge jha nyumba jha Chapanga ngita chabhalaghalikiye Mucha na bhando bhoha ngabhajhemita palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 9:6" />Mucha ngabhalobholila, “Kilebhe chenje ndi chalaghila Bhambo Chapanga mukitende, kupala ung'alicho gwake ubhonekana kwino.” <verse eid="LEV 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 9:7" />Mucha ngannobholila Alune, “Nnyenda pa chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko, kupala mpiye litambiko lino lya kupepulila uhakaho na litambiko lya kukomelekeya na kwatende ujhelanicho ku nhwalo gwino na kwa Akaichilahele. Kabhele mpiye litambiko lya bhando na kwatende ujhelanicho ngita chalaghila Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="LEV 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 9:8" />Bhahe, Alune ngaheghilila chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko, nu kulichinja litohe lela libhaha litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho gwake jwene. <verse eid="LEV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 9:9" />Yana yake ngabhannetila myahe, ngachwiya lukonje lwake mu myahe jhenie na kupakaya mu manyelo gha chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko. Myahe jhiighilike ngaijhitita pahe kutindii chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko. <verse eid="LEV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 9:10" />Peniya, mahuta na ndutumba ngaikomilikiya yoha chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko ngita Bhambo Chapanga channaghalikiye Mucha. <verse eid="LEV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 9:11" />Nambo nyama na limbendela ngaikomilikiya kwa mwotu panja jha kighono.<verse eid="LEV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 9:12" />Peniya, Alune nganchinjita kinyama cha litambiko lya kukomelekeya. Yana yake ngabhannetila myahe, na jwenie ngaimichila chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko pande yoha. <verse eid="LEV 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 9:13" />Na bheniya ngabhannetila litambiko lya kukomelekeya, kipande chimochimo na muto, na jwenie ngakomilikiya pa kupiikiya litambiko. <verse eid="LEV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 9:14" />Ngagholwila matumbo na magholo na kuikomelekeya pamonga na litambiko lela lya kukomelekeya pa kupiikiya litambiko lya kukomelekeya.<verse eid="LEV 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 9:15" />Pughapetita gheniya, Alune ngaletita palonge litambiko lela lya bhando. Ngantoila mbuhe jwa litambiko lya kupepulia uhakaho, nganchinjita na kumpiya litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho ngita chateila kwa jhola jwatumbwila. <verse eid="LEV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 9:16" />Alune ngaletita litambiko lya kukomilikiya na kupiya ngita chalaghalikilwe. <verse eid="LEV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 9:17" />Kabhele ngaletita palonge litambiko lya uhembe ngatoila lukohe lumo na kuikomelekiya pa chehemo jhukupiikiya litambiko pamonga na litambiko lya kukomelekiya lya kila lukela. <verse eid="LEV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 9:18" />Kabhele Alune nganchinjita ng'ombi jwankambako na limbelele lyankambako lya litambiko lya uteeke ku nhwalo gwa bhando. Yana yake ngannetila myahe ngaimichila pa chehemo jhikupiikiya litambiko pandi yoha. <verse eid="LEV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 9:19" />Mahuta gha ng'ombi jwankambako na limbelele lyankambako na nkela gwa limbelele na mahuta ghighajhenile mu matumbo, ndutumba na chehemo jhambone jha ibhende, <verse eid="LEV 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 9:20" />ngabhabhekita panane jha idale, na jwenio ngaikomilikiya pa chehemo jhikupiikiya litambiko. <verse eid="LEV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 9:21" />Nambo idale yela na libhondo lela lya ulelo, Alune akatei nako nginyililo jha kumpikii Bhambo Chapanga, ngita chalaghila Mucha.<verse eid="LEV 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 9:22" />Alune pajhomolila kupiya matambiko gha kupepulila uhakaho na matambiko gha kukomelekeya na matambiko gha uteeke, ngabhatondobhikiya bhando mabhoko na kwapela mota bhando na ngahulwika pahe. <verse eid="LEV 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 9:23" />Peniya, Mucha na Alune ngabhajhingila nkate jha lihema lya Chapanga, pibhapitita mwenio ngabhapila mota bhando na ung'alicho gwa Bhambo Chapanga ngaubhonikina kwa bhando bhoha. <verse eid="LEV 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 9:24" />Papa Bhambo Chapanga ngahulwiya mwotu kukomelekeya kila litambiko pa chehemo jhukupiikiya matambiko, na bhando bhoha pubhalolita kilebhe chenio ngabhanonwiya lilobhe nu kutama makilikite nu kibhonge kutipika pahe, kunnomba Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 9:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LEV 10" />
  <para style="s">Uhakaho gwa Nadabo na Abiho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 10:1" />Nadabo na Abiho, yana ya Alune, kila mundo ngatola kitecho chake, ngabhajhokolila mwotu nu ubane, ngabhannyokolila Bhambo Chapanga mwotu gwangajheketelwa palonge jhake. <verse eid="LEV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 10:2" />Papa mwotu ngaupitila kuhumii kwa Bhambo Chapanga, ngubhakomelikiya, ngabhajhomwika nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 10:3" />Mucha ngannobholila Alune, “Ku nhwalo ghongo, Bhambo Chapanga annangiye mana jha chela chalongila, ‘Nanikilangiya kubhehe jwa Nyahinyahi pakate jha bhala bhibhabhii pahina jhango, na kila mundo annumbalila!’ ” Nambo Alune akalongii jhe kilebhe.<verse eid="LEV 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 10:4" />Mucha ngabhakemita Mishaele na Elisafane, yana ya Uziele, tate unung'una mundo Alune, na ngannobholila, “Nheghelele pahina, ntolangane malelo gha akalongo bhino kuhumii pa Lihema lya Chapanga, na mpitanagho panja jha kighono.” <verse eid="LEV 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 10:5" />Ngabhatoila malelo gha akalongo bhabhe, ngabhapelika panja jha kighono, kongo malelo ghala ghabhii na ngobho yabhe ya upiya litambiko ngita chabhalaghila Mucha. <verse eid="LEV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 10:6" />Peniya, Mucha ngannobholila Alune na yana mundo ibhele Eleazale na Itamale, “Mangakwemulila jhe majhunjo ghino hilu kukenjula ngobho ino kulangiya kubhehe mmi na ungolongonde. Kukutenda yene nantenda kuwegha na Chapanga nabhachimwa akalongobhino bhoha. Nambo akalongo bhino Akaichilahele bhoha bhihotola kulela malelo gha bheniya, bhibhakomitwe kwa mwotu kuhumii kwa Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 10:7" />Hilu mangapita jhe panja jha litangala lwa Lihema lya Chapanga, anda ntei yene, nantenda kujhomwoka, ku nhwalo mahuta ghimpakilwe na Bhambo Chapanga ghabhii panane jhino.” Bheniya ngabhatenda ngita chibhalaghilwa na Mucha.<verse eid="LEV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mihilo jha akapiya matambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 10:8" />Bhambo Chapanga ngalongila na Alune kubhehe, <verse eid="LEV 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 10:9" />“Mwenga pamonga na yana ino manganywe jhe divaye amu ughembe pimijhingii mu Lihema lya Chapanga, anda ntehi yenie nantenda kujhomwoka. Ghongo ubhaha nhwilo gwa machiko ghoha ghangapeta mu ibheluko ino yoha. <verse eid="LEV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 10:10" />Mipalwa kupembula pakate jha kilebhe chamaha na kilebhe kibhoho na ilebhe ijheketelwa na ilebhe yangajheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga pumunyinamila. <verse eid="LEV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 10:11" />Kabhele namabhola bhando bhuku Ichilahele mihilo jhoha Bhambo Chapanga jhampila Mucha annobholele.”<verse eid="LEV 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 10:12" />Peniya, Mucha ngannobholila Alune na yana yenie iighilike Eleazale na Itamale, “Ntolangane litambiko lya uhembe chikihighilike mu litambiko lya Bhambo Chapanga lilipitwe kwa mwotu, ntendekeya mabumunda ghangaleke ngedule, nnyengane pahina na chehemo jhukupiikiya matambiko, nhwalo jhenio ndi nyahinyahi hake. <verse eid="LEV 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 10:13" />Mangota nanyangana pa chehemo jha nyahinyahi, nhwalo lyenio ndi lipungu lino pamonga na yana ino, kuhumii mu litambiko lilipelekwa kwa Bhambo Chapanga kwa kukomelekelwa kwa mwotu, nhwalo yenie ndi chinnobholilwe. <verse eid="LEV 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 10:14" />Nambo mangota nnyangana kidale na libhondo lya ulelo lilijhinulwa ngita litambiko lilipiwa kwa Bhambo Chapanga. Nanyangana ilebhe yenio chehemo jhela jhaijhekatii Bhambo Chapanga, mwenga na yana ino inalome pamonga na ikeghe. llebhe yenie bhampile ibhehe lipungo lino mwenga na ibheluko ino kuhumii mu litambiko. <verse eid="LEV 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 10:15" />Bhaleta libhondo lela na kidale ipiitwa ngita litambiko kwa Bhambo Chapanga pamonga na litambiko lya mahuta pighajhochwa kwa mwotu, kupala ijhinulilwa kulangiya kubhehe ipiitwe kwa Bhambo Chapanga. Yenie naibhaha ino pamonga na ibheluko ino, ngita chalaghila Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="LEV 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 10:16" />Peniya, Mucha ngalingukiya hake mbuhe jhumo jwapihitwa litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho, nambo ngang'amwila kubhehe akibha akomalikilwe njwe. Yenie, Mucha ngabhayomila hake Eleazale na Itamale, yana ya Alune iighalike, ngabhakonyita, <verse eid="LEV 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 10:17" />“Nhwalo ghane nnijhe litambiko lyenio chehemo jhijheketilwe na Bhambo Chapanga, ipiitwa kunhwalo gwa Bhambo Chapanga, jhampii mangota, kupepulila uhakaho gwa bhando bhake Akaichilahele, kupala Bhambo Chapanga bhalekekeya uhakaho gwabhe. <verse eid="LEV 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 10:18" />Kabhele, nhwalo myahe jhenio iletitwe jhe nkate jha chehemo jha Lihema lya Chapanga, mpalitwa kulye nkate chehemo jha Lihema lya Chapanga, ngita chinnaghalikilwe.”<verse eid="LEV 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 10:19" />Alune ngannobholila Mucha, “Dolekeya, deleno yanango bhampiikile matambiko ghabhe gha kupepulila uhakaho na litambiko lya kukomelekeya palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, nambo ilebhe ngita yenie imbatite nenga. Anda nganyakila litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho deleno, bho, nganyeketilwe palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga?” <verse eid="LEV 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 10:20" />Mucha pajhohina malobhe gheniya, ngaleka kwayomela.<verse eid="LEV 10:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LEV 11" />
  <para style="s">Inyama ipalwa kulegwa na yangapalwa kulegwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 14:3-21">Kombokela 14:3-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 11:1" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha na Alune, <verse eid="LEV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 11:2" />“Malobholela bhando bhuku Ichilahele kubhehe, pakate jha inyama yoha itama pannema inyama ipalwa kulyegwa ndi henge, <verse eid="LEV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 11:3" />mihoto kulye kinyama chochoha china kipagha chikighabhanike na chinakudukula. <verse eid="LEV 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 11:4" />Nambo mangalye jhe kinyama chochoha chikidukula, nambo ipagha yake ighabhanike jhe, amu ipagha yake ighabhanike nambo kiduku jhe. Mangalye jhe ngamiya, nhwalo ngamiya idukula nambo ipagha yake ighabhanike jhe. Jwenio ijheketelwajhe palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 11:5" />Mangalye jhe kichechele jwenio idukula nambo ipagha yake ighabhanike jhe, jwenio ijheketelwa jhe palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 11:6" />Mangalye jhe kipecha, ku nhwalo idukula nambo ipagha yake ighabhanike jhe, jwenio ijheketelwa jhe palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 11:7" />Na Ligholobhe mangalye jhe ku nhwalo likwete ipagha ighabhanike, nambo liduku jhe, lyenio ndi mangalye jhe. <verse eid="LEV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 11:8" />Mangalye jhe inyama yenio hilu kupapaya mituhe jhabhe.<verse eid="LEV 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 11:9" />“Homba yoyoha yu kumbwane na mungemba ina maghabatilo na majheghe mihoto kulye. <verse eid="LEV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 11:10" />Nambo chochoha chikitama umbwane amu mungemba, changamaghabhatilo, yane chochoha chikityanga mumache na yoha ibhii naghome, yenie ndi ilebhe yukuichimwa kwino. <verse eid="LEV 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 11:11" />Ihumbe yenie mangalye jhe nyama jhabhe, na mituhe jhabhe ibha kilebhe chukuchimwa kwino. <verse eid="LEV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 11:12" />Kila kinyama chikibhii umache changa majheghe na maghabhatilo ndi kilebhe chikuchimwa kwino.”<verse eid="LEV 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 11:13" />“Nkoto kulye ijhune henge yangajheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga bheniya ndi, matumbuhe na lipokengano na kapongo, <verse eid="LEV 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 11:14" />na limbanga likele na aina jhoha jha mambanga, <verse eid="LEV 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 11:15" />na makongolo gha aina jhake, <verse eid="LEV 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 11:16" />na limbune na matungutu na matipitipe na kila aina yoha na nyanga, <verse eid="LEV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 11:17" />matungutu machoko na mnande na mahilimila, <verse eid="LEV 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 11:18" />litumbolumbenga na kiholobhele na mapanga, <verse eid="LEV 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 11:19" />chechengo na aina yowa ya koekoe na hudehude na inimenime.<verse eid="LEV 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 11:20" />“Na ikokoloko yoha ina mapapanilo ncheche na bhihoto kutyanga kwa makongono ncheche, yenie ndi yangajheketelwa kwino. <verse eid="LEV 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 11:21" />Nambo ibhii ikokoloko henge ina mapapanilo na ityanga kwa makongono ncheche ghukuhombela pannema, yenie ndi mihoto kulye. <verse eid="LEV 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 11:22" />Pakate jha henge, mihoto kulye madidima ghoha na madidima makolongwa ghoha na mambalangule ghoha. <verse eid="LEV 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 11:23" />Nambo ikokoloko yoha ikwabha ina mapapanilo, ibhii na makongono ncheche, ndi yangajheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 11:24" />“Inyama yenie ihoto kuntenda mma mangajheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, anda mundo jhojhoha jwapakupapaya mituhe jhabhe inyama yenie, najheketelwa jhe kwa Chapanga ade kimiye. <verse eid="LEV 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 11:25" />Mundo jwenio jwapakukamuu chochoha mu ntuhe abhaha kutale na bhajhake na ngobho yake ipulwa. <verse eid="LEV 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 11:26" />Mundo jhojhoha anda apapiye kinyama china kipagha chikighabhanike pakate, nambo kiduku jhe, mundo jwenio nabhaha jwangajheketelwa jhe kwa Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 11:27" />Inyama yoha ityanga kukulebhata ighanja yake pamonga nukubhe na makongono ncheche, mangalyejhe, na jhojhoha jwapakupapaya ntuhe gwa kinyama ngita chenio, nabhaha jwangajheketelwa kwa Bhambo Chapanga ade kimiye. <verse eid="LEV 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 11:28" />Mundo jhojhoha jwapa kughegha mituhe gwa inyama yenie nabhaha jwangajheketelwa kwa Bhambo Chapanga ade kimiye, inyama yenie ndi yangajheketelwa kwino.<verse eid="LEV 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 11:29" />“Kabhele ihumbe henge ndi yangajheketelwa kwino, kikobhe na likule na kila aina jha ibholobhondo, <verse eid="LEV 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 11:30" />na lighondo mache na lighondo na ibholobhondo na libholangwakwa na lwiya. <verse eid="LEV 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 11:31" />Bheniya bhoha ndi yangajheketelwa kwino na jhojhoha jwapakupapaya mituhe jhenie, nabhaha jwangajheketelwa kwa Bhambo Chapanga ade kimiye. <verse eid="LEV 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 11:32" />Anda ubhii ntuhe gwa ihumbe yenie ugwelii kilebhe chochoha, kibha kilebhe cha mbahu amu ngobho amu limbendela amu lijafafa amu chombo chochoha chikitumika ku lihengo lyolyoha, chombo chenie nakijheketelwa jhe palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga ade kimiye. Kupala kijheketelwa kipalwa kuchukwa kwa mache. <verse eid="LEV 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 11:33" />Anda ntuhe gwake ugwelii mu kihulo, kilebhe chikibhii nkate jhi kihulo chenio ndi nakijheketelwa jhe palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga na kihulo chenie kipalwa kikajhulwana. <verse eid="LEV 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 11:34" />Chakulya chochoha chikihoto kulegwa nambo kijhitikii mache kuhumii mu kihulo chenio, kijheketelwa jhe na chukunywe chikibhii mu kihulo chenie nakijheketelwa jhe palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 11:35" />Kila kilebhe chikigweliki na chehemo jha mtuhe nakijheketelwa jhe. Ngita kihinja amu kikalango, kipalwa kikajhulwane. Nakijheketelwa jhe, na yeneo ndi nakijheketelwa jhe kwino. <verse eid="LEV 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 11:36" />Pamonga na gheniya, kilibha amu chembwe cha mache nakibha njelembo, nambo chombo chochoha chikipa kupapaya ntuhe gwenio nakijheketelwa jhe. <verse eid="LEV 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 11:37" />Kipande chochoha cha ntuhe andakigwelii mbejho yukupanda, mbejho yenio naijheketelwa. <verse eid="LEV 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 11:38" />Nambo anda mbejho ite kutumbikwa umache na ntuhe ugwelii mbejho yenio, bhahe naibhaha yangajheketelwa kwino.<verse eid="LEV 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 11:39" />“Anda kinyama chochoha chikijheketelwa kulegwa, chikiweli chenie, jhojhoha jwapala kupapaya ntuhe gwenio, nabhaha jwangajheketelwa ade kimiye. <verse eid="LEV 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 11:40" />Mundo jhojhoha anda alile nyama jha ntuhe jwakiweli jwenie, apula ngobho yake na nabhaha jwangajheketelwa ade kimiye na jwapa kughegha ntuhe gwenio apula ngobho yake, najwenio nabhaha jwangajheketelwa ade kimiye.<verse eid="LEV 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 11:41" />“Na kila kilebhe chikikwabha pannema, mangalye jhe ndi changajheketelwa kwino. <verse eid="LEV 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 11:42" />Mangalye jhe kilebhe chochoha chikityanga kulutumbo lwake na kila chikityanga kwa makongono ncheche amu makongono ndii na kila chikikwabha, nhwalo ndi changajheketelwa kwino. <verse eid="LEV 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 11:43" />Kuyene mangahika kukanilwa kukulye ihumbe yenio ikwabha. <verse eid="LEV 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 11:44" />Ku nhwalo nenga ndi Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, mangota ndi ma bhando bhango, Bhambo Chapanga, yene mmaa ngita chimii nenga. <verse eid="LEV 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 11:45" />Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga jhunimmoita kuhumii ku kilambo chuku Michile, kupala kubhehe Chapanga gwino, mukijhelebhula, nhwalo nenga ndi nanyahinyahi.”<verse eid="LEV 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 11:46" />“Jhenje ndi mihilo pa inyama yenio, na ijhune na kila kihumbe chikibhii ghome chikitama umache na kila kihumbi chikityanga panane jha pannema, <verse eid="LEV 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 11:47" />mipalwa kumanya pakate jha yenie inyama ijheketelwa na yangajheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, na pakate jha kihumbi chikijheketelwa kulegwa na changajheketelwa kulegwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="LEV 11:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LEV 12" />
  <para style="s">Kwajhelebhuwa akakeghe kuhumii mu kupapa mwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 12:1" />Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, <verse eid="LEV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 12:2" />“Malobholela bhando bhu ku Ichilahele kubhehe, ‘Mwikeghe anda abhii na ndumbo na kupapa mwana munalome, nabhaha jwangajheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga ku kipinde cha machiko chaba tela na kipinde chapetela. <verse eid="LEV 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 12:3" />Mwana jwenio munalome ipalwa ajhingila jando lichiko lya nane. <verse eid="LEV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 12:4" />Na majhe jwenie ajhendelela kubhehe jwangajheketelwa kwa machiko chelechine na matato, akoto kupapaha kilebhe chochoha chanyahinyahi, hilu angajhingii jhe chehemo jha Nyahinyahi, ade machiko ghake ghukukijhelebhula ghajhomokele.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 12:5" />“Nambo anda apapite mwana mwikeghe, peniya nabha jwangajheketelwa kwa machiko kome na ncheche, ngita chibhii machiko ghake gha mwehe. Jhenio najhendelela kulendelela kwa machiko chitine na chita peniya najhelebhuka na myahe jhake kuleka.<verse eid="LEV 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 12:6" />“Anda machiko ghukujhelebhuka kwake ghatimile, na apapite mwana munalome amu mwikeghe, nabhampelekela mpiya litambiko pahina jha nnyango gwa Lihema lya Chapanga na litohe lilimbelele lya chaka chimo kubhehe litambiko lya kukomelekeya na lipupo lya ngunda amu njebha, kubhehe litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho, napeleka pa litangala lya Lihema lya Chapanga lya mpiya litambiko. <verse eid="LEV 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 12:7" />Mpiya litambiko napeleka ilebhe yenie nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, kupala kuntenda mwikeghe jwenio ajhelebhuke myahe naileka kupita. Yenie mwikeghe jwenio najhelebhuka kuhumii mumyahe jhake. Jhenio ndi mihilo ku mwikeghe jhojhoha jwapapite mwana munalome amu mwikeghe.<verse eid="LEV 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 12:8" />“Anda mwikeghe jwenio alepelile kupata litohe lya limbelele, aleta ngunda ibhele amu mapupo mabhele gha ngunda, limo kunhwalo gwa litambiko lya kukomelekeya na lenge kupepulila uhakaho. Kundela jhenie mpiya litambiko nantendela lihengo lya kunyelanicha na Chapanga, mwikeghe jwenio najheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="LEV 12:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LEV 13" />
  <para style="s">Mihilo jha malwalo gha malohe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 13:1" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha na Alune, <verse eid="LEV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 13:2" />“Mundo jhojhoha papakubhe na mandulumiya payegha jhake amu upele amu libaka lihuo, na kumanyikana kubhehe ndi malohe, peniya naletwa kwa mpiya litambiko Alune amu jhumo ya yana yake jwabhii mpiya litambiko. <verse eid="LEV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 13:3" />Mpiya litambiko napakulingukiya chehemo jhibhii na libhaka anda ghabhii majhunjo peniya ighalambwike na kubhehe nhuo mbuu, na chehemo jhenie anda ibhonikine itumbakile nkate jha yegha, mmanya gheniya malohe. Mpiya litambiko nantangacha mundo jwenio uhakaho ku ndela jhukunyinamii Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 13:4" />Nambo lindulumiya lyenie pamonukubhe linhuu lijhingii jhe nkate payegha na hilu majhunjo gha chehemo jhenio ghaghalambwike jhe kubhehe manhuu, mpiya litambiko nammeka pakanjika kukipinde cha machiko chaba. <verse eid="LEV 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 13:5" />Lichiko lya chaba, mpiya litambiko naningukiya kabhele mundo jwenio, na anda ahweine ulwalo gwenio ujhenii jhe payegha jhake, mpiya litambiko nammeka mundo jwenio pakanjika machiko ghange chaba. <verse eid="LEV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 13:6" />Mpiya litambiko naningukiya kabhele mundo jwenio lichiko lya chaba. Anda ahumbwii libaka lyenie lihobhalile lijhendele jhe, mpiya litambiko nantangacha mundo jwenio kubhehe njelembo, lyenio likibha libaka tugha. Mundo jwenio napula ngobho yake, jwenio najheketelwa na Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 13:7" />Nambo anda libaka lyenio lijheni payegha jhoha, kubhoke kwa mundo jwenio kuntangacha kubhehe alamite, mundo jwenio ipalwa kujhenda kukilangiya kabhele kwa mpiya litambiko. <verse eid="LEV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 13:8" />Mpiya litambiko naningukiya kabhele, anda libaka lyenio lijhenii payegha jhoha, mpiya litambiko nantangacha mundo jwenio kubhehe jwangajheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, kukunyinamii Chapanga, gheniya ndi malohe.<verse eid="LEV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 13:9" />“Anda mundo abhii na malohe, naletwa kwa mpiya litambiko. <verse eid="LEV 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 13:10" />Mpiya litambiko naningukiya, anda atehi kutupanila na majhunjo ghake ghabhii manhuo na kutupa kwenio kuyokite na kubhehe kilonda, na kijhendelela kupita uhila, <verse eid="LEV 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 13:11" />gheniya ndi malohe gha machiko ghamahele. Mpiya litambiko nantangacha mundo jwenio kubhehe jwangajheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, kwa ndela jha kunyinamii Chapanga. Mundo jwenio ipalwa jhe kummeka pakanjika nhwalo gwa kuningukiya nhwalo jwenio ajheketelwa jhe palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 13:12" />Anda malohe ghampatite na ghajhenii payegha jhoha, kuhumii palototohe ade kulwajho ngita chapakulola mpiya litambiko, <verse eid="LEV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 13:13" />mpiya litambiko nalingukiya kabhele. Anda nalola kubhehe yegha ighalambwike nakubhehe nhuo, bhahe, mundo jwenio nabhaha alamite. Yene, mpiya litambiko antangacha mundo jwenio kubhehe ijheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 13:14" />Nambo anda ibhonikine payegha jha mundo jwenio kilonda chochoha kiyono, bhahe, mundo jwenio natangachwa kubhehe ajheketelwa jhe palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 13:15" />Mpiya litambiko nalingukiya kilonda chenie na kuntangacha mundo jwenio jwangajheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, ku nhwalo gheniya ndi malohe. <verse eid="LEV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 13:16" />Nambo kilonda chenie anda kilamite nu kubhehe panhuu, mundo jwenio nabhujha kwa mpiya litambiko. <verse eid="LEV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 13:17" />Mpiya litambiko naningukiya anda alolite kubhehe kighalambwike kubhehe kihuu, nantangacha mundo jwenio ijheketelwa kukunyinamii Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 13:18" />“Anda mundo jwenio linkamwi lipute, na lyenio lilamite, <verse eid="LEV 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 13:19" />nambo chehemo jhenio paghalambwike kubhehe kitupo kihuu amu kubhehe pakele nambo pahulii kachoko, ipalwa anangiya mpiya litambiko. <verse eid="LEV 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 13:20" />Mpiya litambiko naningukiya mundo jwenio. Anda paghalambwike kubhehe libhomba na majhunjo gha peniya ghaghalambwike kubhehe manhuo, bhahe mpiya litambiko nantangacha mundo jwenio kubhehe ajheketelwa jhe kukunyinamii Chapanga, gwenie ndi ulwalo gwa malohe kuhumii mu lipute. <verse eid="LEV 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 13:21" />Nambo anda mpiya litambiko aningukiye mundo jwenio nu kuhumbu kubhehe majhunjo gha chehemo jhenio ghahulii jhe na hilu libhomba libhii jhe, nambo patumbwii kuhobhalela, ammeka pakanjika mundo jwenio ku kipinde cha machiko chaba. <verse eid="LEV 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 13:22" />Anda ulwalo gwenio ujhenii payegha jhoha, mpiya litambiko nantangacha mundo jwenio kubhehe ajheketelwa jhe kukunyinamii Chapanga, nhwalo abhii nu ulwalo gwa ulohe. <verse eid="LEV 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 13:23" />Nambo anda chehemo jhenie pajhenii jhe, jhenie ndi libhanga tugha lya lipute. Mpiya litambiko nantangacha mundo jwenio kubhehe ijheketelwa kunnyinamii Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 13:24" />“Anda mundo atinike mwotu na pala pipatinike paghalambwike kubhehe pakele pyu, na pahuo mbuu, amu pahuo, <verse eid="LEV 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 13:25" />mpiya litambiko anningukiya mundo jwenio. Anda alolite kubhehe majhunjo ghaghalambwike kubhehe manhuo na pabhii na libhomba, gheniya ndi malohe. Malohe gheniya ghapitii kwa ndela jha pena pipatinike. Mpiya litambiko nantangacha mundo jwenio kubhehe ajheketelwa jhe kukunyinamii Chapanga, nhwalo abhii na ulwalo gwa malohe. <verse eid="LEV 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 13:26" />Nambo mpiya litambiko anda alolite kubhehe majhunjo gha chehemo jhenie manhuo jhe na libhomba libhii jhe ndi palamite, mpiya litambiko nammeka mundo jwenio pakanjika kwa kipinde cha machiko chaba. <verse eid="LEV 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 13:27" />Lichiko lya chaba mpiya litambiko naningukiya. Anda ghajhenii payegha jhoha, mpiya litambiko nantangacha mundo jwenio kubhehe ajheketelwa jhe kukunyinamii Chapanga, nhwalo gwenio ndi ulwalo gwa malohe. <verse eid="LEV 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 13:28" />Nambo anda mabhanga gheniya ghajhenii jhe, nambo lilamite, kwenio kutupa kukubhokine na kutinika, mpiya litambiko nantangacha mundo jwenio kubhehe ijheketelwa kukunyinamii Bhambo Chapanga, nhwalo libhanga lyenio ndi lya kutinika tugha.<verse eid="LEV 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 13:29" />“Kwa mundo jhojhoha munalome amu mwikeghe, abhii ni kilonda umuto amu pikileo, <verse eid="LEV 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 13:30" />mpiya litambiko naningukiya ulwalo gwenio. Pamonukubhe mpiya litambiko alolite kubhehe pabhii nilibhanga na majhunjo ndi ghanjano ghighanyililike, nantangacha mundo jwenio kubhehe ijheketelwa jhe kukunyinamila Chapanga, nhwalo gheniya ndi malohe ghu umuto amu pi kileo. <verse eid="LEV 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 13:31" />Anda mpiya litambiko alingukiye libhii jhe libhanga na ghabhijhe majhunjo mapili, mpiya litambiko nammeka pakanjika mundo jwenio ku kipinde cha machiko chaba. <verse eid="LEV 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 13:32" />Lichiko lya chaba mpiya litambiko nalingukiya kilonda chenie. Anda kilonda chenie kijhenii jhe na majhunjo ghanjano jhe hilu ubhii jhe upele chehemo jhenio, <verse eid="LEV 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 13:33" />bhahe, mundo jwenio nachekula majhunjo amu ndeo yake. Nambo chehemo jhina upele nachekula jhe. Mpiya litambiko nammeka pakanjika mundo jwenio kwa machiko ghange chaba. <verse eid="LEV 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 13:34" />Lichiko lya chaba, mpiya litambiko naulingukiya upele gwenio. Anda upele gwenio ujhenii jhe payegha jhoha na hilu ujhendilii jhe mu yegha, nantangacha mundo jwenio kubhehe njelembo. Mundo jwenio ipalwa apula ngobho yake nabhaha ijheketelwa kukunnyinamii Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 13:35" />Nambo anda madowa gheniya ghajhenii payegha kuhumii mukulama, <verse eid="LEV 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 13:36" />mpiya litambiko naningukiya kabhele mundo jwenio anda madowa ghajhenii mu yegha, mpiya litambiko napalwa jhe kupalaha majhunjo gha njano, mundo jwenio nabhaha ijheketelwa jhe palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 13:37" />Nambo mpiya litambiko alolite kubhehe madowa ghalamite na majhunjo mapile pii ghamelite chehemo jhenie, ilonda yenie ilamite, mundo jwenio abhii njelembo. Mpiya litambiko nantangacha mundo jwenio kubhehe ijheketelwa kwa Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 13:38" />“Anda mundo jhojhoha, abha munalome amu mwikeghe, abhii na lidowa lihuo muyegha jhake, <verse eid="LEV 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 13:39" />mpiya litambiko naningukiya mundo jwenio. Anda mpiya litambiko nalibhona lidowa lyenio ndi lihuo lichoko, lyenio ndi lidowa tugha, mundo jwenio ijheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 13:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 13:40" />“Anda munalome abhii nulupanja, jwenio ndi njelembo nhwalo abhii nulupanja tugha. <verse eid="LEV 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 13:41" />Pamo nukubhe lupanja lwenio lujhenii kutumbulii kukihogho ade kukibhonge, mundo jwenio abhii nulupanja tugha na abhii ijheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 13:42" />Nambo anda pamuto pu lupanja amu pilibhonge pu lupanja pabhii na mapunye makele amu mahuo, gheniya ndi malohe ghighapitii mulupanja lwake umuto amu pikibhonge chake. <verse eid="LEV 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 13:43" />Mpiya litambiko naningukiya mundo jwenio. Anda nalola kutupa kukele amu kuhuo pulubhanja amu pikibhonge chake nu kubhonekana ngita malohe muyegha yake, <verse eid="LEV 13:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 13:44" />mundo jwenio abhii na malohe, jwenio ndi ajheketelwa jhe kwa Bhambo Chapanga. Nhwalo abhii ni ulwalo umuto gwake.<verse eid="LEV 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 13:45" />“Mundo jwabhii na malohe nawala ngobho jhijwepwike na majhunjo angakwemula jhe na nayekelela nnomo gwake nu kulonge kanonoya, ‘Mangamandikii jhe nenga nijheketelwa jhe kunyinamii Bhambo Chapanga!’ <verse eid="LEV 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 13:46" />Najhendelela kubhehe jwangajheketelwa kukunyinamii Chapanga, ku kipinde choha chabhii na ulwalo gwenio. Jwenio ndi ajheketelwa jhe kukunyinamii Bhambo Chapanga, natama jhika ndo panja jha kighono.”<verse eid="LEV 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngobho ibhii na madowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 13:47" />“Anda kubhii aina jha madowa makele amu mahuo mu ngobho, jhitengenichwe kwa mangoma gha mambelele amu ngobho nhuo, <verse eid="LEV 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 13:48" />ngobho jhenie ibha jhikulokwa amu jhukupuma kwa nyuche nhuu amu mangoma gha limbelele amu ngobho jhitengenichwe ni limbendela, <verse eid="LEV 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 13:49" />anda madowa ghenio ghabhii na lange jhilikolo amu ngele mu ngobho jhenio, pange gheniya ndi malohe, ipalwa kunangii mpiya litambiko. <verse eid="LEV 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 13:50" />Mpiya litambiko nalingukiya madowa gheniya na kuibheka ngobho jhenie pakanjika ku kipinde cha machiko chaba. <verse eid="LEV 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 13:51" />Lichiko lya chaba mpiya litambiko nalingukiya madowa gheniya. Anda madowa ghajheniii mu ngobho jhenie, bhahe, ngobho jhenio ijheketelwa jhe kwa Bhambo Chapanga, nhwalo ibhii na malohe. <verse eid="LEV 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 13:52" />Mpiya litambiko naijhocha mwotu ngobho jhenie, nhwalo ibhii na madowa ghukuhalibii ngobho.<verse eid="LEV 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 13:53" />“Mpiya litambiko anda alingukii ngobho jhenio nukulola madowa gwenio ujhenii jhe mu ngobho, <verse eid="LEV 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 13:54" />bhahe, nalaghila ngobho yenie ipulwa nu kubhekwa pakanjika kukipinde chenge cha machiko chaba. <verse eid="LEV 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 13:55" />Kubhoke pa machiko chaba mpiya litambiko nalingukiya ngobho yenie kabhele. Anda lange jhela jha madowa ghaghalambwike jhe na ata ubhehe ghajhenijhe madowa, ngobho jhenie ndi njapo kukunyinamii Chapanga. Ngobho yenie nijhochwa mwotu, anda ibhii na nginyililo jha malohe ghenio nnonge amu unyuma jha ngobho jhenie. <verse eid="LEV 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LEV 13:56" />Anda mpiya litambiko alolite kubhehe madowa gheniya ghahobhite kuhumii pukupula ngobho, najwepula chehemo jhijhambukiwe madowa gheniya ghihalibhii ngobho amu limbendela. <verse eid="LEV 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LEV 13:57" />Nambo anda madowa gheniya ghabhujhii kabhele mu ngobho jhilokitwe amu jhipumitwe amu kilebhe chochoha chi limbendela, bhahe, madowa gheniya ghukuhalabii ngobho ghajhenii, peniya ngobho jhenie mijhocha mwotu. <verse eid="LEV 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LEV 13:58" />Nambo ngobho jhitengenichwe kukulokwa amu jhukupuma kwa nyuche nhuo amu mangoma gha limbelele amu ngobho jhitengenichwe kwa limbendela, anda madowa ghapitii kubhokee pukupulwa, ngobho yenio ipalwa ipulwa kabhele kupala ijheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga.” <verse eid="LEV 13:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LEV 13:59" />Jhenie ndi mihilo kunhwalo gwa madowa ghighapitii mu ngobho ghukujhambukii ngobho jhitengenichwe kwa mangoma gha limbelele amu ngobho nhuo, ibha yukupuma amu ilokitwe amu ilimbendela. Ku ndela jhenie mihoto kumanya pakate jha ngobho jhanga uhako na jhela jhibhiii niuhako kwa kunyinamii Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 13:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LEV 14" />
  <para style="s">Kujhelebhuka kuhumii pukulwalwa malwalo gha payegha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 14:1" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila kabhele Mucha, <verse eid="LEV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 14:2" />“Jhenje ndi mihilo jha mundo jhuna malohe mu lichiko lya kujhelebhulwa kwake. Kuhumii pu kulama naletwa kwa mpiya litambiko. <verse eid="LEV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 14:3" />Mpiya litambiko najhenda panja jha kighono kuningukiya panja jha kighono. Anda malohe gheniya ghalamite, <verse eid="LEV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 14:4" />mpiya litambiko nalaghalikiya bhando bhaleta ijhune ibhele, ijheketelwa na Chapanga ibhii ghome na kipande cha nkongo cha mweleze na mangoma gha limbelele gha lange ngele na lindabhe lya hichopo, ku nhwalo gwa mundo jwenio jwapakujhelebhulwa. <verse eid="LEV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 14:5" />Mpiya litambiko nalaghalikiya bhachinja kijhune chimo mu kibhegha china mache ghambone gha chembwe. <verse eid="LEV 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 14:6" />Mpiya litambiko natola kijhune chenge chela chikibhii ghome na kipande cha lundabhe lwa mweleze na mangoma gha limbelele gha lange ngele na lindabhe lya hichopo, na kuchwiya yoha mu myahe jhi kijhune chenie chikichinjwite. <verse eid="LEV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 14:7" />Peniya, namichila myahe jhenie mala chaba mundo jwenio jwa jhelebhulwa, peniya, nantangacha mundo jwenio ajheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. Kijhune chikibhii ghome chela nabhakileka kijhende panja jha muche. <verse eid="LEV 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 14:8" />Mundo jwenio napula ngobho yake, nachekula majhunjo ghake na kujhogha, jwenio najheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. Kubhoke peniya, nakelebhuka kukighono, nambo natama panja jha lihema lyake kwa machiko chaba. <verse eid="LEV 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 14:9" />Lichiko lya chaba nachekula kabhele majhunjo ghake ghoha na ndeo na ngopolelo. Peniya, napula ngobho yake nu kujhogha mache, na jwenie najheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 14:10" />“Lichiko lya nane naleta matohe gha mankambako gha mambelele mabhele ghangalemala na litohe limo lya limbelele lyankolo lyangalemala lya chaka chimo ghangalemala, kilo itato ya uhembe ghunakutema ghuhunyitwe na mahuta ku nhwalo gwa litambiko lya uhembe pamonga na mahuta gha micheitune kolobohe chita. <verse eid="LEV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 14:11" />Mpiya litambiko jwapala kunnyelebhuha mundo jwenio, nanneta palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga pahina na litangala lya Lihema lyu Chapanga pamonga na ilebhe yaletite. <verse eid="LEV 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 14:12" />Mpiya litambiko natola litohe lya limbelele lyankambako limo na kumpiikiya litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho pamonga na mahuta ghala gha micheitune. Natondobheya kunane kulangii ampikii Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 14:13" />Peniya, nanchinja limbelele lyenie, chehemo jha nyahinyahi, pibhachinjii inyama ibhapiya litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho na litambiko lya kukomelekeya. Litambiko lyenie lya kupepulila uhakaho, ngita chibhii litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho, yenio ndi ilebhe yake mpiya litambiko, nhwalo ihumii mu litambiko lya nyahinyahi hake. <verse eid="LEV 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 14:14" />Mpiya litambiko natola myahe jhandina kuhumii mu myahe jha litambiko lya kupepula uhakaho na kumpakaya mundo jwenie jwajhelebhulwa, upandi gwa ulelo gwa lichikilo lyake na lighumba lya mu lubhoko lwa ulelo na lighumba lyake lya mu lukongono lwa ulelo. <verse eid="LEV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 14:15" />Peniya, mpiya litambiko napongola mahuta ghandina gha micheitune na kujhitii mu kighanja chulubhoko lwake lwangejha. <verse eid="LEV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 14:16" />Ngachwiya lukonje lwake lwa ulelo mu mahuta ghighabhii mu kighanja chake cha ngejha, na kummichila mundo jwenio mala chaba nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 14:17" />Mahuta ghange ghighahighilike mukighanja chake nampakaya mundo jwenio jwajhelebhulwa, pa kilemeleme cha lichikilo lya ulelo na lighumba lya mu lubhoko lwa ulelo na lighumba lya mu lukongono lwake lwa ulelo, chehemo jhejhe pibhampakite myahe jha litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho. <verse eid="LEV 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 14:18" />Mahuta ghighahighilike bhampakaya mundo jwenio pa muto. Yene, mpiya litambiko chantendela ujhelanicho palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 14:19" />“Peniya, mpiya litambiko napiya litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho na kuntende ujhelanicho mundo jwenio palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga kupala kumpepulila kwangajeketelwa kwake. Peniya, nachinja litohe lya limbelele lya litambiko lya kukomelekeya. <verse eid="LEV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 14:20" />Mpiya litambiko napiya litambiko lya kukomelekeya lela na litambiko lya uhembe chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko. Yene, mpiya litambiko nantendela mundo jwenio ujhelanicho na Bhambo Chapanga, na jwenie najheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 14:21" />“Nambo anda mundo jwenio ndi nhwocho, jwanga hoto kupiya ilebhe yenio, bhahe naleta litohe limo lya limbelele lyankambako libhehe litambiko lya malepo ghake, ku nhwalo gwa kunyelanicha mundo jwenie. Helehela naleta kilo jhimo jha uhembe ghunakutema ghuhangalinwe na mahuta ku nhwalo gwa litambiko lya uhembe na mahuta kolobohe chita. <verse eid="LEV 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 14:22" />Naleta ngunda bhabhele amu mapupo mabhele gha ngunda anda chahotola, jhumo abha jwa litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho na jhonge ku nhwalo gwa litambiko lya kukomelekelwa. <verse eid="LEV 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 14:23" />Lichiko lya nane nannetela mpiya litambiko ilebhe yoha nnonge jha litangala lya Lihema lya Chapanga, ku nhwalo gwa kujhelebhulwa kwake nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 14:24" />Mpiya litambiko natola litohe lya nkambako lya limbelele lya litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho pamonga na mahuta ghala kolobohe chita na kutondobheya kunane kulangii ampikii Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 14:25" />Mpiya litambiko nachinja litohe lya limbelele lya nkambako lya litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho. Mpiya litambiko natola myahe jhandina na kumpakaya mundo jwenio jwajhelebhulwa, pa kilemeleme cha lichikilo lyake lya ulelo na mu lighumba lya mu lubhoko lwake lwa ulelo na lighumba lya mulukongono lwake lwa ulelo. <verse eid="LEV 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 14:26" />Mpiya litambiko napongola mahuta ghandina mu kighanja chake chu lubhoko lwa ngejha, <verse eid="LEV 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 14:27" />ku lukonje lwake lwa ulelo nachwiya mu mahuta ghighabhii mu kighanja chake cha ngejha na kummichii mundo jwenio mala chaba nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 14:28" />Mpiya litambiko nampakaya mahuta mundo jwenio jwajhelebhulwa pa kilemeleme cha lichikilo lyake lya ulelo na mu lighumba lya mu libhoko lya ulelo na lighumba lyake lya lukongono lwa ulelo. Nampakaya mahuta ghala ghighahighilike mu kighanja chake chehemo jhela pibhampakiya myahe jhilitambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho. <verse eid="LEV 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 14:29" />Mahuta ghighahighilike mulubhoko lwake nampakaya mundo jwenio pa muto, kupala kuntende ujhelanicho mundo jwenio nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 14:30" />Peniya, mpiya litambiko natola ngunda jhumo pakate jha ngunda amu ngunda ibhele kulengana na mundo jwenio chahoto kuleta. <verse eid="LEV 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 14:31" />Ngunda jhumo ku nhwalo gwa litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho na jhonge ku nhwalo gwa litambiko lyu kukomelekeya, pamonga na matambiko gheniya, kukutenda yene, mpiya litambiko nantendela mundo jwenio ujhelanicho palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 14:32" />Jhenie ndi mihilo kwa mundo jhojhoha jhuna malohe, jwangahoto kupiya matambiko ghala gha kunnyelebhuwa.”<verse eid="LEV 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Madowa gha mu nyumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 14:33" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila kabhele Mucha na Alune, <verse eid="LEV 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 14:34" />“Kipinde chimpa kujhingii mu kilambo cha ku Kanaane chinimpe kubhehe chino, na pumbakuleta madowa mu lipamanda lya nyumba jhimo, mu kilambo chenie, <verse eid="LEV 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 14:35" />bhahe, nkolo nyumba jhenio, ipalwa annobholela mpiya litambiko kubhehe kibhii kilebhe kilandine ngita madowa mu nyumba jhake. <verse eid="LEV 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 14:36" />Mpiya litambiko nalaghalikiya ilebhe yoha ya mu nyumba jhenio, bhapiya panja kabula jwenie nukulingukiijhe, kupala kilebhe chochoha mu nyumba jhenie changatangachwa jhe kubhehe changajheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. Yenie mpiya litambiko najhingila kulingukiya nyumba jhenio, <verse eid="LEV 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 14:37" />nalingukiya madowa gheniya, anda madowa gheniya ghabhonikine mu lipamanda na ulembelekii malembelo gha lange jha likolo amu ngele na kubhonekana ghahelelii na kunhwininila mu lipamanda, <verse eid="LEV 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 14:38" />bhahe, mpiya litambiko napita panja na kudinda nnyango gwa nyumba jhenio kwa machiko chaba. <verse eid="LEV 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 14:39" />Lichiko lya chaba mpiya litambiko nahika na kulingukiya mu nyumba jhenio. Anda madowa ghenio ghajhenii mu mapamanda gha nyumba jhenie, <verse eid="LEV 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 14:40" />mpiya litambiko nalaghalikiya maghanga ghighabhii chehemo jhina madowa maghabhowe na kughataghii chehemo jhangajheketelwa na Bhambo Chapanga panja jha muche. <verse eid="LEV 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 14:41" />Undope gwa nyumba jhenio ukwendwa na ndunda yake itaghilwa chehemo jhangajheketelwa na Bhambo Chapanga panja jha muche. <verse eid="LEV 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 14:42" />Peniya, nabhatola maghanga mahyono na kuchenga chehemo jhibhatiluline, nabheniya, nabhakilima kabhele nyumba jhenio.<verse eid="LEV 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 14:43" />“Anda madowa ghenio ghabhujhii kabhele panyumba jhenio kuhumii pukubhoha maghanga gheniya na kung'amatula undope na kukilima kabhele, <verse eid="LEV 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 14:44" />mpiya litambiko ipalwa ahika kulingukiya. Anda madowa gheniya ghajheniii mu nyumba jhenio, gheniya ndi madowa ghukuhangabhana, mundo angatama jhe munyumba jhenie, nhwalo ijheketelwa jhe palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 14:45" />Nyumba jhenio, ipalwa itilulwana na maghanga ghake na mikongo jhake na ndunda jha nyumba ipelekwa chehemo jhangajheketelwa na Bhambo Chapanga panja jha muche. <verse eid="LEV 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 14:46" />Kupeta gheniya, jhojhoha jwapakujhingii mu nyumba jhenio kubhoke pukudinda, nabha jwangajheketelwa jhe palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga ade kimiye. <verse eid="LEV 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 14:47" />Jhojhoha jwagholoka mu nyumba jhenio amu kulele chakulya mu nyumba jhenio, impala apula ngobho yake.<verse eid="LEV 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 14:48" />“Kuhumii pu kukilima nyumba yenio, mpiya litambiko alolite kubhehe madowa ghajhenii jhe, bhahe, mpiya litambiko natangacha kubhehe nyumba jhenio ijheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, ku nhwalo madowa ghajhomwike. <verse eid="LEV 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 14:49" />Kupala kujhelebhuha nyumba jhenio, nkolo nyumba naleta ijhune ibhele pamonga na kipandi cha mweleze na mangoma makele gha limbelele na lundabhe lwa nkongo gwa hichopo. <verse eid="LEV 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 14:50" />Mpiya litambiko nachinja kijhune chimo pi kibhegha china mache ghamaha gha chembwe. <verse eid="LEV 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 14:51" />Natola kipandi cha nkongo gwa mweleze na lindabhe lya hichopo na ng'ojhe ngele pamonga na kijhune chikibhii ghome na kuchwiya yoha mu myahe jhi kijhune chela chikichinjwitwe. Peniya, namichila nyumba jhenie myahe mala chaba. <verse eid="LEV 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 14:52" />Yene, ndi chaipalwa kujhelebhuha nyumba jhenio kwa myahe jha kijhune na mache ghambone gha chembwe na kijhune chikibhii ghome na lundabhe lwa nkongo gwa mweleze na lindabhe lya hichopo na ng'ojhe ngele. <verse eid="LEV 14:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 14:53" />Peniya, kijhune chela chikibhi ghome nabhakileka kijhende kumanyahe. Kukutenda yene, nyumba jhenio naijhelebhulilwa, na nibha ijheketilwe palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="LEV 14:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 14:54" />“Jhenje ndi mihilo ku nhwalo gwa aina jhojhoha jha malohe, <verse eid="LEV 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 14:55" />malohe gha mu ngobho amu gha mu nyumba, <verse eid="LEV 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LEV 14:56" />kutupa na lipute amu libaka linhuo amu likele, <verse eid="LEV 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LEV 14:57" />kupala kulangii kilebhe ghane chikijheketilwa kwa Bhambo Chapanga. Jhenje ndi mihilo ku nhwalo jha aina yoha ya malohe.”<verse eid="LEV 14:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LEV 15" />
  <para style="s">Ilebhe impita mundo nukuntenda angajheketelwa na Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 15:1" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha na Alune, <verse eid="LEV 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 15:2" />malobholele Akaichilahele kubhehe, kipinde munalome jhojhoha pumpita uwila payegha, uwila gwenio ghuntenda angajheketelwa jhe palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 15:3" />Jhenje ndi mihilo ku nhwalo gwa uwila gwenio, kipinde chochoha pupita uwila amu uwila pubhe nkate jhake, mundo jwenio ndi ijheketelwa jhe kukunyinamii Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 15:4" />Kindanda chochoha chapakugholokela amu chapakutamila, nakibha kijheketelwa jhe kukunyinamii Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 15:5" />Mundo jhojhoha jwapakupapaya kindanda chake mundo jwenio ipalwa apula ngobho yake nu kujhogha, na jwenie nabhaha jwangajheketelwa ade kimiye. <verse eid="LEV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 15:6" />Mundo jhojhoha jwapakutamila kilebhe chochoha chatamii mundo jwenio jhughumpita uwila, ipalwa apula ngobho yake nu kujhogha najheketelwa jhe kunyinamii Chapanga ade kimiye. <verse eid="LEV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 15:7" />Mundo jhojhoha jwapakunkamula mundo jwapita uwila, ipalwa apula ngobho yake nu kujhogha, jwenie najheketelwa jhe kunyinamii Chapanga ade kimiye. <verse eid="LEV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 15:8" />Mundo jhojhoha jhughumpita uwila anda anhwunii mata mundo jhojhoha, ipalwa mundo jwenio jwahunwilwe mata apula ngobho yake, nu kujhogha, jwenie najheketelwa jhe kunyinamii Chapanga ade kimiye. <verse eid="LEV 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 15:9" />Litandiko lyolyoha lya kutamila panane jha kinyama anda atamii mundo jwapita uwila nalibha lijheketelwa jhe kukunyinamii Chapanga kundela jhukunyinamii Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 15:10" />Mundo jhojhoha jwapakukamuu kilebhe chochoha chatami mundo jwenio, najheketelwa jhe kunyinamii Chapanga ade kimiye. Mundo jhojhoha jwatweke kilebhe chochoha chikibhii cha mundo jwenio jwapita uwila, ipalwa kupula ngobho yake nu kujhogha, na jwenie nabhaha ijheketelwa jhe kukunyinamii Chapanga ade kimiye. <verse eid="LEV 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 15:11" />Mundo jhojhoha jwapita uwila anda ankunywii mundo changagholola hote mabhoko ghake nu kujhogha, jwakunywilwe jhola nabhaha ijheketelwa jhe kukunyinamii Chapanga ade kimiye. <verse eid="LEV 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 15:12" />Chombo chochoha cha undope chakamwile na mundo jwapita uwila kipalwa kikajhulwane. Nambo chombo chochoha cha mbau kipalwa kichukwa kwa mache.<verse eid="LEV 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 15:13" />Munalome jhojhoha jwapita uhila anda alamite ulwalo gwake, mundo jwenio ipalwa akilolela machiko chaba kabula changajhelebhulwa kwangajheketelwa kwake. Apula ngobho yake nu kujhogha mache ghu kuloche, jwenie najheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 15:14" />Lichiko lya nane, ipalwa aleta ngunda ibhele amu mapupo mabhele gha ngunda nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga pannyango gwa Lihema lya Chapanga nu kukamuya mpiya litambiko. <verse eid="LEV 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 15:15" />Mpiya litambiko nabhapiya yenie, jhumo kunhwalo gwa litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho na jhonge kunhwalo gwa litambiko lya kukomelekeya, mpiya litambiko jwenio nahenga lihengo lyu kunyelanicha na Bhambo Chapanga nu kumpepula ghola gwangajheketelwa gwake kwa kumpita uwila. <verse eid="LEV 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 15:16" />Anda munalome jhojhoha aholola mbejho yake jwenie, ipalwa ajhogha yegha jhoha kwa mache, jwenio nabhaha jwangajheketelwa ade kimiye. <verse eid="LEV 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 15:17" />Ngobho jhojhoha amu limbendela lilijhitikii mbejho yake jwenie, ighololwa kwa mache, naibha jhangajheketelwa ade kimiye. <verse eid="LEV 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 15:18" />Anda munalome agholwike na mwikeghe na kumpita mbejho yake, bhipalwa bhoha bhabhele bhajhogha mache, bheniya nabhabha bhangajheketelwa ade kimiye.<verse eid="LEV 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 15:19" />Mwikeghe jhojhoha pabhehe mu kipinde chake cha piye, nabhaha jwangajheketelwa kwa Bhambo Chapanga, kwa machiko chaba. Mundo jhojhoha jwapakumpapaha mwikeghe jwenio nabha jwangajheketelwa kukunyinamii Chapanga ade kimiye. <verse eid="LEV 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 15:20" />Kilebhe chochoha chagholokela amu kutamila kipinde chenio, kilebhe chenie nakibha changajheketelwa kukunyinamii Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 15:21" />Mundo jhojhoha jwapakukamuu kindanda cha mwikeghe jwenio, ipalwa apula ghobho yake nu kujhogha mache, jwenio nabhaha jwangajheketelwa kukunyinamii Chapanga ade kimiye. <verse eid="LEV 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 15:22" />Mundo jhojhoha jwapakukamuu kilebhe chochoha chatamila mwikeghe jwenio, ipalwa apula ghobho yake nu kujhogha mache, jwenio nabhaha jwangajheketelwa kukunyinamii Chapanga ade kimiye. <verse eid="LEV 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 15:23" />Munalome jhojhoha anda akamwii kilebhe chochoha chagholokile amu kutamila mwikeghe jwenio, najheketelwa jhe palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga ade kimiye. <verse eid="LEV 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 15:24" />Anda munalome agholwike na mwikeghe jwenio na myahe jha mwikeghe jwenio indonyikii munalome jwenio, munalome jwenio najheketelwa jhe palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, ku kipinde cha machiko chaba. Kindanda chochoha chapa kugholokela munalome jwenio nakijheketelwa jhe palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 15:25" />Mwikeghe jwapita myahe kwa machiko ghamahele amu kumpita myahe machiko ghake jhe ghukupita, najhendelela kubhehe jwangajheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, ku kipinde choha cha piye, ngita chibhii kipinde chake cha machiko ghake gha piye. <verse eid="LEV 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 15:26" />Kindanda chochoha chagholokela amu kigoda chochoha chatamila, nakijheketelwa jhe palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga tela ni kipinde cha piye. <verse eid="LEV 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 15:27" />Mundo jhojhoha jwapakukamuu ilebhe yene, najheketelwa jhe na Bhambo Chapanga, na ipalwa apula ngobho yake nu kujhogha, jwenio najheketelwa jhe na Bhambo Chapanga ade kimiye. <verse eid="LEV 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 15:28" />Kubhoke pukuleka kupita myahe jhake mwikeghe jwenio, nakilolela kwa machiko chaba kupala kubhehe njelembo, nu kubhoke peniya, najheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 15:29" />Lichiko lya nane natola njebha ibhele amu mapupo mabhele gha ngunda nu kunnete mpiya litambiko palitangala lya Lihema lya Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 15:30" />Mpiya litambiko champiya jhumo ku nhwalo jha litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho na jhonge kunhwalo gwa litambiko lya kukomelekeya. Ku ndela jhenie mpiya litambiko nantendela mwikeghe jwenio ujhelanicho palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga na kumpepula gwangajheketelwa gwake gwa kupita myahe.<verse eid="LEV 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 15:31" />“Mipalwa makelebhuwa Akaichilahele bhangahenga jhe ilebhe ipakwabheka bhabha bhangajheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, bhangahakaha jhe kitamo chango chinikihagwile, chikibhii pakate jhino, anda bhajhingii mwenio na gwangajheketela palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, anda nabhatenda yene nabhawa.”<verse eid="LEV 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 15:32" />Jhenio ndi mihilo ku nhwalo gwa munalome jwapita uwila na jwapita mbejho yake nu kubhehe jwangajheketelwa kukunyinamii Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 15:33" />Mihilo jhenio ghinnenga mwikeghe jwabhii mu machiko ghake gha piye nu kubhehe jwangajheketelwa na Bhambo Chapanga. Hele mihilo jhenio impala munalome amu mwikeghe jhojhoha jwapita chochoha na helahela munalome jwagholoka nu mwikeghe, jwenio ajheketelwa jhe palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LEV 16" />
  <para style="s">Lichiko lya kujhelenicha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 16:1" />Bhambo Chapanga ngalongila na Mucha, kubhoke pukujhomoka yana ibhele ya Alune, pibhanheghelila Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 16:2" />Ngannobholila, “Munnobholela nnongo gwino Alune angajhingii jhe Chehemo jha Nyahinyahi Hake kuhyeto jha lipanjiya, ngita chapala jwenie. Angajhingii jhe peniya nhwalo ndi pambakupitila mulihunde kunane jhi kiyekelelo chi Lichanduko lya Lilaghano hele kikemitwa chehemo pukulekekeya uhakaho. Anda nukujhoha jhe, nantenda kuwegha. <verse eid="LEV 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 16:3" />Alune najhingila Chehemo Jha Nyahinyahi Hake, ipalwa apiya litohe lya likambako lya ng'ombi ku nhwalo gwa litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho na likambako lya limbelele ku nhwalo gwa litambiko lya kukomelekeya.”<verse eid="LEV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 16:4" />“Najhogha yegha yoha kwa mache, kubhoke peniya, nawala ngobho yambone yu upiya litambiko. Najhingila chehemo jhenio kongo awalite ngobho yambone yu upiya litambiko, chuluale na likanjo nu kutabha luhunga lwa ngobho nhuo luna kuhalala luna malembelo.”<verse eid="LEV 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 16:5" />Natola kubhoke mulungolo lwa bhando bhu ku Ichilahele, mankambako mabhele gha mbuhe ku nhwalo gwa litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho na limbelele lyankambako limo kunhwalo gwa litambiko lya kukomelekeya. <verse eid="LEV 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 16:6" />Alune nampiya linkambako lya ng'ombi libhaha litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho, ku nhwalo gwake jwene, nu kutenda ujhelanicho gwake jwene na Chapanga helahela kwajhelenicha akalongo bhake na Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 16:7" />Kubhoke peniya, natola mankambako mabhele gha mbuhe, naghabheka pa litangala lya Lihema lya Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 16:8" />Naghatendela kiumbuumbu nnobhole makambako mabhele gha mbuhe, jhumo ku nhwalo gwa Bhambo Chapanga na mbuhe jhonge ku nhwalo gwa kugheghechwa uhakaho nukupelekwa ku njenga kwa Azazele. <verse eid="LEV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 16:9" />Alune naleta mbuhe jhankambo jhola jwahaghulilwe kwa kiumbuumbu nnobhole, ku nhwalo gwa kumpiikiya Bhambo Chapanga nu kumpiya litambiko lya kupepulila malemwa. <verse eid="LEV 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 16:10" />Nambo mbuhe jwankambako jwahaghulilwe kwa kihumbuumbu nnobhole ku nhwalo gwa kumpeleka kwa Azazele, napiywa nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga kongo abhii ghome kupala atenda lihengo lya kujhelanicha. Kubhoke peniya, mpiya litambiko nanneka ajhabhule kumanyahe abhii ngita jwatwekii malemwa gha bhando bhoha bhuku Ichilahele.<verse eid="LEV 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 16:11" />“Alune nampiya likambako lya ng'ombi ku nhwalo gwa litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho gwake jwenie, nu kutenda ujhelanicho na Bhambo Chapanga ku nhwalo gwake jwenie na ku nhwalo gwa akalongo mundo, peniya, nachinja likambako lya ng'ombi jwenio litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho. <verse eid="LEV 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 16:12" />Kabhele natola kitecho na makalakala gha mwotu kubhoke pa chehemo jhukupiikiya litambiko nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, nu ubane ngohi ibhele ghuyagwitwe mbone ghuna kunungilila petelele, nauleta nkate jha chehemo jha nyahinyahi hake. <verse eid="LEV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 16:13" />Nauleta ubane gwenio nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, kupala malyohe ghubane gwenio ghayekelela kiyekelelo cha Lichanduko lya Lilaghano, hele kwa liina lenge kikemwa kigoda cha umbone, kupala angawe jhe. <verse eid="LEV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 16:14" />Peniya, natola myahe jhandina jha linkambako lya ng'ombi mulukonje lwake nu kumichila chehemo jha kiyekelelo mala chaba na palonge jha Lichanduko lya Lilaghano mala chaba.<verse eid="LEV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 16:15" />“Peniya, nanchinja mbuhe jwa litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho, kunhwalo gwa bhando bhoha. Myahe jha mbuhe jwenio naileta nkate jha lipanjiya nu kutenda ngita chatehila myahe jha ng'ombi nu kumichila mala chaba pa kiyekelelo na nnonge jha Lichanduko lya Lililaghano. <verse eid="LEV 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 16:16" />Kukutenda yene, nabha ajhelewiye Chehemo jha Nyahinyahi Hake, ku nhwalo gwa kukanilwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, kwa uhakaho gwabhe gwogwoha kwa bhando bhuku Ichilahele. Atenda yene, kunhwalo Lihema lya Chapanga libhii panakate jha bhando bheniya bhibhatenda ilebhe yangajheketelwa na Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 16:17" />Kipinde Alune papakujhingii mwenio Chehemo jha Nyahinyahi Hake, kukijhelanicha kunhwalo gwake jwenio na akalongo mundo na bhando bhoha bhuku Ichilahele, pangabhe jhe mundo jhojhoha nkate jha Lihema lya Chapanga ade papakujhomolela nu kupita panja. <verse eid="LEV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 16:18" />Peniya, Alune ipalwa kupita panja jha lihema nu kukijhelanicha chehemo jhi kupiikiya litambiko lya kukomelekeya. Natola myahe jhandina jha ng'ombi jhola na myahe jha mbuhe jhola nu kupakaya mu manyelo gha chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko. <verse eid="LEV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 16:19" />Kabhele, namichila chehemo jhenio jha kupiikiya litambiko myahe kwa lukonje lwake mala chaba, kukutenda yene naibha ijheketelwa ku nhwalo gwa uhakaho gwoha gwa bhando bhuku Ichilahele.<verse eid="LEV 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuhe jwapelikwa kunjenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 16:20" />“Alune papakujhomolela kujhelebhuwa Chehemo jha Nyahinyahi na Lihema lya Chapanga, na chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko, nanneta mbuhe jhukumpiya panja jha kighono, ku nhwalo gwa malemwa gha bhando, kongo abhii ghome. <verse eid="LEV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 16:21" />Na Alune abheka mabhoko ghake pa muto gwa mbuhe jwankambako jwenio jwabhii ghome, nu kulonge malemwa ghoha gha bhando bhuku Ichilahele na uhakaho gwabhe kupala ghabhe panane jha muto gwa mbuhe jwenio. Peniya, na mundo jhojhoha kukupala jwenie nampelika mbuhe jwenio kunjenga. <verse eid="LEV 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 16:22" />Mundo jwenio nannekekeya mbuhe jwenio kunjenga kongo atoi malemwa gha bhando bhoha.<verse eid="LEV 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 16:23" />“Peniya, Alune nakelebhuka nu kujhingii mu Lihema lya Chapanga, naula ngobho yake nhuu ya upiya Litambiko, yawalita pajhingii chehemo jha Nyahinyahi Hake, naileka momo mu Lihema, <verse eid="LEV 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 16:24" />najhogha mache chehemo jhibhii mbone nu kuwala ngobho yake ya machiko ghoha. Peniya, napita panja nu kupiya litambiko lya kukomelekeya ku nhwalo gwake jwenio na litambiko lya kukomelekeya ku nhwalo jha bhando, kupala kujhelebhulwa jwenio na bhando bha ku Ichilahele. <verse eid="LEV 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 16:25" />Na mahuta gha litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho naghakomelekelwa panane chehemo jhakupiikiya litambiko lya kukomelekelwa. <verse eid="LEV 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 16:26" />Mundo jwampelike mbuhe jwankambako jwatoi malemwa gha bhando jhola kunjenga, ipalwa kupula ngobho yake nu kujhogha mache, peniya najheketelwa kujhingii pakighono. <verse eid="LEV 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 16:27" />Likambako lya ng'ombi na mbuhe ghighapiitwe litambiko lya kupepulila malemwa, yenie myahe jhake jhipelekwa Chehemo jha Nyahinyahi hake, kupala kukijhelebhula, mambendela ghabhe na nyama na mahe ghipalwa ipelekwa panja jha kighono kupala kujhochwa mwotu. <verse eid="LEV 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 16:28" />Mundo jwapa kukomelekeya ilebhe yenie, ipalwa apula ngobho yake na kujhogha mache awala ngobho yake, kubhoke peniya, akelebhuka kukighono.”<verse eid="LEV 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lichiko lya ujhelanicho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 16:29" />“Nhwilo ghongo ubhaha nhwilo gwangapeta kwino, mu lichiko lya kome lya mwehe gwa chaba, mangota mabhene na akaghene bhibhatama pamonga na mangota, mipalwa kupunga lichiko lyenie na mangahenga jhe lihengo lyolyoha. <verse eid="LEV 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 16:30" />Ndi lichiko lya ujhelanicho ku nhwalo gwino na malemwa ghino ghighajhelewike, mma njelembo nnonge jhango. <verse eid="LEV 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 16:31" />Lichiko lyenie ndi lichiko li kupomolela na mangota mipunga. Nhwilo ghongo ndi gwa machiko ghoha ghangapeta. <verse eid="LEV 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 16:32" />Mpiya litambiko jwapakitwe mahuta nu kubhekwa palonge jha Chapanga kwa lihengo lyake, natola pwache natenda ujhelanicho na Chapanga, kongo awalite ngobho inakuhalala kitambala kinhuo. <verse eid="LEV 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 16:33" />Natenda lihengo lya ujhelanicho ku nhwalo jha nenga na kunhwalo jha Chehemo jha Nyahinyahi Hake na ku nhwalo jha Lihema lya Chapanga na chehemo jhi kupiikiya litambiko na mpiya litambiko na ku nhwalo gwa bhando bhoha bhuku Ichilahele. <verse eid="LEV 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 16:34" />Bhahe, nhwilo ghongo ubhaha gwa machiko ghoha ghangapeta, kupala kubhehe lihengo lya kujhelanicha na ne Chapanga nhwalo gwa bhando bhu ku Ichilahele ku nhwalo gwa malemwa ghabhe ghoha, malajhimo kila chaka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 16:34">Mucha ngateila yene ngita Bhambo Chapanga channaghalikiye.<verse eid="LEV 16:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LEV 17" />
  <para style="s">Nhwilo ku nhwalo gwa myahe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 17:1" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila kabhele Mucha, <verse eid="LEV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 17:2" />“Munnobholela Alune na yana mundo na bhando bhoha bhu ku Ichilahele mihilo jhenje. <verse eid="LEV 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 17:3" />Anda mundo jhojhoha jwa nyumba jha bhando bhu ku Ichilahele jwapakuchinja ng'ombi amu litohe lilimbelele amu mbuhe ku nhwalo gwa litambiko, nkate amu panja jhi kighono, <verse eid="LEV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 17:4" />changanneta kinyama chenie pa litangala lya Lihema lya Chapanga, kupala kumpiikiya litambiko Bhambo Chapanga, mundo jwenio nabha na malemwa ghukujhita myahe, bhando bhake nabhammeka pakanjika. <verse eid="LEV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 17:5" />Nhwilo ghongo gwakanakiya bhando bhu ku Ichilahele kwachinja inyama yabhe ukajhabhe. Bhipalwa kwaleta inyama yenie kwa mpiya litambiko pa litangala lya Lihema lya Chapanga. Na mpiya litambiko naichinja na kumpiikiya Bhambo Chapanga litambiko ghupala kutama uteeke. <verse eid="LEV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 17:6" />Na mpiya litambiko namichila myahe jhake panane jha chehemo jhu kupiikiya litambiko lya kukomelekeya lya Bhambo Chapanga, pakujhingilila pa litangala lya Lihema lya Chapanga na kutiniya mahuta ghake, ghabhe luhumba lwambone lwa kunhalalicha Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 17:7" />“Ku yene, Akaichilahele nabhaleka njwenjwe kupiya litambiko kwa ichapanga henge, jhilandana na mbuhe, nhwalo gwenio, gwateile bhabhehe bhangahobholeka kwango. Nhwilo ghongo ubhaha gwa machiko ghoha ghangapeta, mu kibheluko chino choha.<verse eid="LEV 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 17:8" />“Namwe nannongela, mundo jhojhoha mwa Akaichilahele amu akaghene bhimitama nabho, jwapakupiya litambiko lya kukomelekeya amu litambiko lenge, <verse eid="LEV 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 17:9" />nambo naleta jhe nnonge pahina na litangala lya Lihema lya Chapanga, kupala kumpiikiya Bhambo Chapanga, mundo jwenio nabhekwa pakanjika na bhando bhake.<verse eid="LEV 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 17:10" />“Anda mundo jhojhoha pakate jha bhando bhuku Ichilahele amu nng'ene jwaitama pakate jhino ilye myahe jhojhoha, ne naninchimwa mundo jwenio jwalii myahe nane mbakummeka pakanjika na bhando bhake. <verse eid="LEV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 17:11" />Ku nhwalo ughome gwa kihumbe ubhii mu myahe. Na nenga nimpii myahe jhenio kupala kutenda ujhelanicho ku nhwalo gwino mabhene panane jha chehemo jhukupiikiya litambiko, myahe ndi jhitenda ujhelanicha ku nhwalo gwa ughome gwa mundo. <verse eid="LEV 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 17:12" />Ndi nhwalo, Makaichilahele ninaghalikiye yene, mundo jhojhoha pakate jhino amu aghene bhibhatama pakate jhino, bhangalye jhe myahe.<verse eid="LEV 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 17:13" />“Mundo jhojhoha pakate jha Akaichilahele amu akaghene bhibhatama pakate jhabhe anda ajhahwii kuyema kinyama amu ijhune, ipalwa ade ajhita myahe pahe nu kuyelela ku lutukunda. <verse eid="LEV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 17:14" />Nhwalo, ughome gwa kila kihumbe chikipanginwe ubhii mu myahe. Ndi nhwalo ninnalaghalikiya ma Akaichilahele, mangalye jhe myahe jhi kihumbe chochoha, ughome gwa kihumbe chenie ndi myahe jhake. Jhojhoha jwapakulye myahe, bhando bhake nabhammeka pakanjika.<verse eid="LEV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 17:15" />“Mundo jhojhoha abha nkolokilambo amu aghene, jwalye chochoha chikiwii chenie amu chikikomitwe nu kinyama chu kumanyahe, apalwa apula ngobho yake nu kujhogha mache, jwenio najheketelwa jhe kukunyinamii Bhambo Chapanga, ade kimiye. Kubhoke peniya, najheketelwa kunnyinamii Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 17:16" />Nambo anda apulite jhe ngobho yake nu kujhogha mache, chikipa kunkolela namanya jwenio.”<verse eid="LEV 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LEV 18" />
  <para style="s">Malaghalikilo panane jha ndowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 18:1" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha. <verse eid="LEV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 18:2" />“Malobholela bhando bhu ku Ichilahele kubhehe, ‘Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino.’ ” <verse eid="LEV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 18:3" />Mangatenda jhe ngita chibhateila bhando bhu ku kilambo chu ku Michile kwantamita, na mangatenda jhe ngita chibhateila bhando bhu ku kilambo chuku Kanaane, kwenio kunimpeleka. Mangakengama jhe itendwa yabhe. <verse eid="LEV 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 18:4" />Mangota maghakamula malaghalikilo ghango nu kukengama nhwilo gwango. Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino. <verse eid="LEV 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 18:5" />Anda mughakamwii malaghalikilo ghanga na mihilo jhango nannama. Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 18:6" />“Mundo jhojhoha jwa ku Ichilahele ipalwa jhe kunheghele mundo jwannongo gwake jwa pahina kupala kugholoka nako. Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 18:7" />Mangampe jhe hone tategwino kukugholoka na majhe gwino jwampapite. Mangampe jhe hone, jwenio ndi majhe. <verse eid="LEV 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 18:8" />Mangampe jhe hone tategwino, kukugholoka na limo lya litala lyake. Bheniya ndi akamajhe bhino. <verse eid="LEV 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 18:9" />Mangagholoka jhe na alombo bhino, abha bhikimama chimo amu jwabhelwike na majhe gwino jhonge. <verse eid="LEV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 18:10" />Mangagholoka jhe na nchoko gwino, mwana jwa mwana gwino munalome amu mwikeghe, nhwalo mikipehone mabhene. <verse eid="LEV 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 18:11" />Mangagholoka jhe na alombo bhino jwabhelwike na jhumo pakate jha matala gha tate gwino, jwenio ndi alombo bhino. <verse eid="LEV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 18:12" />Mangagholoka jhe na ninhenga gwino, nhwalo jwenio ndi alombo bha tate gwino. <verse eid="LEV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 18:13" />Mangagholoka jhe na majhe gwino nkolo amu nchokombe, nhwalo bheniya ndi akalongo bha majhe gwino. <verse eid="LEV 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 18:14" />Mangagholoka jhe na nhwana jwa tate gwino nkolo amu nchoko, jwenio ndi majhe gwino hele. <verse eid="LEV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 18:15" />Mangagholoka jhe na nhwana gwa mwana gwino, nhwalo jwenio ndi kamwana gwino, mangagholoka nako jhe. <verse eid="LEV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 18:16" />Mangagholoka jhe na nhwana jwa alongo bhino, jwenio ndi nnamo gwino. <verse eid="LEV 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 18:17" />Anda nng'olwike na mwikeghe, mangagholoka jhe na ichikana yake amu ichokolo yake. Bheniya akalongo, kwahangalana mitenda ubhoho hake. <verse eid="LEV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 18:18" />Mangatolana jhe na nnombo gwa nhwana gwino na nhwana gwino ammela abhii ghome, kilebhe chenio nakileta bhulo pakate jhabhe.”<verse eid="LEV 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 18:19" />“Mangagholoka jhe na mwikeghe jwabhii piye. <verse eid="LEV 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 18:20" />Mangagholoka jhe na nhwana gwa nnyino jwa pahina, na yene mikilete gwangajheketelwa kukunyinamii Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 18:21" />Mangampiya jhe mwana gwino jhojhoha kubhehe litambiko ku kichapanga chuwange Moleke. Nhwalo kukutenda yene namililigha liina lyango ne Nachapanga gwino. Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 18:22" />Mangagholoka jhe na munalome nnyino ngita chimigholoka na mwikeghe. Chenie ndi kilebhe chakichimwa Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 18:23" />Mangagholoka jhe na kinyama kupala gwangajheketelwa kukunyinamii Chapanga, munalome amu mwikeghe jhojhoha angatenda jhe yene, kukutenda yene ndi gwangajheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 18:24" />“Mangakitenda jhe mme mangajheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga kukutenda ilebhe yenio, ku nhwalo gwa ilebhe ngita yenio nganabhengita bhando bhiilambo bhibhabhii palonge jhino, ku nhwalo bheniya utenda gheniya na kukileke gwangajheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 18:25" />Ata kilambo chabhe ngakihakila na nenga nganikihadabula na kilambo chabhe ngachatapika bhando bhake. <verse eid="LEV 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 18:26" />Nambo mangota mwe na akaghene bhibhatama pakate jhino mipalwa kughakamu mabholo na mihilo jhango na hilu mangatenda jhe ilebhe inichimwa. <verse eid="LEV 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 18:27" />Ilebhe yenie yoha inichimwa ihengitwa na bhando bhibhatamita kukilambo chuku Kanaane kabula jhino mangota, na bheniya bhakiteila kilambo ngakijheketilwa jhe palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 18:28" />Mangota mangatenda jhe ilebhe yenie, anda ntei yene kilambo chenie kipakuntapika ngita chibhatapika bhando bhibhakibha kabula mangota minatama jhe. <verse eid="LEV 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 18:29" />Bhando bhoha bhibhapakutenda ilebhe yene yu kuchimwa, ndi mipalwa bhabhengwa bhabhoke pakate jha Akaichilahele.<verse eid="LEV 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 18:30" />“Ku yene, nkamule mbone ghoha ghinnaghalikiye, makatende jhe ilebhe ngita ibhatendita bhando bhibhatamita pikilambo kabula mangota minatama jhe, mangaika jhe kulekwa kujheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga gwino.”<verse eid="LEV 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LEV 19" />
  <para style="s">Mihilo jhenge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 19:1" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, <verse eid="LEV 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 19:2" />“Malobholela bhando bhoha bhu ku Ichilahele kubhehe, ‘Mipalwa kubhehe nyahinyahi, ngita chimii nenga Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino.’ ” <verse eid="LEV 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 19:3" />Kila mundo antembekeya majhe mundo na tate mundo, nu kukamuu Lichiko lya Kupomolela. Nenga ndi Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino.<verse eid="LEV 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 19:4" />“Mangaijhinamii jhe ichapanga amu kukitengenechela kinyagho cha shaba. Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino.”<verse eid="LEV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 19:5" />“Pumipiya litambiko lya kinyama lya uteeke kwa ne Bhambo Chapanga, umbiikiya ngita chiipalwa kupala ijheketelwa ku nhwalo gwino. <verse eid="LEV 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 19:6" />Nyama jha litambiko lyenie, ipalwa ilyegwa lichiko lele lilipiitwe amu kilabho jhake. Chochoha chikihighala ade lichiko lyuutato kipalwa kikomelekelwa pa mwotu. <verse eid="LEV 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 19:7" />Anda nyama jhojhoha jha litambiko lyenie ilegwitwe lichiko lya utato, mmanya litambiko lyoha lijheketilwa jhe. <verse eid="LEV 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 19:8" />Mundo jhojhoha jwapakulye nyama jhenie, apalwa ahadabulwa ku ulemwa gwake, nhwalo akitei kikotokujheketelwa kilebhe chikipiitwe litambiko kwa Bhambo Chapanga. Mundo jwenio atama pakanjika na bhando bhake.<verse eid="LEV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 19:9" />“Pimpa kuhuna mahuno gha munng'onda gwino, mangahuna jhe ade mu mpaka gwa nng'onda gwino, hilu mangabhujha jhe unyuma kutola ghighahighilike. <verse eid="LEV 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 19:10" />Mangabhujhii jhe kujhola kila kilebhe mu nng'onda gwa michabibo amu kulokota igwelii pahe, malekela akahocho na akaghene nenga ndi Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino.<verse eid="LEV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 19:11" />“Mangajhibha jhe hilu mangalonge uwange hilu mangakolowana jhe. <verse eid="LEV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 19:12" />Mangalapii jhe kuwange ku liina lyango amu kuliligha liina lyango. Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino.<verse eid="LEV 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 19:13" />“Mangamponja jhe amu kunyibhii nnyino. Malepo gha mundo jwantenda lihengo ghangatama jhe kelu ndaa kwino ade lukela. <verse eid="LEV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 19:14" />Mangannigha jhe jwangajhoha amu jwangalola kummeke kilebhe nonge jhake kupala akobhale, mipalwa kunnomba Chapanga gwino. Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 19:15" />“Pimihadabula, nhadabula changaloleke kumiho, mangampendele jhe nhwocho amu jhuna ilebhe twe. Nambo mipalwa kuhadabula ngita chiipalwa kwa nnyino. <verse eid="LEV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 19:16" />Mangalyunga jhe okwe na okwe pakate jha bhando bhino kupala kulonge uwange, nkoto kuntenda nnyino akomwe. Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="LEV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 19:17" />“Mangammeke jhe maghonga nnongo gwino kumwojho gwino, mipalwa nnyinala nannyino, kupala mangato jhe malemwa ku nhwalo gwake. <verse eid="LEV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 19:18" />Mangalepa jhe mabhoho hilu manganchimwa jhe jhumo jwa yana ya ajhino bhando, nambo mpale nnyino ngita chimikipala mabhene. Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 19:19" />“Miikamula mihilo jhango. Mangaileka jhe ipugho ibhelekana na makambako ghi inyama ya aina jhenge ghangalandana, nu munng'onda gwino mangapanda jhe mbejho ya aina ibhele, hilu mangawala jhe ngobho ipumwitwe kwa nyuche aina ibhele.<verse eid="LEV 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 19:20" />“Munalome anda agholwike na mwikeghe mmanda jwatolwilwe na munalome jhonge, nambo amela anaghombolelwa jhe kubhehe mahulo, munalome jwenio ipalwa kuhadabulwa. Nambo mangakomwa jhe ku nhwalo mwikeghe jwenio akibha natolelwa jhe na munalome. <verse eid="LEV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 19:21" />Yene, munalome jwenio naleta limbelele lya nkambako palonge jha Lihema lyu Chapanga kubhehe litambiko lya kupepulila uhakaho kwa Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 19:22" />Peniya, mpiya litambiko kukupete limbelele lyenio lya kupepulila uhakaho, nantendela ujhelanicho nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, ku nhwalo gwa uhakaho gwake, jwenio nalekekelwa uhakaho gwake.<verse eid="LEV 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 19:23" />“Pumpa kuhika ku kilambo chuku Kanaane na kupanda aina jha mikongo jha uhoe, ku kipinde cha yaka itato uhoe gwenie mangalye jhe, nhwalo gheniya ndi ghangajheketelwa kwino. <verse eid="LEV 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 19:24" />Pimpakuhika chaka cha ncheche uhoe gwake gwoha naubhaha gwa nyahinyahi, naupalwa kubhehe litambiko lya kunchengu Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 19:25" />Nambo chaka chu nhwano mihoto kulye uhoe gwake, na mahuno ghino naghapambika twe. Nenga ndi Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino.<verse eid="LEV 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 19:26" />“Mangalye jhe nyama jhojhoha jhibhii na myahe jhake. Mangalondo jhe hilu mangalogha jhe. <verse eid="LEV 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 19:27" />Mangachekuu jhe majhunjo ghino muupele umuto gwino hilu kuchekuu ndeho ino. <verse eid="LEV 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 19:28" />Mangalemba jhe nembo jhojhoha payegha jhino, ku nhwalo gwa ungolongonde gwa malelo, mangakichola jhe nembo jhojhoha payegha, yane tatuu. Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 19:29" />“Mangampe jhe hone kamwale gwino kukuntenda kubhehe nngongola, nhwalo kukutenda yene kilambo choha nakitwelela itendwa ya ngongola na ilebhe yanganandela. <verse eid="LEV 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 19:30" />Mulikamula Lichiko lya Kupomolela, na mulitembekeya Lihema lya Chapanga. Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 19:31" />“Mangajhendele jhe bhibhalondo, amu akahabhe, kupala kunnondola nhwalo naninyeketela jhe nenga Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino.<verse eid="LEV 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 19:32" />“Pimibhehe nnonge jha akanahota mipalwa kujhema kupala kulangii ichima, namwe muntembekeya hake Chapanga gwino. Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga gwino.<verse eid="LEV 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 19:33" />“Anda abhii aghene mu kilambo chino mangantende ubhoho. <verse eid="LEV 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 19:34" />Nn'gene jwenio jwaitama na namwe nabhaha kwino ngita nkolo kilambo nyino, namwe mupala ngita chimikipala mabhene, nhwalo namwenga makibha maghene mu kilambo chuku Michile. Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino.<verse eid="LEV 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 19:35" />“Mangaponja jhe bhando pimapeme ilebhe itandamaho amu pamapeme ilebhe ina kutopa amu ilebhe yukutweleya. <verse eid="LEV 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 19:36" />Mipalwa kutumii ipemo ipalwa na ipemo ibhii telatela. Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, jhunimmohita ku kilambo chuku Michile. <verse eid="LEV 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 19:37" />Mipalwa mighakamula malaghalikilo na mihilo jhango jhoha. Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="LEV 19:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LEV 20" />
  <para style="s">Luhadabulo ku nhwalo gwa malemwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 20:1" />Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, <verse eid="LEV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 20:2" />“Malobholela Akaichilahele kubhehe, ‘Mundo jhojhoha pakate jha Akaichilahele amu aghene jwaitama pakate jhino, anda ampiite litambiko mwana mundo jhojhoha kwa ichapanga jhuwange Moleke, mundo jwenio ipalwa akomwa. Bhando bha peniya, nabhankoma ku kumbula maghanga.’ ” <verse eid="LEV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 20:3" />Nenga naninkana mundo jwenio, nu kummeka kutale na bhando bhake, ku nhwalo ampiite jhumo jwa yana mundo litambiko kwa ichapanga Moleke nu kulihakaya Lihema lyango, na liina lyango lya nyahinyahi. <verse eid="LEV 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 20:4" />Anda akolo kilambo bha peniya nabhanhadabula jhe mundo jwenio ku kunkoma, <verse eid="LEV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 20:5" />ne namwete naninkana mundo jwenio ni ibheluko yake. Nanimmeka kutale mundo jwenio na bhando bhake, pamonga na bhoha bhangahobholeka kwango kwa kuijhinamii kichapanga Moleke.<verse eid="LEV 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 20:6" />“Anda mundo jhojhoha abhajhende bhibhalondo na akahabhe, kupala kulondola, naninkana mundo jwenio na kummeka kutale na bhando bhake. <verse eid="LEV 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 20:7" />Mikijhelebhule, nnyeketelwe kwango, ku nhwalo ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino. <verse eid="LEV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 20:8" />Mikamula mihilo jhango na kujhokonikiya. Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga jhuninnyelebhula.<verse eid="LEV 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 20:9" />“Mundo jhojhoha jwampe likoto tate mundo amu majhe mundo, ipalwa akomwa. Nhwalo ampii likoto tate mundo amu majhe mundo, yene, namanya jwene.<verse eid="LEV 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 20:10" />“Anda munalome agholwike na nhwana jwa mundo jwa pahina, bhipalwa bhoha bhabhele bhakomwa. <verse eid="LEV 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 20:11" />Munalome anda agholwike nu jhumo pakate jha matala gha tate mundo, impe hone tatemundo, bhoha bhabhele bhipalwa bhakomwa. Kilebhe chenio nabhamanya bhene. <verse eid="LEV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 20:12" />Munalome jhojhoha anda agholwike na kamwana mundo, bhoha bhabhele bhipalwa bhakomwa. Bhatehi kilebhe kibhoho hake, ghighapala kwakole nabhamanya bhene. <verse eid="LEV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 20:13" />Anda munalome jhojhoha agholwike na munalome nnyake kukuntenda mwikeghe, bhoha bhabhele bhipalwa kukomwa, nhwalo bhatehi kilebhe chikichimwicha, ghighapala kwakole nabhamanya bhene. <verse eid="LEV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 20:14" />Anda munalome atolii mwikeghe na nkohano mundo mwikeghe, gwenio ndi ulemo, bhoha bhatato bhipalwa bhakomelekelwa kwa mwotu, nhwalo bhatehi ubhoho. Ntenda yene kupala ubhoho ungabhe jhe pakate jhino mangota. <verse eid="LEV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 20:15" />Anda munalome jhojhoha agholwike na kinyama ngita chagholoka na mwikeghe, ipalwa akomwa, na kinyama chenio kipalwa kikomwa. <verse eid="LEV 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 20:16" />Anda mwikeghe akiheghilii kinyama nakupala kugholoka nako ngita chagholoka na munalome, mwikeghe jwenio apalwa akomwa na kinyama chenio helahela kikomwa, ghighapala kwakole nabhamanya bhene.<verse eid="LEV 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 20:17" />“Munalome jhojhoha anda antolii nnombo mundo, abha mwana gwa tate mundo amu majhe mundo na kugholoka nako, chenio ndi kilebhe chikuchimwa. Bhipalwa bhabhekwa kutale na ndanga jhake. Nhwalo munalome jwenio ampii hone nnombo mundo, chikipakunkolela nakimanya jwene. <verse eid="LEV 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 20:18" />Anda munalome agholwike nu mwikeghe jwabhii piye, bhoha bhabhele bhipalwa kubhekwa kutale na bhando bhabhe, nhwalo bhoha bhabhele bhatwekwii mihilo jha kujheketelwa na gwangajheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 20:19" />“Mangagholoka jhe na nnombo gwa majhe gwino hilu nihenga gwino, nhwalo kilebhe chenie kipakwape hone akalongo bhino bha pahina. Bhoha bhibhatenda gheniya ghighapala kwakole nabhamanya bhene. <verse eid="LEV 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 20:20" />Anda mundo agholwike na nhwana gwa tate mundo nkolo amu nchokombe, impe hone tate mundo nkolo amu nchokombe, bhoha bhabhele nabhabha na malemwa, bhoha nabhahwa changa yana. <verse eid="LEV 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 20:21" />Anda munalome antolile mwikeghe jwa nnongo mundo, ampe hone nnongo mundo, gwenio ndi gwangajheketelwa kwa Chapanga, bhoha bhabhele nabhahwa changa yana.<verse eid="LEV 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 20:22" />“Mipalwa kukamuu na kuikengama mihilo jhango jhoha, andajhe kilambo chu ku Kanaane chinnimpeleka nakinkana. <verse eid="LEV 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 20:23" />Mangakengama jhe homo ya bhando bhi kilambo chinabhengita palonge jhino mu kilambo chimitama, bhando bheniya bhatehila gheniya, nanenga nganachimwa hake. <verse eid="LEV 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 20:24" />Nambo nalobholile njwe, namikitola kilambo chabhe, nanimpela kilambo chenie kibhehe chino, kilambo chikibholii kukulema nu kukoleka inyama. Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino ninhagwii kuhumii bhando ilambo henge. <verse eid="LEV 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 20:25" />Ku yene, mipalwa mmanya kupembuu pakate jha kinyama chikijhetelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga na changajheketelwa palonge jha Chapanga. Anda mpapiye a kimanya amu kijhune amu chochoha chikikwabha pa nnema chinongila kijheketelwa jhe palonge jhango, bhahe, mangota nanyeketelwa jhe nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 20:26" />Ne Bhambo Chapanga ndi nanyahinyahi, mangota nimmekitengine kulate na bhando bha ilambo henge, kupala mma bhando bhango, namma nyahinyahi.<verse eid="LEV 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 20:27" />“Munalome amu mwikeghe jhojhoha jwalondola amu nhwabhe, apalwa akomwa kukumbula maghanga. Bhoha bhabhele munalome na mwikeghe, ghighapala kwakole nabhamanya bhene.”<verse eid="LEV 20:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LEV 21" />
  <para style="s">Mihilo ku nhwalo gwa akapiya matambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 21:1" />“Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, ‘Malobholela akapiya matambiko, yana ya Alune, kubhehe pangabhe jhe na mundo jhojhoha pakate jhabhe jwapakukitenda akoto kujheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga kukupapaya malelo gha nnongo gwake, <verse eid="LEV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 21:2" />nambo tugha anda malelo gha nnongo jwa lutumbo lumo, yane majhe mundo amu tate mundo amu mwana mundo amu kamwale mundo amu nnongo mundo munalome, <verse eid="LEV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 21:3" />amu nnombo mundo jwa lutumbo lumo jwangatolelwa na munalome. <verse eid="LEV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 21:4" />Jwenie, angakitenda jhe gwangajheketelwa palonge jha Chapanga ku nhwalo ulongo gwa kutolanila, ata abhaha na ukindendeke ghonge kwa akalongo mundo.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 21:5" />“Ibheluko ya Alune bhangachekuu jhe lupala ku nhwalo kulela malelo na bhangachekuu jhe ndeho yabhe amu kukilemba nembo mu yegha. <verse eid="LEV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 21:6" />Bhabhaha akanyahinyahi kwa Chapanga gwabhe hilu bhingiligha jhe liina lya Chapanga gwabhe. Nhwalo bheniya ndi bhibhahenga lihengo lya kupiya litambiko kwa Bhambo Chapanga kwa mwotu, lilipakubhe ngita chakulya chango ne Nachapanga. Bhipalwa bhabhaha akanyahinyahi. <verse eid="LEV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 21:7" />Ku nhwalo mpiya litambiko abhii nyahinyhi kwa Bhambo Chapanga gwake ipalwa jhe kutolela mwikeghe nngongola hilu jwalekitwe na unganamundo. <verse eid="LEV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 21:8" />Bhando bhipalwa kummanya mpiya litambiko abhii nyahinyahi, nhwalo jwenie ndi bhibhapiya litambiko lya uhembe kwa Bhambo Chapanga gwino. Kabhele ninteilingine mangota kubhehe bhando bha Bhambo Chapanga, ku nhwalo nenga ndi nanyahinyahi. <verse eid="LEV 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 21:9" />Kamwale jwa mpiya litambiko jhojhoha ajheketelwa jhe kukuhenga ngongola, nakomelekelwa njwenjwe kwa mwotu, nhwalo ampeke tate mundo hone.”<verse eid="LEV 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 21:10" />“Mpiya litambiko nkolongwa jhojhoha, ku nhwalo jwenie ndi nkolongwa pakate jha akalongo mundo, jwenie amiminilwe mahuta umuto gwake nukubhekwa nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, kupala awala ngobho yake ya upiya litambiko, angaleka jhe majhunjo ghake changapuka hilu angakenjuu jhe ngobho yake ku ungolongonde. <verse eid="LEV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 21:11" />Mpiya litambiko angabhandikii jhe malelo ata ghabhaha gha tatemundo amu gha majhe mundo kupala akotokukanilwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 21:12" />Ku nhwalo atenditwe kubhehe mpiya litambiko kukumiminilwa mahuta gha Chapanga umuto, kuyene angapita jhe mu Lihema lya Chapanga hilu nukutenda ikotokujheketelwa palonge jhango. Nenga ndi Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 21:13" />Mpiya litambiko nkolongwa ndi jwahoto kutolela mwikeghe jwangakola. <verse eid="LEV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 21:14" />Mpiya litambiko ipalwa jhe antolela nawela, amu mwikeghe jwalekine na ungana mundo amu jwakitei jwangajheketela kwa ngongola. Ipalwa kuntola mwikeghe jwangakola kubhoke mulukolo lwake, jwenie lwa akapiya litambiko, <verse eid="LEV 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 21:15" />angaika jhe kuitenda yana mundo jwenie yangajheketelwa. Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga jhuninhagwile.”<verse eid="LEV 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 21:16" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, <verse eid="LEV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 21:17" />“Munnobholela Alune, ‘Mundo jhojhoha jwa kibheluko chino choha, mundo jhuna kilema, angabhandikii jhe pukumbikii litambiko lilipakubhe ngita chakulya chango ne Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 21:18" />Mundo jhojhoha jwalemile amu jwangalola amu jhuna lukongono lutandamaho kupeta chiipalwa amu mundo jwahalabike kumiho, <verse eid="LEV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 21:19" />amu mundo jwalemii lukongono amu lubhoko, <verse eid="LEV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 21:20" />amu jwabhii nikipenda amu mundo nnyipe kupeta chiipalwa amu jwabhii malyenge amu jwabhii ni likulutu amu upele amu jhukimemine mbuhe. <verse eid="LEV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 21:21" />Mundo jhojhoha jwa kibheluko cha mpiya litambiko nkolongwa Alune jwalemile angabhandikii jhe kumbiikiya litambiko Bhambo Chapanga li kukomelekelwa, jwenio abhii nikilema, angabhadikii jhe litambiko lilipakubhe ngita chakulya chango ne Nachapanga gwabhe. <verse eid="LEV 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 21:22" />Mundo jwenio ahoto kulye chakulya cha Chapanga gwake, ndi ilebhe ijheketilwe, ndi ilebhe ya nyahinyahi hake. <verse eid="LEV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 21:23" />Nambo angabhandikii jhe lipanjiya hilu chehemo jhikupiiki litambiko pala nhwalo abhii nikilema, kupala angakile jhe uhako Lihema lya Chapanga, nhwalo ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga ndi jhuntenda mme nyahinyahi.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 21:24" />Mucha ngannobholila Alune nhwalo gwenio pamonga na yana mundo na bhando bhoha bhuku Ichilahele.<verse eid="LEV 21:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LEV 22" />
  <para style="s">Litambiko lya nyahinyahi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 22:1" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, <verse eid="LEV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 22:2" />“Munnobholele Alune na yana mundo, akapiya matambiko bhikamula hake ilebhe ya nyahinyahi ibhapiya Akaichilahele kubhehe matambiko gha nyahinyahi, kupala bhangaliligha jhe liina lyango lya nyahinyahi. Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 22:3" />Malobholela kubhehe, ‘Anda mundo jhumo jwa kibheluko chino mu ibheluko ino yoha naheghelela ilebhe ya nyahinyahi ibhekitwe nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, na Akaichilahele kwa nenga Bhambo Chapanga, kongo amanye kubhehe ijheketelwa jhe, bhahe, mundo jwenio nabhekwa kutale na nenga. Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 22:4" />“Mundo jhojhoha jwa kibheluko cha Alune jwabhii na malohe amu jwapita uhwila, angalye jhe ilebhe jwa nyahinyahi, ade papakujheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. Mundo jhojhoha jwangajheketelwa kukupapaya malelo amu mundo jwapita mbejho yake jwenie, <verse eid="LEV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 22:5" />amu jwapapiye kinyama chochoha chikikwabha, na kuntenda akoto kujheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, amu ampapii mundo jhojhoha jwangajheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, <verse eid="LEV 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 22:6" />mundo jwenio, nabhaha jwangajheketelwa ade kimiye na kulye jhe yakulye ya nyahinyahi ade papakujhogha. <verse eid="LEV 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 22:7" />Lyobha anda litipike ndi nabha njelembo. Kubhoke peniya, nalya ilebhe ibhii nyahinyahi, nhwalo ndi chakulya chake. <verse eid="LEV 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 22:8" />Mpiya litambiko angalye jhe nyama jhojhoha jhi kinyama chikiwii chenie amu kikomitwe ni kinyama chakumanyahe, akoto kukitenda angajheketelwa jhe palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="LEV 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 22:9" />“Ku yene, akapiya matambiko bhipalwa bhaghakamula malaghalikilo ghango, bhangaika jhe kubhehe bhangajheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga na kukomwa. Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga jwanintenda mangota kubhehe nyahinyahi.”<verse eid="LEV 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 22:10" />“Mundo jwangabhehe mulukolo lwa mpiya litambiko ijheketelwa jhe kulye chakulya cha nyahinyahi. Amu aghene bha mpiya litambiko jwa kajhake amu ntumiche gwake jwannepa, angalye jhe mu kilebhe chanyahinyahi. <verse eid="LEV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 22:11" />Nambo anda mpiya litambiko anhwemii mmanda jhojhoha kubhehe jwake, mmanda jwenio ahoto kulye chakulya chenie, na helahela jwabhelwike mu nyumba jha mpiya litambiko nalya mu chakulya chenie cha nyahinyahi. <verse eid="LEV 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 22:12" />Na kamwale jwa mpiya litambiko atoline na mundo jwangabhehe mpiya litambiko, kamwale jwenio najheketelwa jhe kulye litambiko lya ilebhe ya nyahinyahi. <verse eid="LEV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 22:13" />Nambo anda kamwale jwa mpiya litambiko ndi nahwela amu alekine na unganamundo na akwetii jhe mwana, na jwenio abhujhite kajhake kwa tatemundo, ngatama nabho ngita chakibha kangombo, ahoto kulye chakulya cha tate mundo. Ata yene, nng'ene ipalwa jhe alya yakulya yenie.”<verse eid="LEV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 22:14" />“Anda mundo jhonge alii yakulya ya nyahinyahi changamanya, ipalwa kulepa litambiko lyenie lyoha na kujhonjekeya lipungo limo pakate jha mapungo nhwano gha bei jha litambiko lyenie nakunnepa mpiya litambiko. <verse eid="LEV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 22:15" />Mpiya litambiko angaitenda jhe gwangajheketelwa ilebhe ya nyahinyahi, ibhambikii Akaichilahele nenga Bhambo Chapanga, <verse eid="LEV 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 22:16" />yene ndi nayajhambukiya bhando bhabhe bhangajheketelwa kukulye ilebhe yabhe ya nyahinyahi na kupalwa kulepa matambiko gheniya. Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga ndi nibheka ilebhe yenie kubhehe ya nyahinyahi.”<verse eid="LEV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 22:17" />Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, <verse eid="LEV 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 22:18" />“Munnobholela Alune na yana mundo akapiya matambiko na Akaichilahele bhoha kubhehe, ‘Anda mundo jhojhoha pakate jhino amu nng'ene jhojhoha jwatama ku kilambo chu ku Ichilahele anda apiite litambiko lyake ibhaha yakutimicha nachile amu lya kupala jwenie jhukukomelekeya, ku nhwalo gwa kumpiikiya Bhambo Chapanga, <verse eid="LEV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 22:19" />kupala ahoto kujheketelwa, apiya ng'ombi jwa nkambako amu limbelele lya nkambako amu mbuhe lya kambako lyanga lemala. <verse eid="LEV 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 22:20" />Nambo kinyama chochoha chikilemile mangakipiya jhe, nhwalo nakijheketelwa jhe ku nhwalo gwino. <verse eid="LEV 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 22:21" />Mundo jhojhoha jwapakumpiikiya Bhambo Chapanga litambiko lya uteeke kwa Bhambo Chapanga, amu kutimicha nachile amu litambiko lya kupala jwenio lya kupiya mu ipugho yake, ng'ombi amu mambelele, ibha yangalemala, kupala ijheketelwa, pangabhe jhe ni kilema chochoha nakate jhake. <verse eid="LEV 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 22:22" />Mangampikiya jhe Bhambo Chapanga kinyama changalola amu chikilemile amu jwakojhokine chehemo jhojhoha, amu kilonda chikipita uhila, mangampiiya jhe kubhehe litambiko lya kukomelekelwa pa chehemo jhukumpiikiya litambiko. <verse eid="LEV 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 22:23" />Ng'ombi jwankambako amu litohe lya limbelele jwabhi ni kipagha chimo kitandamahu kulya ku chenge, kinyama chenie mihoto kumpiya kukupala kwino mabhene, nambo mangampiya jhe ku nhwalo gwa kutimicha nachile, jwenio ijheketelwa jhe. <verse eid="LEV 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 22:24" />Kinyama chikilemii mbombo yake amu kutimbwa amu kukocholwana amu kuheketwa, mangampiikiya jhe Bhambo Chapanga hilu mangatenda jhe yene mu kilambo chino.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 22:25" />Hilu mangapoke jhe kuhumii kwa aghene inyama ngita yenie na kumbiikiya ne na Chapanga gwino ngita chakulya. Inyama yenie yamboni jhe, nhwalo ihekitwe naijheketelwa jhe kunhwalo gwino.<verse eid="LEV 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 22:26" />Kubhoke peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, <verse eid="LEV 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 22:27" />“Litohe lya ng'ombi amu limbelele amu mbuhe, andaibhelwike, naitama pamonga nanyonga mundo kwa machiko chaba. Lichiko lya nane bhihoto kubhehe ngita litambiko lya kukomelekelwa kwa Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 22:28" />Manganchinja jhe ng'ombi na litohe lyake amu limbelele na litohe lyake amu mbuhe na litohe lyake kwa lichiko limo. <verse eid="LEV 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 22:29" />Pumpa kumbiikiya ne Bhambo Chapanga litambiko lya kunjenguu, mpiye kupala nenga ninnyeketele. <verse eid="LEV 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 22:30" />Nyama jha kinyama chenie ipalwa ilyegwa lichiko lele, mangahighaya jhe ade kilabho. Nenga ndi Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 22:31" />“Ku yene, mijhokanikiya na kuitumikii mihilo jhango. Nenga ndi Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 22:32" />Mangalitenda jhe lihina lyango liligwa, mipalwa bhando bhoha bhuku Ichilahele mundekeya Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga jwaninhagwile mma bhando bhango. <verse eid="LEV 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 22:33" />Ne ndi jhunimmohita kukilambo chuku Michile. Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga gwino.”<verse eid="LEV 22:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LEV 23" />
  <para style="s">Mihilo ku nhwalo gwa unyagho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 23:1" />Bhambo Chapanga ngajhendilila kunnobholela Mucha, <verse eid="LEV 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 23:2" />“Malobholela Akaichilahele kubhehe, ‘Mu minyagho jhango jha nyahinyahi ne Bhambo Chapanga jhibhekwitwe nkongana pamonga kukunyinamii. Mijhagho jhimbangite ndi jhenje. <verse eid="LEV 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 23:3" />Nankola machiko chita gha kuhenga mahengo. Nambo lichiko lya chaba ndi Lichiko li Kupomolela, lichiko lyenie ndi lichiko lya nyahinyahi kwango mikongana nu kunyinamiila, lichiko lyenie mangahenga jhe lihengo lyolyoha chehemo jhojhoha pimpakutama. <verse eid="LEV 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 23:4" />Ngwete minyagho jhango jhenge jhimbangite ne Bhambo Chapanga, kuyene mikongana pamonga nu kunyinamila, mipanga kipinde chikipangitwe.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unyagho gwa Pachaka na mabumunda ghangaleke ngedule</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 28:16-25">Kibhalango 28:16-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 23:5" />“Kimiye lichiko lya kome na ncheche lya mwehe ghu kutumbula, mindendela unyagho gwa Pachaka, ku nhwalo gwa kumbee ichima. <verse eid="LEV 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 23:6" />Lichiko lya kome nu nhwano lya mwehe ghogho, Unyagho gwa Mabumunda Ghangaleke Ngedule nautumbula. Kwa machiko chaba, milyangana mabumunda ghangaleke ngedule. <verse eid="LEV 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 23:7" />Lichiko lya kutumbula lya kulye mabumunda ghangaleke ngedule mangahenga jhe lihengo, nambo mikongana pamonga kukunyinamila. <verse eid="LEV 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 23:8" />Kwa machiko chaba ghoha naumbikiiya nenga Bhambo Chapanga litambo lya kukomelekeya, na lichiko lyenie lya chaba mangahenga jhe lihengo nambo mikongana pamonga kunyinamila.”<verse eid="LEV 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 23:9" />Kabhele Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, <verse eid="LEV 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 23:10" />“Malobholela Akaichilahele kubhehe, ‘Pumpa kujhingii mu kilambo chinimpe nu kuhuna mahuno ghake, munnetela mpiya litambiko ng'anda jha lipungu lya kulobhoka, <verse eid="LEV 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 23:11" />na lichiko lyu ubhele kubhoke mu Lichiko lya Kupomolela, mpiya litambiko natondobheya lipungu lyenie kunane kulangii kubhehe umbikii nenga, nanenga nanyeketela matambiko ghino.’ ” <verse eid="LEV 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 23:12" />Lichiko lyenie pumipa kutondobheya lipungu lyenie kumbikii nenga ndi Bhambo Chapanga mipalwa helahela kumbiikiya litambiko lya kukomelekeya lya likambako litohe lya limbelele lya chaka chimo lyangalemala. <verse eid="LEV 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 23:13" />Pamonga na litambiko lyenie, naumbikiya litambiko lya uhembe kilo ibhele ya uhembe ghukutema ghuhunyitwe na mahuta ghi micheitune gwenio umbiikiya ne Bhambo Chapanga kukutiniya kwa mwotu, nu luumba lwake nulunhalalilcha. Na litambiko lya kilebhe chukunywe lita jhimo jha divaye. <verse eid="LEV 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 23:14" />Kabula jha lichiko lya kumbiikiya nenga Bhambo Chapanga gwino litambiko, mipalwa jhe kulye malobhoko gha mahuno ghino ghabhehe mabhehe amu ghighakalingwe amu ghighajhochwite kubhehe mabumunda. Jhenje ndi mihilo jha kuikamuu machiko ghoha mu ibheluko ino na chehemo jhojhoha jhimpakutama.<verse eid="LEV 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unyagho gwa mahuno</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 28:26-31">Kibhalango 28:26-31</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 16:9-12">Kubhoka 16:9-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 23:15" />“Mibhalanga majuma chaba kubhoke lichiko lyenie, Lichiko lya Kupomolela, punyinwila lipungo lya litambiko lya kumbiikiya nenga Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 23:16" />Pilipakuika lichiko lya makome nhwano, lichiko lya ubhele kubhoke Lichiko lya Kupomolela lya chaba, mimbiikiya ne Bhambo Chapanga litambiko lya uhembe nhyono. <verse eid="LEV 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 23:17" />Kila nyumba naileta mabumunda mabhele gha litambiko lya kujhinulilwa kwa nginyililo palonge jhango ne Bhambo Chapanga. Kila libumunda libhaha litenginichwe kwa kilo ibhele jha uhembe ghunakutema ghulekilwe ngedule, na libumunda lyenio naumbiikiya nenga Bhambo Chapanga libha litambiko lya malobhoko ghino. <verse eid="LEV 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 23:18" />Pamonga na gheniya, nampiya matohe gha mambelele chaba gha chaka chimo na litohe limo lya ng'ombi jwankambako na mambelele mankambako mabhele. Inyama yenie naibhaha litambiko lya kukomelekeya pamonga na litambiko lya mahuno na litambiko lya kilebhe chukunywe. Luhumba lwa matambiko gheniya naluhalalicha ne Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 23:19" />Helehela nampiya likambako limo lya mbuhe lya kupepulila uhakaho na matohe gha mambelele ghankambako mabhele gha chaka chimo, ku nhwalo gwa litambiko lya uteeke. <verse eid="LEV 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 23:20" />Mpiya litambiko natondobheya matambiko gheniya kulangii nyinyililo jha kumbiikiya nenga Bhambo Chapanga, pamonga na mabumunda gha malobhoko pamonga na mambelele ghala mabhele, ilebhe yenie ndi chakulya cha nyahinyahi nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga na yenie naibha ya mpiya litambiko. <verse eid="LEV 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 23:21" />Lichiko lyenie mikongana kunyinamila, kabhele mangahenga jhe lihengo lyolyoha. Ghongo ndi nhwilo ghukukamuu machiko ghoha ghangapeta muibheluko ino yoha kila chehemo pimpakutama.”<verse eid="LEV 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 23:22" />Mangota pimpa kuhuna, mipalwa jhe kuhuna njwenjwe ade mu mipaka mahuno ghoha gha munng'onda gwino, hilu mipalwa jhe kubhujha unyuma kulokota ghighaighile, gheniya malekela akahocho na akaghene. Nenga ndi Bhambo Chapanga gwino.<verse eid="LEV 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unyagho gwa chaka kiyono</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 29:1-6">Kibhalango 29:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 23:23" />Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila kabhele Mucha, <verse eid="LEV 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 23:24" />“Malobholela bhando bhu ku Ichilahele kubhehe, lichiko lya kutumbuu lya mwehe gwa chaba, milibheka libhaha Lichiko lya Kupomolela tugha, na akapiya litambiko nabhahona mapenenga ghabhe kanonoho na mangota mipalwa kukongana na kunnomba. <verse eid="LEV 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 23:25" />Mangahenga jhe lihengo lyolyoha lichiko lyenie, mipalwa mumbiikiya nenga Bhambo Chapanga litambiko lya kukomelekeya kwa mwotu.”<verse eid="LEV 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lichiko lya ujhelanicho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 29:7-11">Kibhalango 29:7-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 23:26" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila kabhele Mucha, <verse eid="LEV 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 23:27" />“Lichiko lya kome lya mwehe gwenio gwa chaba ndi lichiko lya ujhelanicho. Lichiko lyenie ndi lichiko lya kukongana pamonga. Nampunga na kupiya litambiko kwa Bhambo Chapanga kwa mwotu. <verse eid="LEV 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 23:28" />Mangahenga jhe lihengo lyolyoha lichiko lyenie. Lichiko lyenie ndi lichiko lya kunyinamila, lichiko lyenie mpiya litambiko nantendela ujhelanicho na Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino. <verse eid="LEV 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 23:29" />Mundo jhojhoha jwangapunga lichiko lyenie, ipalwa abhekwa kutale na bhando bhake. <verse eid="LEV 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 23:30" />Mundo jhojhoha jwapakuhenga lihengo lyolyoha lichiko lyenie, mundo jwenio naninkoma pakate jha bhando bhake. <verse eid="LEV 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 23:31" />Mangahenga jhe lihengo lyolyoha, ghongo ndi nhwilo gwa machiko ghoha ghangapeta mu ibheluko ino, na popoha pimipa kutama. <verse eid="LEV 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 23:32" />Lichiko lyenie libhaha lya Kupomolela mipalwa mpunga. Kutumbulii kimiye jha lichiko lya ticha lya mwehe ade kimiye jha lichiko lilikengama.”<verse eid="LEV 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unyagho gwa ichimba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 29:12-39">Kibhalango 29:12-39</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:13-17">Kombokela 16:13-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 23:33" />Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, <verse eid="LEV 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 23:34" />“Malobholela Akaichilahele kubhehe, kubhoke lichiko lya kome nunhwano lya mwehe gwenio gwa chaba namuntendela Bhambo Chapanga unyagho gwa ichimba kwa machiko chaba. Gwenio ndi unyagho gwa kuichimu Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 23:35" />Lichiko lya kutumbula lya machiko gheniya chaba, nkonganika pamonga kunyinamila na mangahenga jhe mahengo. <verse eid="LEV 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 23:36" />Kipinde cha machiko chaba nampiya matambiko gha kukomelekeya kwa Bhambo Chapanga. Lichiko lya nane nankonganika pamonga kunyinamila na kumpiikiya Bhambo Chapanga matambiko gha kukomelekeya. Kukonganika kwenio ndi ku nhwalo gwa kunyinamila ne Bhambo Chapanga, lichiko lyenie mangahenga jhe lihengo.<verse eid="LEV 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 23:37" />“Jhenio ndi minyagho jha Bhambo Chapanga jhipangitwe, mitangicha kubhehe na makonganiko makolongwa gha kunnyinamila Bhambo Chapanga na kumpiikiya matambiko ghu kukomelekeya na litambiko lya mahuno na matambiko gha kilebhe chu kunywegha, kila litambiko itendeka mu lichiko lyake. <verse eid="LEV 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 23:38" />Matambiko gheniya ndi pamonga na ghala ghimimbiikiya nenga Bhambo Chapanga mu Lichiko lya Kupomolela, helahela matambiko ghino gha machiko ghoha, matambiko gha kutimicha nachile jhino, na matambiko ghino gha kila machiko ghimimbiikiya ne Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 23:39" />“Bhahe, kutumbuli lichiko lya kome na nhwano lya mwehe gwa chaba, kubhoke mu kuhuna mahuno ghino namuntendela unyagho Bhambo Chapanga kwa machiko chaba. Lichiko lya kutumbula nalibhaha lichiko lya Kupomolela na ata lichiko lya nane ndi lya Kupomolela hele. <verse eid="LEV 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 23:40" />Mu lichiko lya kutumbula nantola uhoe gwa mikongo jhino jhambone na mandabhe gha mitende, ghina mahamba gha mahele na mandabhe gha milebi na mangota nunhanganila unyagho gwenio palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino kwa machiko chaba. <verse eid="LEV 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 23:41" />Kila chaka mipalwa ntenda unyagho gwenio kwa Bhambo Chapanga, gwenio ubhaha nhwilo gwa kila machiko ghoha ghangapeta mu ibheluko ino yoha, gheniya namutenda mu mwehe gwa chaba. <verse eid="LEV 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 23:42" />Machiko chaba ntamangana mu ichimba. Bhando bhoha bhuku Ichilahele nabhatama mu ichimba kipinde chenio. <verse eid="LEV 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 23:43" />Kilebhe chenie nakitenda ibheluko hino imanye kubhehe chinabhohita akahoko bhabhe ku kilambo chuku Michile, nakatei bhatame mu ichimba. Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga gwino.”<verse eid="LEV 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 23:44" />Mucha ngabhatangachila Akaichilahele minyagho jha Bhambo Chapanga jhapangite.<verse eid="LEV 23:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LEV 24" />
  <para style="s">Mihilo jha kuitunja mule</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 27:20-21">Kubhoka 27:20-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 24:1" />Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, <verse eid="LEV 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 24:2" />“Malobholela bhando bhuku Ichilahele, bhannetela mahuta ghighaminyitwe mbone gha micheitune, ku nhwalo jha lumule lwenio lujhendelela kujhaka machiko ghoha. <verse eid="LEV 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 24:3" />Alune napamba mule yenio nkate jha Lihema lya Chapanga, panja jha lipanjiya lya Lichanduko lya Lilaghano kupala ijhaka nnonge jhango kilo ndaa ade lukela. Ghongo ndi nhwilo ghukukamuu machiko ghoha ghangapeta mu ibheluko ino. <verse eid="LEV 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 24:4" />Alune naibheka mule yenie panane jha kinala chukubheke mule ya chaabo jhambone ijhaka machiko ghoha nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mabumunda ghighapiwa kwa Bhambo Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 24:5" />“Tola uhembe ghunakutema, kilo kome ni ibhele nu kujhocha mabumunda kome na mabhele. <verse eid="LEV 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 24:6" />Mabumunda gheniya ghabhekwa michitale mibhele panane jha mecha jha chaabo jhambone jhibhii nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, kila nchitale mabumunda chita. <verse eid="LEV 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 24:7" />Mu kila nchitale mmeka ubane gwambone ghunungila, ibhaha chehemo jha litambiko lya kukomelekeya kupala libhaha litambiko lya ukombokelo kwa Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 24:8" />Kila Lichiko lya Kupomolela Alune naibheka mabumunda gheniya mumichitale telatela nnonge jhango ne Bhambo Chapanga, ku nhwalo gwa bhando bhuku Ichilahele, jhenio ndi mihilo jha machiko ghoha ghangapeta. <verse eid="LEV 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 24:9" />Jhenio naibha jha Alune na yana mundo, bheniya nabhalya, nhwalo lyenio ndi litambiko lilipihwa kwa nenga Bhambo Chapanga kwa mwotu. Lyenie ndi lipungu lyabhe lya machiko ghoha ghangapeta”<verse eid="LEV 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhadabulo lulupalwa kupihwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 24:10" />Lichiko limo ngaipitila bhulo kukighono, kangombo jhumo mwana jwa majhe jwaku Ichilahele na tate mundo jhuku Michile, ngakomina na munalome jhumo Mwichilahele. <verse eid="LEV 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 24:11" />Bhahe, kangombo jwenio majhe mundo akemitwa Shelomote bite Dibile jwa likabila lya Dane, jwenio ngalighita nu kulibheka nhwilo liina lya Bhambo Chapanga. Bhando bhibhakibha peniya ngabhampelika kangombo jwenio kwa Mucha, <verse eid="LEV 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 24:12" />na jwenio ngannindila nkate ade Bhambo Chapanga papakunnobholela chukuntenda kangombo jwenio.<verse eid="LEV 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 24:13" />Bhahe, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila kabhele Mucha, <verse eid="LEV 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 24:14" />“Ntola kangombo jwenio nu kumpiya panja jha kighono, na bhando bhoha bhubhajhohine palighita nabhatondobheya mabhoko ghabhe panane jha muto gwake, na peniya, bhando bhoha nabhankoma ku kumbula maghanga. <verse eid="LEV 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 24:15" />Namwe malobholela bhando bhuku Ichilahele kubhehe mundo jhojhoha jwapa kunnigha Chapanga gwake, nahadabulwa tela na uhakaho gwake. <verse eid="LEV 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 24:16" />Mundo jhojhoha abhehe nkolo kilambo amu aghene jwannigha Bhambo Chapanga, bhando bhoha nabhankoma ku kumbula maghanga.<verse eid="LEV 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 24:17" />“Mundo jhojhoha anda ankomite nnyake najwenio ipalwa akomwa, <verse eid="LEV 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 24:18" />na mundo jhojhoha jwapakukoma kinyama cha nnyake apalwa alepa kukuleta kinyama chenge chikibhi ghome, kulepechela kinyama chikikomitwe. Nhwilo ghongo ndi ughome kwa ughome.<verse eid="LEV 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 24:19" />“Mundo jhojhoha jwankochwii nnyake, na jwenio ipalwa akocholelwa ngita chankochwi nnyake. <verse eid="LEV 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 24:20" />Anda antwekwi kihupa na jwenio helahela atwekulwa kihupa ngita chenio chikitwekwilwe na liho kwa liho na lino kwa lino. Kila mundo jwannemwiye nnyake ipalwa na jwenie alepechelwa helenaha. <verse eid="LEV 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 24:21" />Mundo jwakikoma kinyama cha nnyake ipalwa kulepa kinyama chikibhi ghome, nambo mundo jhojhoha anda ankomite mundo jhonge ipalwa na jwenie hele akomwa. <verse eid="LEV 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 24:22" />Mabhoha mikamula mihilo jhenje abha nng'ene amu nkolo kilambo. Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino.”<verse eid="LEV 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 24:23" />Peniya, Mucha ngabhalobholila Akaichilahele gheniya ghoha, ngabhampelika mundo jhola jwannighite Bhambo Chapanga panja jha kighono, ngabhankomita kwa kumbula maghanga. Akaichilahele ngabhatehila telatela ngita Mucha chalaghalikilwa na Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 24:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="LEV 25" />
  <para style="s">Chaka cha chaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 15:1-11">Kombokela 15:1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 25:1" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha ku kitombe chuku Chinae, <verse eid="LEV 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 25:2" />“Malobholela Akaichilahele kubhehe, ‘Pibhapa kuhika kukilambo chanapile ne Bhambo Chapanga, mangalema jhe, kila chaka cha chaba mikileka kilambo kipomolela ku ichima jha liina lyango ne Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 25:3" />Kwa kipinde cha yaka chita milema kilambo nu kupanda, nu kukulughalila michabibo jhino nu kuhuna mahuno ghake. <verse eid="LEV 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 25:4" />Nambo mu chaka cha chaba nng'onda upomolela, ndi chaka chukupomolela, ku nhwalo alaghii Bhambo Chapanga. Nkoto kupanda mbejho jhojhoha munng'onda gwino, amu kukulughila michabibo hino. <verse eid="LEV 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 25:5" />Chochoha chikimela chenie mangahuna jhe amu kutongola chabibo kubhoke mumikongo jhangapatula. Nakibhaha chaka cha kupomolela kwa nnema. <verse eid="LEV 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 25:6" />Chochoha chikimela chene kwa chaka cha kupomolela nakibhaha chakulya chino na akabhanda bhino akanalome na akakeghe na bhando bhino bhubhakamwi mahengo na akaghene bhibhatama pamonga na mwenga, <verse eid="LEV 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 25:7" />na ipugho hino na inyama yukumanyahe itama pakate jhino.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unyagho gwa yaka makome nhwano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 25:8" />Mibhalanga yaka chaba mala chaba, kupala mma na yaka makome ncheche na ticha. <verse eid="LEV 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 25:9" />Peniya, mu lichiko lya kome lya mwehe gwa chaba ndi Lichiko lino lya Ujhelanicho na Chapanga, namuntuma mundo kuhona lipenenga mu kilambo choha. <verse eid="LEV 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 25:10" />Chaka cha makome nhwano, ndi chaka cha Bhambo Chapanga cha chukwape akabhanda bhoha uhulo kukilambo choha, mu chaka chenio ilebhe yoha ichulwichwe ibhujhichwa kwa bhibhachulwiche amu kwa yana yabhe na mundo jhojhoha jwa chulwichwa ngita mmanda abhujhichwa kwa akalongo bhake. <verse eid="LEV 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 25:11" />Nhwalo chaka chenie cha makome nhwano nakibhaha ndi Chaka cha unyagho gwa ukombochelo kwino, mangapanda jhe mbejho hilu kuhuna chochoha chikimela chenie amu kuhuna chabibo yangakulughalila. <verse eid="LEV 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 25:12" />Chaka chenie ndi chaka cha unyagho kwino, nakibhaha chaka cha nyahinyahi kwino. Yene mangalye jhe imelite yene mu mighonda.<verse eid="LEV 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 25:13" />“Mu chaka chenie cha unyagho gwa ukombochelo chochoha chikichulwichwe, kipalwa abhujhichilwa kwa nkolo chake. <verse eid="LEV 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 25:14" />Kabhele anda muchuluchii kilebhe nnyino amu kuhemela kilebhe chochoha kwa nnyino, mangamponja jhe. <verse eid="LEV 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 25:15" />Bei jha nng'onda ipalwa ilengana na yaka ihighilile kabula jhukuika yaka makome nhwano, yukubhujhichilwa jwenie. <verse eid="LEV 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 25:16" />Yaka pibhehe yamahele nanyonjokeya bei anda yaka pibhehe michoko nampongocha bei, nhwalo chikibhujhichwa nakipemwa tela na mahuno ghighapakuhunwa. <verse eid="LEV 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 25:17" />Hilu mangaponjana jhe, nambo munnyoghopa Chapanga gwino. Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino.”<verse eid="LEV 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malola gha chaka cha chaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 25:18" />“Ku yene, mikengama mihilo jhango, nu kuijhokanikiya mihilo jhango kupala ntama njelembo mu kilambo. <verse eid="LEV 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 25:19" />Kilambo nakipiya mahuno ghake na mangota nannya nu kujhukuta nu kutama mwenio njelembo.<verse eid="LEV 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 25:20" />“Nambo pange minhwachi, ‘Na tulya nike mu chaka cha chaba tukanikilwe kupanda amu kuhuna mahuno ghito?’ <verse eid="LEV 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 25:21" />Jhokanikiya! Ne chanikipela mota kilambo mu chaka cha chita na chenie nakipiya mahuno ghu kukwela kwa yaka itato. <verse eid="LEV 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 25:22" />Pumpakupanda mu chaka cha nane milya mahuno gha makacho nanyendelela kulye tugha ade mu chaka cha ticha pumpakutumbu kuhuna kabhele.<verse eid="LEV 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mipalwa kughombola nng'onda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 25:23" />“Mangachulucha jhe nnema nhwalo nnema ndi gwango nenga na mangota akaghene tugha na hele akapeta ndela mu kilambo chango.<verse eid="LEV 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 25:24" />“Nnema gwoha ghupakutola kubhehe gwino mipalwa kukombola nnema yane kuheme kabhele. <verse eid="LEV 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 25:25" />Anda nnongo gwino ndi nhwocho, ngachulwicha nng'onda gwake, nnongo mundo jwa pahina hake aghombola nng'onda gwenio. <verse eid="LEV 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 25:26" />Anda mundo jwenio akwetii jhe nnongo mundo jwa pahina jwapala kughombola, nambo kubhoke peniya, ahoto kupata mbijha, ahoto kughombola nng'onda gwake. <verse eid="LEV 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 25:27" />Nabhalanga yaka kubhoke pachulwicha nu kulepa, chikijhonjikike amujhichila mundo jwahemile, jwenio napalwa amujhichila nng'onda gwake. <verse eid="LEV 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 25:28" />Nambo anda abhichepa kughombola, bhahe nnema gwenio nauhighala kwa jwahemi ade chaka cha Unyagho gwa ukombochelo gwa yaka makome nhwano. Mu chaka chenie ipalwa nng'onda gwenio bhamujhichila nkolo nng'onda.<verse eid="LEV 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 25:29" />“Kabhele anda mundo achulwiche nyumba jhake jhu kutama jhibhii mu muche ghutindikilwe mapamanda, jwenio ahoto kughombola mu chaka chimo kubhoke mu kuchulucha kwake. Kwa chaka chenio choha ahoto kuighombola. <verse eid="LEV 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 25:30" />Anda nyumba jhenio ibhii nkate jhikilambo chikitindikilwe mapamanda ikombolii jhe mu chaka chimo, bhahe naibha jhake jwahemile machiko ghoha ghangapeta na kuibheluko yake yoha hilu nabhujhicha jhe mu Chaka cha Unyagho gwa ukombokelo gwa chaka cha makome nhwano. <verse eid="LEV 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 25:31" />Nambo chenda yangatindikilwa lipamanda, nibhalangwa ngita mighonda. Peniya, ihoto kughombolelwa kwa kipinde cha chaka chimo nu kumujhichila nkolo nyumba mu Chaka cha Unyagho gwa ukombokelo gwa chaka cha makome nhwano. <verse eid="LEV 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 25:32" />Pamo na gheniya, nyumba jhibhii kubomane bhibhatama Akalabhe jhichulwichwe ihoto kughombolelwa kipinde chochoha. <verse eid="LEV 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 25:33" />Anda Nnabhe alepalile kughombola nyumba jhake ichulwichwe kwa kipinde cha chaka chimo mumuche ghubhatama Akalabhe, bhahe nyumba jhenie ibhujhichwa kwa nkolo jhake mu Chaka cha Unyagho gwa ukombokelo gwa chaka cha makome nhwano. Ku nhwalo yenio bhapeilwa kubhehe yabhe pakate jha Akaichilahele machiko ghoha ghangapeta. <verse eid="LEV 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 25:34" />Nambo chehemo jha kuluchi inyama ya itindila miche ya Akalabhe yangachuluchwa jhe, nhwalo peniya bhapeilwe ku nhwalo gwa bheniya machiko ghoha ghangapeta.<verse eid="LEV 25:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghalikilo gha kwajhaikicha akahocho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 25:35" />“Anda nnongo gwino Mwichilahele jwatama pakate jhino abhii nhwocho, ahoto jhe kukitangatila jwene, mipalwa untangatila ajhendelela kutama pamonga na mwenga, ngita chintangatila nng'ene amu mpeta ndela jwabhii kwino. <verse eid="LEV 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 25:36" />Mangapala jhe annepa nyonjekeo kwa chela chunnyaike. Nambo munyinamila Chapanga kupala nnongo gwino apata kutama pamonga na mwenga. <verse eid="LEV 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 25:37" />Mangankopecha jhe mbijha kwa nyonjekelo amu kumpe chakulya kupala annepa nyonjekelo. <verse eid="LEV 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 25:38" />Nkombokela kubhehe ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, jwanimmohita kuhumii kukilambo chuku Michile kupala nimpelengane kilambo chuku Kanaane, kupala nenga mmehe Chapanga gwino.<verse eid="LEV 25:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghalikilo gha kwalekekeya akabhanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 25:39" />“Anda nnongo gwino Mwichilahele jwatama pamonga na mwenga abhii nhwocho, akichulwiche kwino, mangantenda jhe antumikila ngita mmanda. <verse eid="LEV 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 25:40" />Natama na mwenga ngita ntumiche jwalepwa amu mpeta ndela. Nantumikila ade kuika chaka cha Unyagho gwa ukombokelo gwa chaka cha makome nhwano. <verse eid="LEV 25:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 25:41" />Chaka chenie ipalwa jwenio na yana mundo bhalekekelwa, jwenie abhujha kwa akalongo mundo na uliche gwa akatate mundo, <verse eid="LEV 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 25:42" />ku nhwalo Akaichilahele ndi akatumiche bhango, bheniya nganabhohita kukilambo chuku Michile, bhahe, bhangachuluchwa jhe ngita akabhanda. <verse eid="LEV 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 25:43" />Mangantende jhe ukokotoko kwa akalongo bhino kwa Akaichilahele, nambo munyinamila Chapanga gwino. <verse eid="LEV 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 25:44" />Anda mipala kwapata akabhanda akakeghe na akanalome, mihoto kwahemela kubhoke kwa bhando bhi ilambo henge ya pahina. <verse eid="LEV 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 25:45" />Kabhele, mihoto kwahemela akabhanda kuhumii kwa akaghene bhibhatama pamonga na mwenga na akalongo bhabhe bhibhabhelwike mu kilambo chino, namangota nabhabha bhino. <verse eid="LEV 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 25:46" />Anda mabhene nhwile, akabhanda bheniya mihoto kwakamuya kwa yana ino bhabhaha uliche gwabhe machiko ghoha ghangapeta. Bheniya mihoto kwatenda akabhanda bhino, nambo ku nhwalo gwa nnongo gwino Mwichilahele mangantende jhe kukokotoko.<verse eid="LEV 25:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 25:47" />“Anda nng'ene amu mpeta ndela jwaitama pakate jhino abhii na ilebhe mbwe na nnongo gwino abhii nhocho nu kukichulucha kwa nng'ene amu kwa mpeta ndela amu kwa jhumo pakate jha akalongo bhake, <verse eid="LEV 25:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 25:48" />ahoto kughombolelwa kubhoke pakichulwicha. Jhumo pakate jha nnongo mundo ahoto hele kunkombola. <verse eid="LEV 25:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 25:49" />Njomba mundo ahoto kunkombola, amu mwana jwa njomba mundo amu nnongo mundo jwa pahina mulukolo lwake, ahoto helahela kukikombola jwenie anda abhii nu uhotolo gwa kutenda yenio. <verse eid="LEV 25:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 25:50" />Jwenio pamonga na jwanhemile jhola nabhatenda, nabhabhalanga yaka kutumbulii pakichulwicha ade chaka chu Unyagho gwa kukombokela gwa yaka makome nhwano. Bei jhukuchuluchwa kwake ibha tela na kibhalango cha yaka yake yantumikile. Kipinde chakibha mmanda jwa munahota gwake nakipemwa ngita kipinde cha ntumiche jwalepwa. <verse eid="LEV 25:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 25:51" />Anda kibhalango cha yaka ade chaka chu Unyagho gwa kukombokela cha yaka makome nhwano ndi yamahena hake, bhahe alepa bei ngolongwa kupeta bei jhukunhemela. <verse eid="LEV 25:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 25:52" />Kabhele anda ihighilike yaka yandina tugha ade chaka chu Unyagho ghukukombokela kwa chaka cha makome nhwano, abhalangilwa yaka kulengana na yaka ihighilike nu kulepa chiipalwa. <verse eid="LEV 25:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 25:53" />Kipinde choha chapakubhehe kwa munahota gwake ipalwa ahengelwa ngita ntumiche jwalepwa kila chaka. Jwenio jwanhemile angantende jhe ukokotoko. <verse eid="LEV 25:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 25:54" />Nambo anda mundo jwenio na akalongo mundo bhankombwii jhe kwa ndela jhenie, bhahe, nalekekelwa mu chaka cha Unyagho gwa ukombokelo gwa yaka makome nhwano. <verse eid="LEV 25:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 25:55" />Akaichilahele ndi akatumiche bhango, nhwalo nganabhohita ku kilambo chuku Michile. Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino.<verse eid="LEV 25:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="LEV 26" />
  <para style="s">Mota kwa bhibhannyokanikiya Bhambo Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 7:12-24">Kombokela 7:12-24</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:1-14">28:1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 26:1" />“Mangatendekeya jhe inyagho yoyoha ya ichapanga yoyoha, mangakamuu jhe inyagho yabhe yukubhacha hilu inala amu inyagho ya maghanga ghighaokonywilwe mu kilambo chino, kupala mughajhinamila. Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino. <verse eid="LEV 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 26:2" />Maghakamula machiko ghango gha Kupomolela, nu kulitembekeya Lihema lyango lya nyahinyahi. Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 26:3" />“Anda muikamwile nhwilo gwango nu kukengama malaghalikilo ghango nu kubhehe, <verse eid="LEV 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 26:4" />peniya, nainkomela hula kipinde chikipalwa kilambo nakipiya mahuno ghamahele, na mikongo jha kumighonda naipambika uhoe gwake. <verse eid="LEV 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 26:5" />Nanyendelela kuhuna mahuno gha chakulya ade kipinde chukuhuna chabibo, na kipinde chukuhunwa chabibo ade kipinde chukupanda mbejho. Namma na chakulya chamahena nu kutama njelembo mu kilambo chino.<verse eid="LEV 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 26:6" />“Nanimpela uteeke mu kilambo nang'ogholoka changa jhoghopa kilebhe chochoha. Naniingangila kutale inyama ikale mu kilambo chino na kilambo chino naipitii ng'o ngondo. <verse eid="LEV 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 26:7" />Namabhenga akamakoko bhino na kwakoma ku upanga. <verse eid="LEV 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 26:8" />Na bhando nhwano bha kajhino nabhabhenga akamakoko miya jhimo, na bhando miya kuhumii kwino bhihoto kwabhenga akamakoko elufo kome. Akamakoko bhino nabhakomelekelwa palonge jhino kwa upanga. <verse eid="LEV 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 26:9" />Nanimpela mota nu kummeka mpatangana yana twe nu kujhonjekeka, na nenga nanilibheka nganganga Lilaghano lyango kwino. <verse eid="LEV 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 26:10" />Kipinde cha mahuno namma mwamela makalye mahuno gha makacho, kabhele naimpala ata ghala gha chaka chikipetite namughabhoha kupala kubheka mahuno mayono. <verse eid="LEV 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 26:11" />Na nenga chandatama pakate jhino mu lihema lya Chapanga, hilu naninnekangana jhe. <verse eid="LEV 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 26:12" />Nanenga namma pakate jhino nanenga namma Chapanga gwino na mangota namma mabhando bhango. <verse eid="LEV 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 26:13" />Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, jhunimmohita kukilambo chuku Michile kupala mangabhe jhe akabhanda bhuku Michile. Nenga mohite lingolengole mu mitandala jhino nu kuntenda ntyanga changa jhoghopa.”<verse eid="LEV 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhangajhoha nabhahadabulwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 28:15-68">Kombokela 28:15-68</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 26:14" />Bhambo Chambanga ngajhendilila kulonge, “Nambo anda namunyokanikii jhe, amu kuikengama mihilo jhango, <verse eid="LEV 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 26:15" />mangota anda mpuchite kuikengama mihilo jhango, na kuichimwa malaghalikilo ghango nu kulepelela kuikengama mihilo jhango jhoha nu kulitwekuu lilaghano lyango, <verse eid="LEV 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 26:16" />bhahe, nenga nandenda kumbula kukunete kiholo kikolongwa chakuchitukila, na kunnetela malwalo gha kunkoma, na malwalo ghu kunkojholana miho na kuntenda nkombale. Nampanda mbejho nambo kibhii jhe chipakujhambulila, nambo akamakoko bhino ndi bhibhapa kulye. <verse eid="LEV 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 26:17" />Ne naning'alambuka kupala mangota mpomondwa na akamakoko bhino, nannongochwa na bhibhanchimwa. Nabhanyoghowa nakutila kongo abhii jhe mundo jhojhoha jwammutuwa.<verse eid="LEV 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 26:18" />“Nu kubhoke pukuhadabula yene, anda naunnyokonikiya jhe, bhahe, naninchwapula mala pachaba hake, ku nhwalo gwa uhakaho gwino. <verse eid="LEV 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 26:19" />Lighoho lino nanikikangila kutale kukutenda kunane kwa Chapanga okwo kubha kujhomo ngita choma, na hula naikoma jhe mukilambo chino na nnema gwino nubhaha nnyomo ngita shaba. <verse eid="LEV 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 26:20" />Nantumila makakala ghino jhajhe nhwalo mighonda naipiya jhe mahuno na mikongo jha kilambo chino naipambika jhe uhoe.<verse eid="LEV 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 26:21" />“Anda nnyendelii kubhehe akamakoko bhango nu kukana kunnyokanikiya, nanyonjekeya kabhele luhadabulo lwino mala pachaba kulenganii kujholoka kwa uhakaho gwino. <verse eid="LEV 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 26:22" />Naninnetela inyama ikale pakate jhino yenie naipukila yana ino nu kulye ipugho ino, na kumpongocha, na ndela jhino pabhe jhe bhando bhukupeta.<verse eid="LEV 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 26:23" />“Ata nyomolele kunhadabula mammela mingana kunnyokanikiya nenga, nambo michocha kungana nenga, <verse eid="LEV 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 26:24" />bhahe, na nenga naninkanangana mangota nu kwahadabula mala pachaba kuchocha, ku nhwalo gwa uhakaho gwino. <verse eid="LEV 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 26:25" />Chaninnetela ngondo kwino, jhipakwabula kupala kulepa mabhoho nhwalo mulitwekwii Lilaghano. Mangota mmutukila mu miche jhino, nambo chanimpelekela malwalo mabhoho nu kuntenda nnepelele kwa akamakoko bhino. <verse eid="LEV 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 26:26" />Chambongocha chakulya chino, na ata akakeghe kome nabhatelekela kiinja chimo tu kuunyii mabumunda. Nabhammaghulila ku ipemo, na ata nnyakila bhole namujhukuta jhe.<verse eid="LEV 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 26:27" />“Kabhele kubhoke pa gheniya, ghoha mamela minyokanikia jhe nu kujhendele kungana, <verse eid="LEV 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 26:28" />bhahe, na nenga ninkanangana mangota kwa lilaka hake, na kunhadabula kupeta mala chaba kwa makakala kuchocha ku nhwalo jha uhakaho gwino. <verse eid="LEV 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 26:29" />Njala naibhaha ngolongwa muno kwino, ade namijhakila yana ino inalome na ikeghe. <verse eid="LEV 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 26:30" />Nanhangabhana chehemo jhino jha kujhinamii ku itombe, nandilulana chehemo jhino jhukuhukilikii ubane na kutaghii malelo ghino panane jha inyagho ya ichapanga ino. Na nenga naninchimwangana hake. <verse eid="LEV 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 26:31" />Naniitenda miche ino kubhehe mahame na kuhangabhana chehemo jhino panyahinyahi pukunnyinamii nenga Bhambo Chapanga, na luhumba lwambone lwa matimbiko ghino na lujheketelwa ng'o. <verse eid="LEV 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 26:32" />Chanhangabhana kilambo chino, ade akamakoko bhibhahami mwenio nabhankangacha. <verse eid="LEV 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 26:33" />Chaninnetela ngondo jhipakuntenda mpechangine na kujhenda mu ilambo yuughene. Kilambo chino nakihangabhanwa na miche naihighilika kubhehe mahame. <verse eid="LEV 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 26:34" />Mangota namma mu mabhoko gha akamakoko bhino, peniya, kilambo pikipala kuhanganila kupomole kwake kipinde kilambo pikipala kubhehe mu ukebha. Kilambo nakipomolela nu kuhanganila kupomolela kwake. <verse eid="LEV 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 26:35" />Kipinde choha kilambo pipakubhehe mu ukebha kilambo naihanganila kupomolela kwake nukuhanganila kupomolela kwake kipinde chenie kipatikine jhe mu kupomolela kwino pumatamita mwenio.”<verse eid="LEV 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 26:36" />“Na bhando bhange pakate jhino bhibhapakuighala mu ilambo ya akamakoko bhabhe chanatenda kujhoghopa umiojho jhabhe, ilambo ya akamakoko bhabhe ata lihamba pilipakugwehe nammutuka. Nabhabhutuka ngita mundo chabhutuka ngondo. Nabhabhutuka nu kugwe na abhii jhe mundo jwabhabhutuya. <verse eid="LEV 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 26:37" />Nabhagwelelana ngita mundo jwatila ngondo ata abhii jhe jwammengabhenga. Nabhabhe jhe ni makakala ghoghoha ghakwahoto akamakaoko bhino. <verse eid="LEV 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 26:38" />Nanyomokela mu ilambo ya bhando bhange, bhando bha kilambo chenio nabhantenda muhweghe. <verse eid="LEV 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 26:39" />Anda bhange pakate jhino bhalamite mu kilambo cha akamakoko bhino nabhakombala nu kuhwegha ku nhwalo gwa uhakaho gwabhe, na ku nhwalo gwa uhakaho gwa akanahota bhabhe.<verse eid="LEV 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 26:40" />“Nambo anda ibheluko ino ngabhajheketile kuuleka uhakaho gwabhe nu kung'alambukila nenga na uhakaho gwa akanahota bhabhe panane jha malemwa ghibhateila kwa nenga, na kungana kwabhe nenga, <verse eid="LEV 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 26:41" />ngabhamanye ku nhwalo gwa nike, nganakanita na kwapeleka kukilambo cha akamakoko bhabhe, anda chakaka mwojho jhabhe gwa lighoho utembekiye na kunyeketela uhakaho nu kung'alambukila, <verse eid="LEV 26:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 26:42" />bhahe, nanenga nanilikomboka lilaghano lyango lyamekite na Ulahimo na Ichaka na Yakobu, na kukomboka kilambo chela chanalaghila. <verse eid="LEV 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 26:43" />Kipinde chibhapakubhe panja jha kilambo chabhe, kilambo chenie nakihanganila kupomolela kwake, pikipala kubhehe muukebha, pibhakibha kuughene. Kipinde chenie, bheniya nabhahadabulwa na bheniye nabhalela <verse eid="LEV 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 26:44" />Nambo pamonga na gheniya ghoha pibhakubhehe mu kilambo cha akamakoko bhabhe, nenga chanaleka jhe, amu kwachimwa amu kwakomelekeya njwe, nu kutweku lilaghano lyango. <verse eid="LEV 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 26:45" />Nambo Kunhwalo gwabhe chanilikomboka lilaghano lyandeile nu akanahota bhabhe bheniya nganabhohita kukilambo chuku Michile, bhando bha ilambo henge bhakalolagha, kupala mma Chapanga jwabhe. Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="LEV 26:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 26:46" />Jhenie ndi mihilo na malaghalikilo ghapeilwa Mucha na Bhambo Chapanga kwapela bhando bhuku Ichilahele ku kitombe chuku Chinae.<verse eid="LEV 26:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="LEV 27" />
  <para style="s">Nhwilo kuhwalo gwa hupo kwa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 27:1" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, <verse eid="LEV 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 27:2" />“Malobholele bhando bhu ku Ichilahele kubhehe, anda mundo abhekite nachile jhukumpiya mundo kwa Bhambo Chapanga, mundo jwenio ahoto kupiya nachile jhake kukulepa mbijha jhibhekwitwe tela na mbijha chibhekwite ngita yene. <verse eid="LEV 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 27:3" />Munalome jwa yaka makome mabhelele ade yaka makome chita naghombolwa kwa ipande amchine ya madine gha feza kulengana ni kipemo cha Lihema lya Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 27:4" />Anda mwikeghe, naghombolelwa kwa ipande makome matato gha madine gha feza. <verse eid="LEV 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 27:5" />Anda mundo jwenio jwa yaka nhwano ade makome mabhele naghombolwa kwa ipande makome mabhele gha madine gha feza, anda mwinkeghe ipande kome ya madine gha feza. <verse eid="LEV 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 27:6" />Anda mwana jwa mwehe ghumo ade yaka nhwano naghombolwa kwa ipande nhwano ya madine gha feza, anda mwana mwikeghe naghombolwa kwa ipande itato ya madine gha feza. <verse eid="LEV 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 27:7" />Anda mundo jwa yaka makome chita na kujhendelela, kwa munalome naghombolelwa ku ipande kome nu nhwano na kwa mwikeghe naghombolelwa kwa ipande kome ya madine gha feza.<verse eid="LEV 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 27:8" />“Nambo anda mundo jwenio jwabhekite nachile ndi nhwocho hake ahoto jhe kulepa malepo ghighabhekitwe, bhahe mundo jwenio napelekwa kwa mpiya litambiko. Jwenio naamulicha bei jhake tela na mundo jwenio jwabhekite nachile.<verse eid="LEV 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 27:9" />“Anda nachile jhenie ku nhwalo gwa kinyama, bhando bhimpiikiya Bhambo Chapanga litambiko, bhahe, kinyama chenie kibhaha kinyahinyahi. <verse eid="LEV 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 27:10" />Naijheketelwa jhe kujhangangana kinyama chenio kwa kinyama chenge chochoha, kinyama chambone kwa kinyama changanandela amu kinyama changanandela na kwa kinyama chambone. Anda bhatei yene inyama yoha ibhele na ibhaha ya nyahinyahi, kwa Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 27:11" />Anda nachile yene, akibhekii kinyama changajheketelwa kwa Bhambo Chapanga, yane changapalwa kumpiikiya Bhambo chapanga, kinyama chenie kipalwa kiletwa kwa mpiya litambiko, <verse eid="LEV 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 27:12" />na mpiya litambiko jwenio nakilingukiya kinyama chenie anda kibhi mbone amu kihakanaho. Bei jhapakulongela mpiya litambiko, ndi ipakubhe. <verse eid="LEV 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 27:13" />Nambo jwenie ipalwa kukighombola kinyama chenie, apalwa ajhonjekeya lipungu limo pakate jha makome nhwano jha bei jhi kinyama chenie.<verse eid="LEV 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 27:14" />“Mundo anda apiite nyumba jhake kubhehe jha Bhambo Chapanga, mpiya litambiko nailingukiya nyumba jhenie anda jhinakuhalala amu ihalii jhe. Bei jhipakulongelwa na mpiya litambiko, ibha jhejhe. <verse eid="LEV 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 27:15" />Anda mundo jwaipiite nyumba jhake apakuighombola, apalwa ajhonjekeya lipungu limo pakate jha mapungu nhwano gwa bei jhake, na nyumba jhenie naibha jhake.<verse eid="LEV 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 27:16" />“Anda mundo apiite kipande chake cha nng'onda gwa uliche kubhehe gwa Bhambo Chapanga, bei jhake jhibhekwite tela na mbejho ipalwa kupandwa munng'onda gwenio, kwa kilo makome mabhele ya chaile bei jhake ibha ipande amuchine gha maghanga gha madine gha feza. <verse eid="LEV 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 27:17" />Anda mundo aupiite nng'onda gwake chaka cha Unyagho gwa kukombokela yaka makome nhwano, bei jhipalwa jhibha jhejhejhene. <verse eid="LEV 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 27:18" />Nambo anda mundo jwapiite nng'onda gwake kubhoke pa Unyagho gwa kukombokela yaka makome nhwano, mpiya litambiko nabheka bei jhake tela na yaka iighalii kuiki chaka cha Unyagho gwenio na bei ipalwa ipongochwa. <verse eid="LEV 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 27:19" />Anda jwenie jwapiite kubhehe gha Bhambo Chapanga apala kuighombola, bhahe, apalwa ajhonjekeya lipungu limo pakate jha mapungu nhwano jha bei jhake, na nng'onda gwenio naubha gwake kabhele. <verse eid="LEV 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 27:20" />Nambo anda apahi jhe kuughombola amu mpiya litambiko anchuluchile mundo jhonge, bhahe, nng'onda gwenio uhoto jhe kughombolelwa kabhele. <verse eid="LEV 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 27:21" />Nng'onda upalwa ughombolwa chaka cha unyagho gwa kombokela yaka makome nhwano yane, ubha nyahinyahi, ngita nng'onda chiupiitwa kwa Bhambo Chapanga, gwenio ubha gwa mpiya litambiko.<verse eid="LEV 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 27:22" />“Kabhele anda mundo apiite nng'onda gwake gwahemile kubhehe gwa Bhambo Chapanga, yane gwangabhe nng'onda gwa uliche gwake, <verse eid="LEV 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 27:23" />na mpiya litambiko naamulicha bei jha nng'onda gwenio ku kulenganii na yaka iighalile kuiki chaka chu unyagho gwa ukombokelo gwa yaka makome nhwano, na mundo jwenio ipalwa kulepa bei jhake mulichiko lyenio ngita kilebhe nyahinyahi kwa Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 27:24" />Nambo mu chaka chu Unyagho gwa ukombokelo kwa yaka makome nhwano, nng'onda gwenio abhujhichilwa jhola jwachulwiche.<verse eid="LEV 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 27:25" />“Kila bei ibhekitwe tela na bei jha ipande ya madine gha feza itumika mu Lihema lya Chapanga. Utopaho gwa gilamo miya ibhele gha madine gha feza.<verse eid="LEV 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 27:26" />“Ipalwa jhe kukipiya kibheluko chukulobhoka chi kinyama, nhwalo chenie ndi cha Bhambo Chapanga, abha ng'ombi amu limbelele. <verse eid="LEV 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 27:27" />Kinyama changajheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga kupihwa litambiko palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, jhuna kinyama chake ipalwa kuhemela kwa bei jhibhekitwe, na ajhonjekeya lipungu limo kate jha mapungu nhwano gha bei jhenio. Anda aghombwilwe jhe, kinyama chenie nakichuluchwa kwa bei jhibhekitwe.<verse eid="LEV 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 27:28" />“Nambo kilebhe chochoha chikibhekitwe kwa Bhambo Chapanga, ibhaha mundo amu kinyama amu nng'onda gwa ubhujhilo, kihoto kuchuluchwa amu kughombolelwa. Chochoha chikipiitwe kubhehe cha Bhambo Chapanga ndi kinyahinyahi hake. <verse eid="LEV 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 27:29" />Mundo jhojhoha jwabhekitwe kilebhe kibhohojwapiite akomwa, kupala angakighombo jhe. Mundo jwenio apalwa akomwa.”<verse eid="LEV 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 27:30" />Zaka ya mahuno libha lya mahuno amu uhoe gwa mikongo, ndi yoha ya Bhambo Chapanga, ndi nyahinyahi kwa Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 27:31" />Anda mundo apala kughombola zaka ya litambiko, apalwa kujhonjekeya zaka jha bei jhake. <verse eid="LEV 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 27:32" />Ku nhwalo gwa ipugho pibhalangwa, kila kinyama cha kome ndi cha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 27:33" />Mundo jhojhoha apalwa jhe kukonya anda kinyama chenie kihalile amu kihalii jhe hilu kinyama chenie mangajhangangana jhe na kinyama chenge. Anda nnyangangine na kinyama chenge, inyama yoha ibhele naibha nyahinyahi, naighombolelwa jhe.<verse eid="LEV 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 27:34" />Gwenio ndi nhwilo Bhambo Chapanga gwannaghalikiya Mucha pi kitombe chuku Chinae, kupala bhalobholela Akaichilahele.<verse eid="LEV 27:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 27" />
</usx>